Weighted splits traffic by proportion, which is useful for testing a new version on a small share of users.

2361
03:25:26,382 --> 03:25:30,628
延迟模式将用户引导至响应最快的区域。
Latency sends users to whichever region responds fastest for them.

2362
03:25:31,566 --> 03:25:38,084
故障转移模式将流量发送到主端点，并在健康检查失败时切换到备用端点。
Failover sends traffic to a primary and switches to a standby when health checks fail.

2363
