03:34:43,726 --> 03:34:51,748
为了控制应用，数据必须持续传输且具有可预测的延迟，并且有预算用于专用基础设施。
Data must move continuously with predictable latency for a control application and there is budget for dedicated infrastructure.

2474
03:34:52,270 --> 03:34:57,732
他们还希望在一周内建立一个成本较低的连接，以便在主链路准备好之前开始测试。
It also wants a lower cost connection in place within a week to begin testing before the main link is ready.

2475
03:34:58,350 --> 03:35:00,964
选择暂停并思考。
Choose to pause and decide.

2476
03:35:07,054 --> 03:35:09,028
答案是 A 和 B。
The answers are A and B.

2477
03:35:09,454 --> 03:35:14,084
这个场景包含两个不同的时间跨度，每个跨度对应一个服务。
The scenario contains two different timescales and each one selects a service.

2478
03:35:17,166 --> 03:35:21,860
有预算的专用基础设施和可预测的延迟指向 Direct Connect。
Predictable latency with budget for dedicated infrastructure points at Direct Connect.

2479
03:35:22,766 --> 03:35:28,160
在一周内建立连接指向 VPN，因为 Direct Connect 需要数周时间来配置。
In place within a week, points at a VPN because Direct Connect takes weeks to provision.

2480
03:35:28,622 --> 03:35:31,748
这种组合在实际部署中也很常见。
This pairing is common in real deployments too.

2481
03:35:32,302 --> 03:35:40,420
先建立 VPN 以实现快速连接，之后通常将其作为 Direct Connect 链路的备份路径。
A VPN is set up first for immediate connectivity and often kept afterwards as a backup path for the Direct Connect link.

2482
03:35:42,062 --> 03:35:43,108
实战案例。
Worked scenario.

2483
03:35:44,080 --> 03:35:49,120
7. 一家公司已经扩展到跨多个团队的 40 个 VPC。
7. A company has grown to 40 VPCs across several teams.

2484
03:35:49,582 --> 03:35:54,308
他们越来越需要彼此之间以及与公司数据中心进行通信。
They increasingly need to communicate with one another and with the corporate data center.

2485
03:35:55,278 --> 03:36:02,480
网络团队正在维护大量且不断增加的独立对等连接，并希望有一个统一的地方来管理这些。
The network team is maintaining a large and growing number of individual peering connections and wants a single place to manage this.

2486
03:36:02,766 --> 03:36:04,612
它应该采用哪种服务？
Which service should it adopt?

2487
03:36:06,158 --> 03:36:07,268
暂停并思考。
Pause and decide.

2488
03:36:13,422 --> 03:36:14,532
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

2489
03:36:15,118 --> 03:36:22,180
关键短语是“大量且不断增加的独立对等连接”，因为它描述的是网状网络，而网状网络的扩展非常麻烦。
The deciding phrase is a large and growing number of individual peering connections because that describes a mesh and meshes grow badly.

2490
03:36:22,734 --> 03:36:26,180
如果 40 个 VPC 全部配对，将需要数百个连接。
40 VPCs fully paired would need hundreds of connections.

2491
03:36:27,566 --> 03:36:32,228
Transit Gateway 用枢纽取代网状网络，这样每个 VPC 只需连接一次。
Transit Gateway replaces the mesh with a hub, so each VPC connects once.

2492
03:36:33,198 --> 03:36:37,156
选项 C 是因为本模块前面提到的名称冲突。
Option C is here as the name collision from earlier in the module.

2493
03:36:37,552 --> 03:36:43,012
API、Gateway 和 Transit Gateway 虽然共用一个词，但功能完全不同。
API, Gateway, and Transit Gateway share a word and do entirely unrelated jobs.

2494
03:36:44,558 --> 03:36:45,604
这个案例做对了。
Worked scenario.

2495
03:36:46,126 --> 03:36:49,796
8. 一家公司正在发布其网站的新版本。
8. A company is releasing a new version of its website.

2496
03:36:50,318 --> 03:36:57,156
它希望将 10% 的访问者引导至新版本，而 90% 的用户留在当前版本，以便对比错误率。
It wants 10% of visitors sent to it and 90% kept on the current version so it can compare error rates.

2497
03:36:57,646 --> 03:37:01,284
两个版本都在同一个区域的各自负载均衡器后面运行。
Both versions run behind their own load balancers in the same region.

2498
03:37:02,094 --> 03:37:05,572
它应该使用哪种 Route 53 路由策略？
Which Route 53 routing policy should it use?

2499
03:37:06,192 --> 03:37:07,748
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2500
03:37:13,934 --> 03:37:15,012
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

2501
03:37:15,632 --> 03:37:20,644
明确的百分比分配总是指加权路由，这就是整个问题的核心。
A stated percentage split is always weighted routing, and that is the whole question.

2502
03:37:21,072 --> 03:37:25,220
但注意最后一句：两个版本都在同一个区域运行。
But notice the final sentence that both versions run in the same region.

2503
03:37:25,632 --> 03:37:28,676
这句话是为了排除基于延迟的路由。
That is placed there to eliminate latency-based routing.

2504
03:37:29,646 --> 03:37:34,852
由于两个端点都在同一个区域，不存在可以作为判断依据的延迟差异。
With both endpoints in one region, there is no latency difference for it to act on.

2505
03:37:35,438 --> 03:37:41,072
题目中的某些条款往往只是为了排除掉某一个特定的错误选项。
Scenarios often add a clause whose only job is to close off one specific wrong answer.

2506
03:37:42,382 --> 03:37:53,312
回顾一下，子网之所以是公有或私有纯粹是因为它的路由表。出站允许、入站不允许意味着 NAT 网关；而屏蔽某个地址则意味着网络。
To recap, a subnet is public or private purely because of its root table. Outbound, yes, with inbound no means a NAT gateway, while blocking one address means a network.

2507
03:37:54,574 --> 03:37:58,500
流量严禁经过公共互联网，这意味着使用 VPC 终端节点。
Traffic that must not cross the public internet means a VPC endpoint.

2508
03:37:59,182 --> 03:38:05,700
CloudFront 提供缓存和 HTTP 内容，而 Global Accelerator 则能优化任何协议的路径。
CloudFront caches, HTTP content, while global accelerator improves the path for any protocol.

2509
03:38:06,272 --> 03:38:12,484
可预测的意味着 Direct Connect，快速且廉价意味着 VPN，这两者经常结合使用。
Predictable means direct connect, quick and cheap means VPN, and the two are often used together.

2510
03:38:12,974 --> 03:38:15,332
下一个模块：监控与管理。
Next module, monitoring and management.

2511
03:38:17,038 --> 03:38:21,956
这个模块包含整个题库分析中出现频率最高的组合。
This module contains the most frequently co-occurring group in the entire bank analysis.

2512
03:38:22,478 --> 03:38:27,684
Cloud Trail 和 CloudWatch 同时出现的次数有 23 次，而且 Config 经常和它们一起出现。
Cloud Trail and CloudWatch appear together 23 times and config joins them constantly.

2513
03:38:28,366 --> 03:38:29,924
它们并不是相似的服务。
They are not similar services.

2514
03:38:30,798 --> 03:38:37,872
它们是针对三个不同问题的三个答案，考试要求你把它们区分开来。
They are three answers to three different questions, and the exam relies on you separating them.

2515
03:38:39,152 --> 03:38:42,532
记住这三个问题，这个模块就搞定了。
Hold these three questions and this module resolves.

2516
03:38:42,832 --> 03:38:44,032
它的表现如何？
How is it behaving?

2517
03:38:44,192 --> 03:38:45,476
这是 CloudWatch。
Which is CloudWatch?

2518
03:38:46,192 --> 03:38:48,292
是谁做的，这是 Cloud Trail。
Who did it, which is Cloud Trail?

2519
03:38:48,592 --> 03:38:52,228
配置是什么？有没有变化？这是 Config。
What was the configuration and has it changed? Which is config?

2520
03:38:52,672 --> 03:38:56,964
这个领域的每一个问题，其实都是这三个问题换了种说法而已。
Every question in this area is one of those three wearing different clothes.

2521
03:38:57,792 --> 03:39:02,212
你的第一步是搞清楚这个场景到底在问什么。
Your first move is to work out which one the scenario is actually asking.

2522
03:39:03,790 --> 03:39:09,028
这张表就是区分点，它列出了每个服务实际产生的证据类型。
Here is the separator in one table with the kind of evidence each service actually produces.

2523
03:39:09,486 --> 03:39:14,084
CloudWatch 回答性能如何，它的证据是测量数据。
CloudWatch answers, how is it performing and its evidence is a measurement.

2524
03:39:14,638 --> 03:39:17,892
比如 CPU 达到 90% 或状态检查失败。
CPU at 90% or a failed status check.

2525
03:39:18,638 --> 03:39:24,580
CloudRail 回答是谁在什么时候做的，其证据是名称、身份和 API 调用记录。
CloudRail answers who did that and when, and its evidence names and identity and an AP icon.

2526
03:39:25,454 --> 03:39:31,268
Config 回答设置是什么，其证据是一段时间内的配置状态。
Config answers, what was it set to, and its evidence is a configuration state over a period of time.

2527
03:39:32,206 --> 03:39:35,072
也就是指标、操作者或设置。
A metric, an actor, or a setting.

2528
03:39:36,272 --> 03:39:38,884
CloudWatch 有四个值得了解的部分。
CloudWatch has four parts worth knowing.

2529
03:39:39,312 --> 03:39:45,476
指标是随时间变化的数值测量，大多数 AWS 服务会自动发布这些数据。
Metrics are numeric measurements over time, and most AWS services publish them automatically.

2530
03:39:46,032 --> 03:39:51,172
日志收集你发送给它的应用程序和系统日志文件，并且可以对它们进行查询。
Logs collects application and system log files you send to it and can query them.

2531
03:39:51,792 --> 03:39:55,872
警报监控指标，并在其超过阈值时采取行动。
Alarms watch a metric and act when it crosses a threshold.

2532
03:39:56,352 --> 03:40:02,832
仪表盘整合来自多个服务、区域和账户的指标，还有一项考试常考的细节：
Dashboards combine metrics from several services, regions and accounts, and one detail the exam likes.

2533
03:40:03,152 --> 03:40:08,804
EC2 默认不报告内存或磁盘使用情况，因为这些是在操作系统内部运行的。
EC2 does not report memory or disk usage by default because those live inside the operating system.

2534
03:40:09,072 --> 03:40:11,012
它们需要安装 CloudWatch 代理。
They require the CloudWatch agent.

2535
03:40:12,558 --> 03:40:14,020
警报有三种状态。
An alarm has three states.

2536
03:40:14,272 --> 03:40:23,072
好的，还有 ALR 和数据不足。它的操作可以是通报给 Amazon SNS、触发自动扩缩容，或者停止并重启实例。
Okay, ALR and insufficient data. Its actions can notify through Amazon SNS, trigger auto scaling, or stop and reboot an instance.

2537
03:40:23,312 --> 03:40:28,676
警报是监控转化为自动化的手段，因为单纯的检测本身不会改变任何东西。
Alarms are how monitoring turns into automation because detection on its own changes nothing.

2538
03:40:29,646 --> 03:40:36,836
你可以针对预估费用创建计费警报，尽管对于成本问题，AWS 预算是更好的答案。
You can create billing alarms on estimated charges, although AWS budgets is the better answer for cost questions.

2539
03:40:37,358 --> 03:40:40,932
注意考试中经常出现的这个组合。
And note the pairing that appears constantly on this exam.

2540
03:40:41,392 --> 03:40:47,044
当指标超过某个值时通知某人，意味着 CloudWatch 警报加上 SNS。
Notify someone when a metric crosses a value means a CloudWatch alarm plus SN.

2541
03:40:48,878 --> 03:40:54,340
CloudRail 记录 API、跨 AWS 的调用、是谁做的以及如何操作的。
CloudRail records AP, i calls across AWS, whoever made them and however.

2542
03:40:54,766 --> 03:41:03,332
控制台点击、CLI 命令、SDK 调用和 CloudFormation 全部都会变成 API 调用。所以它们都会被记录下来。
Console clicks CLI commands SDK calls and cloud formation all become API calls. So all of them are recorded.

2543
03:41:05,518 --> 03:41:10,532
最近 90 天的管理事件可以在控制台中作为事件历史免费查看。
The last 90 days of management events are viewable free in the console as event history.

2544
03:41:11,214 --> 03:41:16,548
创建轨迹会将事件传输到 S3 进行无限期保留，并且可以覆盖所有区域。
Creating a trail delivers events to S3 for indefinite retention and can cover all regions.

2545
03:41:16,974 --> 03:41:22,660
而且日志文件完整性验证能证明日志未被篡改，这是审计员要求的。
And log file integrity validation proves the log has not been altered, which is what auditors ask for.

2546
03:41:24,398 --> 03:41:28,196
这是考试中考得最多的组合，一定要牢记。
The most tested pair on this exam, so hold it firmly.

2547
03:41:29,454 --> 03:41:36,708
CloudTrail 记录 API 调用以及背后的身份，回答是哪个用户更改了安全组。
Cloud Trail records, API calls, and the identity behind them answering which user changed a security group.

2548
03:41:37,614 --> 03:41:39,744
它的核心是某人的操作。
Its subject is an action by someone.

2549
03:41:40,206 --> 03:41:45,924
CloudWatch 收集指标、日志和警报，回答实例是否失败了状态检查。
CloudWatch collects metrics, logs, and alarms answering whether an instance failed a status check.

2550
03:41:46,798 --> 03:41:49,316
它的核心是随时间变化的测量数据。
Its subject is a measurement over time.

2551
03:41:49,710 --> 03:41:54,244
如果题目提到用户或者问是谁操作的，那就是 CloudTrail。
If a question names a user or asks who, it is CloudTrail.

2552
03:41:54,704 --> 03:42:00,388
如果提问涉及多少、多快或者是否失败，那就是 CloudWatch。
If it asks how much, how fast, or whether something failed, it is CloudWatch.

2553
03:42:02,126 --> 03:42:05,572
Config 和 CloudTrail 都会保留历史记录，这就是它们容易混淆的原因。
Config and CloudTrail both keep history, which is why they compete.

2554
03:42:07,598 --> 03:42:15,236
Config 保留资源状态的变更历史。所以它能回答存储桶是否曾经公开，并评估合规性规则。
Config keeps the history of what a resource looked like. So it answers whether a bucket was ever public and it evaluates rules for compliance.

2555
03:42:16,304 --> 03:42:19,504
CloudTrail 保留是谁做了什么的记录。
Cloud Trail keeps the history of who did something.

2556
03:42:20,110 --> 03:42:24,036
它们是互补的，实际调查中通常会同时用到两者。
They are complementary and a real investigation usually uses both.

2557
03:42:24,430 --> 03:42:26,756
Config 回答的是配置是什么样的。
Config answers what the configuration was.

2558
03:42:27,182 --> 03:42:29,252
Cloud Trail 回答的是是谁更改了它。
Cloud Trail answers who changed it.

2559
03:42:29,806 --> 03:42:32,708
任何提到合规性规则的地方，都指向 Config。
Any mention of compliance rules points at config.

2560
03:42:34,382 --> 03:42:39,904
顾问会持续对照 AWS 最佳实践来检查你的账户。
Trusted advisor continuously checks your account against AWS best practices.

2561
03:42:40,144 --> 03:42:48,836
它包含六个类别：成本优化、性能、安全性、容错性、服务限制和卓越运营。
There are six categories cost optimization, performance, security, fault tolerance, service limits, and operational excellence.

2562
03:42:49,646 --> 03:42:57,956
要注意，大部分学习资料里只有五个，因为“卓越运营”是 2023 年 10 月才加入的。
Be aware that most study material says five because operational excellence was only added in October 2023.

2563
03:42:59,214 --> 03:43:04,388
原来的五个没变，所以如果题目列出那五个，也是正确的。
The original five are unchanged, so a question listing those five is still correct.

2564
03:43:05,262 --> 03:43:10,436
每个账户都能免费获得服务限制检查，而完整的全套功能需要付费支持计划。
Every account gets service limit checks free while the full set requires a paid support plan.

2565
03:43:12,142 --> 03:43:15,812
这两个服务都会提供改进建议，考试时需要你做选择题。
Both services suggest improvements and the exam makes you choose.

2566
03:43:16,064 --> 03:43:25,476
顾问会对整个账户的六个类别进行广泛的最佳实践检查，找出闲置资源、开放端口以及接近配额的情况。
Trusted Advisor runs broad best practice checks across six categories for the whole account, finding idle resources, open ports, and quotas you are approaching.

2567
03:43:26,062 --> 03:43:28,324
Compute Optimizer 则专注于深入做一件事。
Compute Optimizer does one thing deeply.

2568
03:43:29,344 --> 03:43:39,172
它分析 EC2 实例、自动扩展组、EBS 卷和 Lambda 函数的实际利用率指标，并推荐更合适的尺寸。
It analyzes actual utilization metrics for EC2 instances, auto-scaling groups, EBS volumes, and lambda functions and recommends a specific different size.

2569
03:43:39,824 --> 03:43:43,428
如果问到“这个资源尺寸是否合适？”，选 Compute Optimizer。
Is this resource the right size? Means compute optimizer.

2570
03:43:43,984 --> 03:43:46,596
任何范围更广的情况都选顾问。
Anything broader means trusted advisor.

2571
03:43:48,334 --> 03:43:51,748
Systems Manager 是一套用于管理集群工具的集合。
Systems manager is a collection of tools for operating a fleet.

2572
03:43:52,462 --> 03:43:57,344
Patch manager 会按照计划在多个实例上应用操作系统补丁。
Patch manager applies operating system patches across many instances on a schedule.

2573
03:43:57,678 --> 03:44:05,092
Session manager 让你可以进入实例的 shell，无需 SSH 密钥、堡垒机或开放入站端口。
Session manager gives you a shell on an instance with no SSH keys, no bastion host, and no open inbound ports.

2574
03:44:05,824 --> 03:44:09,184
这就是为什么它经常出现在安全场景中。
That is why it appears so often in security scenarios.

2575
03:44:09,504 --> 03:44:14,788
Parameter Store 存储配置值以及用 KMS 加密的密钥。
Parameter store holds configuration values and secrets encrypted with KMS.

2576
03:44:15,424 --> 03:44:22,596
Run command 可以同时在多个实例上执行命令，并且支持 AWS 之外的服务器。
Run command executes a command across many instances at once and it works on servers outside AWS 2.

2577
03:44:24,302 --> 03:44:30,020
Health Dashboard 能告诉你问题是来自 AWS 还是你自己的。
The AWS Health dashboard answers whether a problem is AWS's or yours.

2578
03:44:30,544 --> 03:44:35,268
Service Health 公开显示 AWS 服务的总体状态。
Service Health shows the general status of AWS services publicly.

2579
03:44:35,918 --> 03:44:43,716
你的账户健康状况会显示影响你特定资源的事件，包括计划内的维护、实例退役等
Your account health shows events affecting your specific resources, including scheduled maintenance, instance retirements,

2580
03:44:43,918 --> 03:44:46,276
以及涉及你实际拥有的资源的问题。
and issues touching things you actually own.

2581
03:44:47,584 --> 03:44:48,516
健康状况。
The health.

2582
03:44:49,742 --> 03:44:53,584
API 为你自己的工具提供程序化访问。
AP I gives programmatic access for your own tooling.

2583
03:44:54,126 --> 03:44:59,424
而且一个重要的界限是，它报告的是 AWS 的健康状况，而不是你的应用程序。
And the important boundary is that it reports on AWS's health, not your applications.

2584
03:44:59,824 --> 03:45:02,500
你的应用属于 CloudWatch 的职责范围。
Your application is CloudWatch's job.

2585
03:45:03,950 --> 03:45:07,504
三个具有明确信号的小型服务。
Three smaller services with unmistakable signals.

2586
03:45:07,918 --> 03:45:13,284
X-ray 通过分布式应用程序追踪请求，以找出耗时所在。
X-ray traces a request through a distributed application to find where the time is going.

2587
03:45:13,998 --> 03:45:18,756
它的信号是微服务中没人知道哪个组件性能低下的情况。
Its signal is microservices where nobody knows which component is low.

2588
03:45:19,118 --> 03:45:24,004
Service quotas 显示你的配额，并允许你从一个地方申请增加。
Service quotas shows your quotas and lets you request increases from one place.

2589
03:45:24,942 --> 03:45:33,028
而 license manager 根据你的协议跟踪软件许可的使用情况，这与模块 1 中的许可讨论相关联。
And license manager tracks software license usage against your agreements, which links back to the licensing discussion in module 1.

2590
03:45:33,774 --> 03:45:37,092
这些服务不常出现，但一旦出现就很明显。
None appears often, but each is obvious when it does.

2591
03:45:38,798 --> 03:45:41,840
涵盖该领域几乎所有问题的八种表述方式。
Eight phrasings covering nearly every question in this area.

2592
03:45:42,190 --> 03:45:45,520
“哪个用户删除了资源”意味着 CloudTrail。
Which user deleted the resource means cloud trail.

2593
03:45:45,742 --> 03:45:50,080
“当 CPU 超过阈值时提醒我”意味着带有 SNS 的 CloudWatch 警报。
Alert me when CPU exceeds a threshold means a cloud watch alarm with SNS.

2594
03:45:50,320 --> 03:45:53,828
“这个资源是否曾被错误配置？”意味着 Config。
Was this resource ever configured incorrectly? Means config.

2595
03:45:54,640 --> 03:45:59,108
“降低成本并提高安全性的建议”意味着顾问。
Recommendations to cut cost and improve security means trusted advisor.

2596
03:45:59,520 --> 03:46:02,820
“这个实例尺寸是否合适？”意味着 Compute Optimizer。
Is this instance the right size means compute optimizer?

2597
03:46:03,246 --> 03:46:04,640
“在不开放端口的情况下连接”。
Connecting without opening.

2598
03:46:04,960 --> 03:46:07,428
“SSH”意味着 Session Manager。
SSH means session manager.

2599
03:46:07,920 --> 03:46:14,077
“AWS 是否正在发生故障”是指健康仪表板？而“哪个微服务变慢了”则是 X-Ray。
Is AWS having an incident means the health dashboard? And which microservice is slow means X-Ray.

2600
03:46:15,977 --> 03:46:16,964
实战案例。
Worked scenario.

2601
03:46:17,934 --> 03:46:18,404
1。
1.

2602
03:46:19,278 --> 03:46:23,332
发现一个存放客户记录的 S3 存储桶处于公开可读状态。
An S3 bucket holding customer records was found to be publicly readable.

2603
03:46:23,886 --> 03:46:34,884
安全团队需要三样东西：谁更改了存储桶策略，该存储桶之前是否曾公开过，以及是否有人收到警报。
The security team needs three things which I AM identity changed the bucket policy, whether the bucket had ever been public before and whether anyone was alerted.

2604
03:46:35,694 --> 03:46:38,532
公司运行着 CloudRail、Config 和 CloudWatch。
The company runs CloudRail, config, and cloud watch.

2605
03:46:38,720 --> 03:46:41,732
哪个服务能按顺序回答前两个问题？
Which service answers the first two questions in order?

2606
03:46:42,190 --> 03:46:43,364
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2607
03:46:49,454 --> 03:46:57,348
答案是 B。这个场景把三个服务都放在一个问题里，所以你必须正确区分它们，而不是通过排除法来做。
The answer is B. This scenario puts all three services in one question, so you have to separate them properly rather than by elimination.

2608
03:46:57,600 --> 03:47:02,148
“哪个身份发起了调用”是一个行为者问题？所以是 CloudTrail。
Which identity made the call is an actor question? So cloud trail.

2609
03:47:03,840 --> 03:47:09,092
“该存储桶之前是否公开过”是一个随时间变化的状态问题。所以是 Config。
Whether the bucket had ever been public before is a state over time question. So config.

2610
03:47:10,030 --> 03:47:21,380
选项 D 是一个容易掉进去的陷阱，这是一个常见的错误，因为 CloudWatch 听起来像是通用的监控答案，但它并不记录资源过去的设置是什么样。
Option D is the near miss and it is a common error because CloudWatch feels like the general monitoring answer, but it holds no record of what a resource's settings used to be.

2611
03:47:24,686 --> 03:47:33,604
运维团队要求在任何生产环境的 EC2 实例 CPU 超过 80% 并持续 15 分钟时收到通知。
An operations team wants to be notified when any production EC2 instance sustains CPU above 80% for 15 minutes.

2612
03:47:34,478 --> 03:47:37,412
工程师应在用户受到影响前进行调查。
An engineer should investigate before users are affected.

2613
03:47:37,998 --> 03:47:40,708
通知应发送到值班邮件组。
The notification should reach an on-call email group.

2614
03:47:41,550 --> 03:47:43,332
哪种组合符合这些要求？
Which combination meets this?

2615
03:47:44,320 --> 03:47:45,920
分析并决定。
Cause and decide.

2616
03:47:51,077 --> 03:47:52,857
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

2617
03:47:53,454 --> 03:48:00,740
关键点在于需求的结构而非服务名称，即：一个数值、一个阈值以及一段持续时间。
The giveaway is the shape of the requirement rather than the service names, a numeric value, a threshold, and a duration.

2618
03:48:01,550 --> 03:48:05,924
这就是指标警报的定义，而指标存储在 CloudWatch 中。
That is the definition of a metric alarm and metrics live in CloudWatch.

2619
03:48:07,310 --> 03:48:10,000
配对中的后半部分也很重要。
The second half of the pairing matters too.

2620
03:48:10,542 --> 03:48:14,212
CloudWatch 负责检测，SNS 负责发送通知。
CloudWatch detects and SNS delivers the notification.

2621
03:48:14,560 --> 03:48:20,772
两者都不会替代对方的功能，这就是为什么这两个服务经常成对出现在考试中。
Neither does the other's job, which is why this combination appears together so often on this exam.

2622
03:48:22,542 --> 03:48:23,652
案例分析完毕。
Worked scenario.

2623
03:48:27,950 --> 03:48:32,900
一家公司必须每月为 200 个 EC2 实例修复操作系统补丁。
A company must patch operating systems on 200 EC2 instances every month.

2624
03:48:33,280 --> 03:48:43,812
他们还希望工程师能通过 Shell 登录到任何实例进行故障排除。但政策禁止开启入站 SSH 端口，并禁止分发 SSH 密钥。
It also wants engineers to open a shell on any instance for troubleshooting. But policy forbids opening inbound SSH ports and forbids distributing SSH keys.

2625
03:48:44,560 --> 03:48:48,388
该公司希望有一个服务能同时满足这两个需求。
The company wants one service covering both needs.

2626
03:48:49,134 --> 03:48:50,244
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2627
03:48:56,366 --> 03:48:57,540
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

2628
03:48:58,080 --> 03:49:04,772
Systems Manager 是一系列工具的集合，而不是单一功能，这就是为什么一个服务就能解决两个问题。
Systems Manager is a collection of tools rather than a single feature, which is why one service answers both halves.

2629
03:49:05,680 --> 03:49:09,924
Patch manager 处理补丁更新，Session manager 提供 Shell 访问。
Patch manager covers the patching and session manager covers the shell access.

2630
03:49:10,766 --> 03:49:19,332
选项 D 值得注意，因为多年来 Bastion 主机一直是解决此问题的传统方案，旧的教材仍会推荐它。
Option D is worth noting because a Bastion host was the traditional answer to this problem for years and older material still recommends it.

2631
03:49:20,142 --> 03:49:26,980
该场景明确禁止了 Bastion 所需的条件，而 Session Manager 的存在正是为了取代这种模式。
The scenario forbids exactly what a bastion requires, and session manager exists precisely to replace that pattern.

2632
03:49:28,622 --> 03:49:39,204
场景 4：一家公司的应用程序突然变慢。工程师确认他们自己的实例状态良好，CPU 正常且应用日志中无错误。
What scenario 4. A company's application suddenly slows down. Engineers confirm their own instances are healthy with normal CPU and no errors in application logs.

2633
03:49:39,440 --> 03:49:42,852
他们怀疑是所在区域的 AWS 服务出现了问题。
They suspect an issue with an AWS service in their region.

2634
03:49:43,598 --> 03:49:50,000
他们想知道 AWS 是否有影响到他们资源的问题，以及是否有计划中的维护。
They want to know whether AWS has a problem affecting their resources and whether maintenance is scheduled.

2635
03:49:50,510 --> 03:49:51,588
他们应该去哪里查看？
Where should they look?

2636
03:49:52,206 --> 03:49:53,252
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2637
03:49:59,630 --> 03:50:00,800
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

2638
03:50:01,360 --> 03:50:05,668
题干在你看选项之前就排除了明显的错误选项。
The STEM eliminates the obvious answers before you reach the options.

2639
03:50:06,080 --> 03:50:10,820
他们的实例状态良好，CPU 正常，且没有应用错误。
Their instances are healthy, CPU is normal, and there are no application errors.

2640
03:50:11,280 --> 03:50:17,040
这排除了所有监控他们自身资源的服务，而这些服务占据了本模块的大部分内容。
That rules out every service that watches their own resources, which is most of this module.

2641
03:50:17,550 --> 03:50:25,924
剩下的问题是关于共享责任模型中 AWS 这一侧的职责，而健康仪表板就是负责这部分的地方。
What remains is a question about AWS's side of the shared responsibility model and the health dashboard is where that lives.

2642
03:50:26,240 --> 03:50:31,556
注意“账户视图”，因为它专门显示涉及你所拥有资源的事件。
Note the account view specifically because it shows events touching resources you own.

2643
03:50:33,070 --> 03:50:36,900
什么场景？第 5 题。一个财务团队提出了两个要求。
What scenario? 5. A finance team asks for two things.

2644
03:50:37,280 --> 03:50:44,900
第一，列出利用率持续较低的 EC2 实例，并提供更换为更小实例类型的建议。
First, a list of EC2 instances at consistently low utilization with a recommendation for a smaller instance type.

2645
03:50:45,646 --> 03:50:55,460
第二，进行更广泛的审查，标记闲置的负载均衡器、未关联的弹性 IP 地址以及端口开放受限的安全组。
Second, a broader review flagging idle load balancers, unassociated elastic IP addresses, and security groups with unrestricted ports.

2646
03:50:56,814 --> 03:50:58,660
他们应该使用哪两个服务？
Which two services should they use?

2647
03:50:59,182 --> 03:51:00,580
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2648
03:51:06,798 --> 03:51:08,292
答案是 A 和 B。
The answers are A and B.

2649
03:51:08,846 --> 03:51:13,828
两个要求，每个对应一个服务，区别在于“深度”与“广度”。
Two requirements, one service each, and the separator is depth against breadth.

2650
03:51:14,990 --> 03:51:22,276
根据测得的利用率推荐特定的更小实例类型是 Compute Optimizer，它专门负责处理这一项任务。
Recommending a specific smaller instance type from measured utilization is Compute Optimizer, which does that one thing well.

2651
03:51:23,200 --> 03:51:30,480
对负载均衡器、弹性 IP 地址和安全组进行广泛扫描是 顾问 的功能。
A broad sweep across load balancers, elastic IP addresses, and security groups is trusted advisor.

2652
03:51:30,720 --> 03:51:41,572
选项 D 值得注意，因为 CloudWatch 提供给 Compute Optimizer 分析的利用率指标。提供数据和给出建议是两件不同的工作。
Option D is worth noticing because CloudWatch supplies the utilization metrics that compute optimizer analysis. Supplying data and making a recommendation are different jobs.

2653
03:51:42,958 --> 03:51:48,880
总结一下：它在表现如何？是 CloudWatch；是谁做的？是 CloudRail；它被设置为什么了？
To recap, how is it behaving? Is CloudWatch? Who did it is CloudRail? What was it set to?

2654
03:51:49,040 --> 03:51:49,860
那是 Config。
Is config.

2655
03:51:50,254 --> 03:51:55,492
“命名用户”总是意味着 CloudRail，而“数值上的阈值”总是意味着 CloudWatch。
A named user always means CloudRail and a threshold on a number always means CloudWatch.

2656
03:51:56,238 --> 03:52:02,880
警报加上 SNS 是标准的通知组合，一个负责检测，另一个负责投递。
An alarm plus SNS is the standard notification pairing where one detects and the other delivers.

2657
03:52:03,886 --> 03:52:11,396
Session Manager 提供 Shell 访问，无需开放端口或密钥，取代了堡垒机。
Session manager gives shell access with no open ports and no keys, replacing the bastion host.

2658
03:52:11,854 --> 03:52:17,380
而且健康仪表板报告的是 AWS 的健康状况，而 CloudWatch 报告的是你的系统状态。
And the health dashboard reports AWS's health while CloudWatch reports yours.

2659
03:52:18,542 --> 03:52:24,320
下一个模块将通过集成、分析和 AI 来结束领域 3。
Next module closes domain 3 with integration, analytics, and AI.

2660
03:52:26,126 --> 03:52:30,180
这个模块将结束领域 3，并同时涵盖三个系列。
This module closes domain 3 and covers three families at once.

2661
03:52:30,670 --> 03:52:36,740
连接组件的服务、分析数据的服务，以及机器学习产品线。
Services that connect components together, services that analyze data, and the machine learning lineup.

2662
03:52:37,678 --> 03:52:39,908
最后一个是纯粹的识别题。
The last of those is pure recognition.

2663
03:52:40,430 --> 03:52:45,156
给你一个任务并要求你命名对应的服务，这些任务之间的差异极小。
You are given a task and asked to name the service, and the tasks barely vary.

2664
03:52:46,862 --> 03:52:49,220
三个系列，三种不同的技能。
Three families, three different skills.

2665
03:52:49,600 --> 03:52:57,120
关于集成的题目是关于解耦，即让组件独立运行。这样一个故障就不会导致其他组件也一起崩溃。
Integration questions are about decoupling, meaning letting components work independently. So one failing does not take the others with it.

2666
03:52:57,280 --> 03:53:01,380
分析类问题的判断通常取决于数据目前存放的位置。
Analytics questions are usually decided by where the data already sits.

2667
03:53:01,680 --> 03:53:04,228
而 AI 相关的问题纯粹是词汇量考查。
And the AI questions are pure vocabulary.

2668
03:53:04,846 --> 03:53:06,788
给出一个任务，命名对应的服务。
Given a task, name the service.

2669
03:53:07,246 --> 03:53:12,100
知道每个系列的考核方式不同，会让这个模块变得简单得多。
Knowing that each family is tested differently makes the module much easier.

2670
03:53:13,742 --> 03:53:16,228
这三个内容经常一起出现。
These three appear together constantly.

2671
03:53:16,782 --> 03:53:24,036
SNS 将一条消息推送给多个订阅者。所以当多个地方都需要收到同样的通知时，就用它。
SNS pushes one message to many subscribers. So use it when several things all need the same notification.

2672
03:53:24,590 --> 03:53:30,116
SQS 将消息保存在队列中，由消费者从中提取并分别处理，每条消息只处理一次。
SQS holds messages in a queue that consumers pull from, each processed once.

2673
03:53:30,574 --> 03:53:34,560
当工作需要缓冲且必须确保仅处理一次时，就用它。
Use it when work must be buffered and done exactly once.

2674
03:53:35,118 --> 03:53:43,600
Event Bridge 根据事件内容规则将事件路由到不同的目标。广播意味着 S 和 S。
Event bridge routes events to different targets based on rules about the events content. Broadcast means S and S.

2675
03:53:44,462 --> 03:53:46,560
工作缓冲意味着 SQS。
Buffer work means SQS.

2676
03:53:47,007 --> 03:53:49,412
根据内容进行路由意味着 Event Bridge。
Root by content means event bridge.

2677
03:53:51,216 --> 03:53:55,108
SNS 和 SQS 是经典的解耦组合。
SNS and SQS are the classic decoupling pair.

2678
03:53:55,630 --> 03:54:00,388
SNS 是发布/订阅模式，所以一条消息会发送到每一个订阅者。
SNS is publish and subscribe, so a message goes to every subscriber.

2679
03:54:00,736 --> 03:54:07,524
它会立即推送到诸如电子邮件、SMS、Lambda，甚至是 SQS 队列等端点。
It is pushed immediately to endpoints such as email, SMS, Lambda, or even an SQS queue.

2680
03:54:07,856 --> 03:54:09,156
没有任何东西在等待。
Nothing waits around.

2681
03:54:09,806 --> 03:54:19,332
SQS 是一个工作队列，每条消息由一个消费者在准备好时提取并处理，且消息会保留直到被处理。
SQS is a queue of work where each message is processed by one consumer that pulls when ready and messages persist until processed.

2682
03:54:19,982 --> 03:54:22,656
通知多个地方意味着 SNS。
Notify several places means SNS.

2683
03:54:22,926 --> 03:54:25,924
交给工人去处理意味着 SQS。
Handwork to a worker means SQS.

2684
03:54:27,374 --> 03:54:33,540
Event Bridge 是一个事件总线，它根据事件内容的规则将事件路由到目标。
Event bridge is an event bus that routes events to targets based on rules about the event's content.

2685
03:54:34,126 --> 03:54:42,148
AWS 服务会将事件发布到它上面，包括 EC2 状态变化，这是它检测你账户中发生情况的方式。
AWS services publish events to it, including ECPU state changes, which is how it detects things happening in your account.

2686
03:54:42,656 --> 03:54:48,676
它也可以按计划运行，是周期性触发 Lambda 函数的标准方式。
It can also run on a schedule, making it the standard way to trigger a lambda function periodically.

2687
03:54:50,158 --> 03:54:55,940
目标包括 Lambda、SNS、SQS 和步骤函数。
Targets include Lambda, SNS, SQS, and step functions.

2688
03:54:56,576 --> 03:55:02,180
它还能接收来自 AWS 外部 SaaS 应用的事件。
And it receives events from software as a service application outside AWS as well.

2689
03:55:03,822 --> 03:55:12,356
步骤函数通过包含步骤、分支、retry 和错误处理的定义工作流，将多个服务协同起来。
Step functions coordinates multiple services into a defined workflow with steps, branches, retrees, and error handling.

2690
03:55:12,942 --> 03:55:17,892
该工作流是可视化的，所以你可以看到哪一步失败了以及运行在哪里停止了。
The workflow is visual so you can see which step failed and where a run stopped.

2691
03:55:18,926 --> 03:55:22,816
这种信号是一个具有顺序或条件的多步骤过程。
The signal is a multi-step process with order or conditions.

2692
03:55:23,438 --> 03:55:28,516
它通常负责编排多个 Lambda 函数，否则这些函数需要直接互相调用。
It commonly orchestrates several lambda functions that would otherwise call one another directly.

2693
03:55:29,102 --> 03:55:35,972
但单个触发器运行一个函数不叫编排，而为了这种场景去用步骤函数则是过度设计。
But a single trigger firing one function is not orchestration and reaching for step functions there would be over-engineering.

2694
03:55:37,710 --> 03:55:38,736
现在来看分析类服务。
Now, analytics.

2695
03:55:39,056 --> 03:55:40,336
这里有个捷径。
And here is the shortcut.

2696
03:55:40,750 --> 03:55:46,884
这些题目通常由数据当前所在的地点决定，而不是由你想对它做什么来决定。
These questions are usually decided by where the data already sits rather than by what you want to do with it.

2697
03:55:48,782 --> 03:55:53,124
如果你想查询且数据已经在 S3 中，这指向一种情况。
Data already in S3 that you want to query occasionally points one way.

2698
03:55:54,094 --> 03:55:57,572
为了进行持续的大量分析而将数据加载到数据仓库中。
Data you load into a warehouse for constant heavy analysis.

2699
03:55:57,856 --> 03:55:58,756
这指向另一种情况。
Points another.

2700
03:55:59,278 --> 03:56:02,468
实时连续到达的数据则指向第三种情况。
Data arriving continuously in real time points to a third.

2701
03:56:03,150 --> 03:56:07,076
首先阅读场景，了解数据的当前位置和状态。
Read the scenario for the data's current location and state first.

2702
03:56:08,558 --> 03:56:10,176
这 7 种分析服务。
7 Analytics Services.

2703
03:56:10,654 --> 03:56:15,536
Athena 使用 SQL 查询已在 S3 中的数据，无需将其加载到任何地方。
Athena queries data already in S3 using SQL without loading it anywhere.

2704
03:56:15,776 --> 03:56:19,776
Redshift 是一个数据仓库，你将数据导入其中进行持续的大规模分析。
Redshift is a warehouse you load data into for sustained heavy analytics.

2705
03:56:20,096 --> 03:56:24,964
Kinesis 处理需要实时处理的、持续到达的数据。
Kinesis handles data arriving continuously that must be processed in real time.

2706
03:56:25,742 --> 03:56:30,948
Glue 执行 ETL，并提供数据的目录。
Glue does extract, transform, and load, plus a catalog of what your data is.

2707
03:56:31,278 --> 03:56:34,756
EMR 运行像 Spark 和 Hadoop 这样的大数据框架。
EMR runs big data frameworks like Spark and Hadoop.

2708
03:56:35,136 --> 03:56:38,180
Open Search Service 用于搜索和分析日志。
Open Search Service searches and analysis logs.

2709
03:56:38,862 --> 03:56:43,332
QuickSight 则用于构建仪表盘和商业智能可视化。
And QuickSight builds dashboards and business intelligence visualizations.

2710
03:56:44,974 --> 03:56:50,980
Athena 和 Redshift 都能用 SQL 回答分析类问题，区别在于你是否移动了数据。
Athena and Redshift both answer analytical questions with SQL and the separator is whether you move the data.

2711
03:56:51,296 --> 03:56:52,996
Athena 是无服务器的。
Athena is serverless.

2712
03:56:53,456 --> 03:56:59,780
直接对 S3 进行 SQL 查询，无需配置或加载，按扫描的数据量计费。
SQL directly against S3 with nothing to provision or load, charging per query by data scanned.

2713
03:57:00,366 --> 03:57:03,012
这适用于偶尔或即时的查询。
That suits occasional or ad hoc questions.

2714
03:57:04,014 --> 03:57:12,004
Redshift 将数据存储在优化后的仓库中，你加载后持续运行，适合持续的大规模分析。
Redshift stores the data in an optimized warehouse you load and keep running, which suits constant heavy analytics.

2715
03:57:12,686 --> 03:57:16,836
对已在 S3 中的数据进行偶尔查询，选 Athena。
Occasional queries on data already in S3 means Athena.

2716
03:57:17,646 --> 03:57:20,068
团队整天都在查询数据，选 Redshift。
A team querying all day means Redshift.

2717
03:57:21,326 --> 03:57:27,300
Kinesis 处理持续到达的数据，例如点击流、遥测和应用日志。
Kinesis handles data arriving continuously, such as click streams, telemetry, and application logs.

2718
03:57:28,334 --> 03:57:32,452
关键线索是：实时、流式以及数据到达时即处理。
The giveaway phases are real-time, streaming, and as the data arrives.

2719
03:57:33,294 --> 03:57:36,068
Data Streams 提供给你自己去处理的流。
Data streams gives you the stream to process yourself.

2720
03:57:36,878 --> 03:57:45,412
Data Firehose 会帮你把数据送到目的地，通常是无需代码就存入 S3、Redshift 或 OpenSearch。
Data fire hose delivers it to a destination for you, commonly landing data in S3, Redshift or OpenSearch with no code.

2721
03:57:45,934 --> 03:57:47,652
要注意相反的情况。
And be careful of the opposite.

2722
03:57:48,718 --> 03:57:55,524
在一天结束时进行批处理不是流式传输，这指向 Glue、EMR 或 Batch。
Batch processing at the end of the day is not streaming and points at glue, EMR, or batch instead.

2723
03:57:57,198 --> 03:57:59,480
关于这个模块有一个命名警告。
One naming warning for this module.

2724
03:57:59,982 --> 03:58:05,844
考试指南将其写为 Amazon QuickSight，并描述为商业智能仪表盘。
The exam guide writes it as Amazon QuickSight and describes business intelligence dashboards.

2725
03:58:06,884 --> 03:58:13,668
该产品本身在 2025 年 10 月更名为 Amazon QuickSight，然后又简化为 Amazon Quick。
The product itself was renamed Amazon Quick Suite in October 2025, Then shortened again to Amazon Quick.

2726
03:58:14,446 --> 03:58:17,092
功能没有改变，只是标签变了。
The capability has not changed, only the label.

2727
03:58:18,062 --> 03:58:23,236
所以考试时选 QuickSight，但在打开控制台时可能会看到 Quick。
So answer with QuickSight on the exam and expect to see Quick when you open the console.

2728
03:58:24,206 --> 03:58:27,344
模块 22 会涵盖这些以及其他的更名情况。
Module 22 covers this alongside the other renames.

2729
03:58:29,262 --> 03:58:34,564
现在是机器学习系列，关于它是如何被考核的，我得直说点。
Now the machine learning family, and it is worth being blunt about how it is tested.

2730
03:58:36,046 --> 03:58:37,796
这是一个词汇测试。
This is a vocabulary test.

2731
03:58:38,606 --> 03:58:43,204
题目给出一个任务，你只需选出完成该任务的服务。
A scenario names a task and you name the service that does that task.

2732
03:58:43,822 --> 03:58:46,304
这几乎不需要逻辑推理。
There is almost no reasoning involved.

2733
03:58:46,862 --> 03:58:50,404
这让这些题型成为考试中最快拿分的题目
That makes these the fastest marks on the exam

2734
03:58:51,246 --> 03:58:55,492
如果你记住了表格，就能得分；没记住就会白白丢分。
if you learn the table and frustrating losses if you do not.

2735
03:58:57,166 --> 03:59:05,412
共有八行内容，考试几乎是逐字引用。在图像和视频中识别物体、面孔或文本是 recognition。
