2736
03:59:06,062 --> 03:59:09,988
理解文本，包括情感分析和实体，是 Comprehend。
Understanding text, including sentiment and entities, is comprehend.

2737
03:59:10,862 --> 03:59:12,868
文本转语音是 Polly。
Text into speech is poly.

2738
03:59:15,022 --> 03:59:17,060
语音转文本是 语音转文本。
Speech into text is transcribe.

2739
03:59:17,838 --> 03:59:20,836
跨语言翻译是 translate。
Translating between languages is translate.

2740
03:59:22,064 --> 03:59:27,460
从扫描的文档和表格中提取文本和数据是 extract。
Extracting text and data from scanned documents and forms is extract.

2741
03:59:29,038 --> 03:59:31,584
构建对话式聊天机器人是 Lex。
Building a conversational chatbot is Lex.

2742
03:59:32,750 --> 03:59:37,060
而构建、训练并部署你自己的模型是 SageMaker。
And building, training and deploying your own modules is SageMaker.

2743
03:59:37,742 --> 03:59:38,224
人工智能。
AI.

2744
03:59:59,264 --> 04:00:06,180
Comprehend 用于解析文本含义，对现有文本进行情感分析、实体识别和关键短语分析。
Comprehend works out what text means, analyzing sentiment, entities and key phrases from text you already have.

2745
04:00:06,638 --> 04:00:08,964
扫描文档意味着 text extract。
A scanned document means text tract.

2746
04:00:09,344 --> 04:00:12,292
理解生成的文本内容则对应 comprehend。
Understanding the resulting text means comprehend.

2747
04:00:12,864 --> 04:00:15,716
实际解决方案通常会按顺序同时使用这两个服务。
Real solutions often use both in sequence.

2748
04:00:17,358 --> 04:00:20,804
当预建好的服务不够用时，有三个相关服务。
Three services for when the pre-built ones are not enough.

2749
04:00:21,358 --> 04:00:22,148
SageMaker。
SageMaker.

2750
04:00:23,118 --> 04:00:27,620
AI 是用于构建、训练和部署你自己的机器学习模型。
AI is for building, training, and deploying your own machine learning models.

2751
04:00:28,144 --> 04:00:30,852
它的关键词是自定义模型或特定问题。
Its signal is a custom model or a problem.

2752
04:00:31,342 --> 04:00:33,252
这些预建服务无法覆盖的情况。
The pre-built services do not cover.

2753
04:00:34,030 --> 04:00:38,439
Bedrock 为生成式人工智能应用提供基础模型的访问。
Bedrock provides access to foundation models for generative AI applications.

2754
04:00:38,510 --> 04:00:45,264
而 Amazon Q 是一个生成式人工智能助手，可以回答有关你数据和系统的问题。
And Amazon Q is a generative AI assistant that answers questions about your data and systems.

2755
04:00:45,504 --> 04:00:52,740
注意，Amazon Q business 已于今年 7 月 31 日停止对新客户开放，并整合到 Amazon Quick 中。
Note that Amazon Q business closed to new customers on the 31st of July this year, folding into Amazon Quick.

2756
04:00:54,414 --> 04:00:57,124
这四个业务应用都有明确的辨识点。
4 business applications with clear signals.

