Amazon Connect 是用于语音和聊天客户服务的云呼叫中心，采用按需付费模式。
Amazon Connect is a cloud contact center for voice and chat customer service, priced pay as you go.

2758
04:01:04,144 --> 04:01:07,972
Simple email service 支持大规模发送批量邮件和事务性邮件。
Simple email service sends bulk and transactional email at scale.

2759
04:01:08,704 --> 04:01:12,932
Workspaces 提供用户可以从任何地方连接的虚拟桌面。
Workspaces provides virtual desktops users connect to from anywhere.

2760
04:01:13,838 --> 04:01:19,396
而 App Stream 2.0 是流式传输单个应用程序，而不是整个桌面。
And App Stream 2.0 streams a single application rather than a whole desktop.

2761
04:01:20,430 --> 04:01:23,332
别忘了第 21 模块提到的名称冲突。
