这两个要求共同精准描述了一个队列。
The two requirements together describe a cube precisely.

2779
04:02:51,822 --> 04:02:55,620
立即完成意味着结账过程不能等待。
Complete immediately means the checkout must not wait.

2780
04:02:55,982 --> 04:02:59,940
而后续可靠执行意味着任务不能丢失。
And happen reliably afterwards means the work must not be lost.

2781
04:03:00,622 --> 04:03:04,740
也就是缓冲加上持久化，这正是 SQS 提供的功能。
That is buffering plus persistence, which is what SQS provides.

