选项 A 值得注意，因为 SNS 在某种意义上也能解耦。但它是推送消息而不是持有消息。所以如果订阅者变慢或不可用，仍然是个问题。
Option A is worth care because SNS does decouple in one sense. But it pushes messages out rather than holding them. So a slow or unavailable subscriber is still a problem.

2783
04:03:17,454 --> 04:03:18,532
机器人场景。
Bot scenario.

2784
