It has thousands of hours of audio and no machine learning specialist and wants managed services only.

2837
04:08:02,414 --> 04:08:05,360
它应该按顺序使用哪两个服务？
Which two services should it use in order?

2838
04:08:06,638 --> 04:08:07,940
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2839
04:08:13,806 --> 04:08:15,972
答案是 A 和 B。
The answers are A and B.

2840
04:08:16,560 --> 04:08:24,068
输入音频并输出含义总是需要两个步骤，因为没有任何一个 AWS 服务能同时完成这两项。
Audio in and Meaning Out always takes two steps because no single AWS service does both.

2841
04:08:24,718 --> 04:08:27,588
Transcribe 将语音转换为文本。
Transcribe converts speech to text.

2842
04:08:27,840 --> 04:08:31,268
然后用 Comprehend 对该文本进行情感分析。
Then comprehend analysis that text for sentiment.

2843
04:08:32,526 --> 04:08:33,040
选项
Option

2844
04:08:33,840 --> 04:08:35,908
C 是方向性陷阱。
C is the direction trap.

2845
04:08:36,846 --> 04:08:42,160
Polly 和 Transcribe 是相反的，在时间压力下选错是很常见的失误。
Poly and transcribe are opposites, and picking the wrong one is a common slip under time pressure.

2846
04:08:42,542 --> 04:08:44,452
Polly 将文本转换为语音。
Poly turns text into speech.

2847
04:08:45,134 --> 04:08:47,364
Transcribe 将语音转换为文本。
Transcribe turns speech into text.

2848
04:08:49,326 --> 04:08:52,548
公司已经有音频了，所以它需要 Transcribe。
The company already has audio, so it needs transcribe.

2849
04:08:54,190 --> 04:09:03,204
总结一下，这部分结束了第三个领域。广播是 SNS，队列处理是 SQS，按内容路由是 EventBridge。
To recap, and this closes domain 3. Broadcast is SNS, queuing work is SQS, routing by content is EventBridge.

2850
04:09:03,886 --> 04:09:07,332
具有错误处理功能的多个有序步骤是 步骤函数。
Several ordered steps with error handling is step functions.

2851
04:09:08,974 --> 04:09:15,360
Athena 在原位查询 S3，而 Redshift 是一个需要加载数据的仓库，Kinesis 是正在传输的数据。
Athena queries S3 in place while Redshift is a warehouse you load and kinesis is data still arriving.

2852
04:09:16,334 --> 04:09:21,034
Textract 从文档中提取文本，而 Comprehend 则负责理解这些文本的含义。
Textract gets text out of documents while Comprehend works out what text means.

2853
04:09:21,600 --> 04:09:26,212
Polly 将文本转为语音，而 语音转文本 将语音转为文本。
And poly makes speech from text while transcribe makes text from speech.

2854
04:09:26,766 --> 04:09:28,772
背诵这组 AI 相关服务的对应关系。
Learn the AI table verbatim.

2855
04:09:30,254 --> 04:09:34,054
下一模块进入领域 4，涵盖计费相关模块。
Next module opens domain 4 with pricing modules.

2856
04:09:36,014 --> 04:09:43,780
这个模块开启领域 4，虽然它占比最小（12%），但题目通常非常容易回答。
This module opens domain 4, the smallest domain at 12%, but one where the questions are unusually answerable.

2857
04:09:44,400 --> 04:09:51,300
在题库分析中，“按需”和“预留”共现了 35 次，比任何其他组合都要多。
On demand and reserved co occurred 35 times in the bank analysis, more than any other pair in the whole set.

2858
04:09:52,142 --> 04:09:56,356
购买选项是该领域中考查频率最高的知识点。
Purchase options are the single most tested thing in this domain.

2859
04:09:57,646 --> 04:10:01,476
AWS 对计算资源提供的每项折扣都源于两个因素之一。
Every discount AWS offers on compute comes from one of two things.

2860
04:10:01,838 --> 04:10:11,268
要么是你承诺使用某项服务 1 年或 3 年，因为你的使用量是可预测的，所以 AWS 提供折扣；
Either you commit to using something for 1 or 3 years and AWS discounts it because your usage is predictable, or you accept that your workload can be interrupted

2861
04:10:11,982 --> 04:10:14,724
而且 AWS 会以低廉的价格把闲置容量卖给你。
and AWS sells you spare capacity cheaply.

2862
04:10:15,662 --> 04:10:17,060
那么 AWS 就以低廉的价格把闲置容量卖给你。
Commitment or interruption.

2863
04:10:17,998 --> 04:10:23,108
如果你知道工作负载属于哪一种情况，相应的购买选项就呼之欲出了。
If you know which of those the workload can offer, the purchase option follows immediately.

2864
04:10:24,334 --> 04:10:26,880
共有四个选项，每一行都对应一个类别。
Four options and each row is a clade.

2865
04:10:27,360 --> 04:10:32,708
按需（按需）不设任何限制，提供最高的灵活性，但价格也最高。
On demand gives up nothing and gets full flexibility at the highest price.

2866
04:10:35,566 --> 04:10:43,600
节省计划（Savings plans）承诺在 1 或 3 年内达到一定的支出水平，可在不同服务间灵活切换并获得高达 72% 的折扣。
Savings plans commit to a level of spend for 1 or 3 years and get up to 72% off flexibly across services.

2867
04:10:44,014 --> 04:10:58,240
预留实例（Reserved instances）在相同的期限和折扣下，承诺使用特定的实例属性。而竞价实例（spot instances）则以接受中断为代价，获取高达 90% 的闲置容量。
Reserved instances commit to usage of particular instance attributes for the same terms and discount. And spot instances accept interruption in exchange for up to 90% of spare capacity.

2868
04:10:59,790 --> 04:11:03,140
读一下中间那一列，因为那才是你实际支付的内容。
Read the middle column because that is what you are actually paying with.

2869
04:11:04,814 --> 04:11:08,160
这是整个题库分析中出现频率最高的组合。
This is the most co-occurring pair in the whole bank analysis.

2870
04:11:08,366 --> 04:11:10,372
所以要准确掌握这些区分点。
So learn the separator precisely.

2871
04:11:10,894 --> 04:11:13,092
按需模式没有承诺要求。
On demand has no commitment.

2872
04:11:13,998 --> 04:11:21,412
你按秒或按小时付费，并可随时停止，适合不可预测或短寿命的工作负载。
You pay per second or hour and stop whenever you like, which suits unpredictable or short-lived workloads.

2873
04:11:21,806 --> 04:11:23,652
以及那些无法预估规模的工作负载。
And workloads you cannot size in.

2874
04:11:24,590 --> 04:11:31,876
预留实例要求你承诺使用一年或三年，以换取大幅折扣，适合持续运行的工作负载。
Reserved instances commit you for one or three years in exchange for a large discount which suits workloads running continuously.

2875
04:11:32,974 --> 04:11:35,396
缺点是无论你是否使用，都必须付费。
The catch is that you pay whether you use it or not.

2876
04:11:35,950 --> 04:11:38,660
稳定且可预测的意味着预留。
Steady and predictable means reserved.

2877
04:11:39,886 --> 04:11:42,788
不可预测或临时的意味着按需。
Unpredictable or temporary means on demand.

2878
04:11:44,526 --> 04:11:49,348
预留实例提供一年或三年的期限，其中三年期的折扣更多。
Reserved instances come in one or three year terms with three years discounting more.

2879
04:11:49,966 --> 04:11:56,720
支付选项包括全部预付（节省最多）、部分预付，以及无需预付。
Payment options are all upfront, which saves the most, then partial upfront, then no upfront.

2880
04:11:57,262 --> 04:12:01,668
标准预留实例折扣最高，但会锁定实例属性。
Standard reservations discount most, but lock the instance attributes.

2881
04:12:02,638 --> 04:12:10,084
可转换预留实例折扣较少，但在期限内允许您更改实例系列、操作系统或租约类型。
Convertible reservations discount less, but let you change instance family, operating system, or tenancy during the term.

2882
04:12:11,406 --> 04:12:20,292
而且在组织中，一个账户中未使用的预留实例可以应用于另一个账户中匹配的用量。
And usefully, in an organization, an unused reservation in one account can apply to another account's matching usage.

2883
04:12:20,910 --> 04:12:22,916
这要归功于合并账单。
Thanks to consolidated billing.

2884
04:12:24,686 --> 04:12:30,724
使用节省计划时，您承诺的是每小时的金额，期限为一到三年，而不是特定的实例。
With a savings plan, you commit to a dollar amount per hour for one or three years rather than to specific instances.

2885
04:12:33,326 --> 04:12:41,412
计算节省计划最灵活，适用于不同的实例系列和区域，并涵盖 Fargate、Lambda 以及 EC2。
Compute savings plans are the most flexible, applying across instance families and regions and covering Fargate and Lambda as well as EC2.

2886
04:12:42,158 --> 04:12:42,800
EC2。
EC2.

2887
04:12:43,246 --> 04:12:49,412
实例预留实例折扣更多，但会将您绑定在特定区域的某个实例系列中。
Instance savings plans discount more, but commit you to an instance family in one region.

2888
04:12:50,542 --> 04:12:57,156
超出承诺部分的用量将按按需价格计费，所以即使超过限额也不会出问题。
Usage above your commitment is simply built at on-demand rates, so nothing breaks if you exceed it.

2889
04:12:58,830 --> 04:13:02,692
请注意，预留实例永远不涵盖 Fargate 或 Lambda。
And note that reserved instances never cover Fargate or Lambda.

2890
04:13:04,430 --> 04:13:10,244
这两种机制都涉及承诺且折扣相似，因此考试需要另一个区分点。
Both mechanisms commit you and both discount similarly, so the exam needs another separator.

2891
04:13:11,502 --> 04:13:20,836
预留实例与系列、大小、区域和平台等实例属性绑定，并且可以在预留实例市场中转售。
Reserved instances are tied to instance attributes such as family, size, region, and platform and can be resold in the reserved instance marketplace.

2892
04:13:21,760 --> 04:13:29,892
节省计划承诺的是每小时的支出，并自动应用于匹配的用量，在工作负载变化时无需进行任何修改。
Savings plans commit to hourly spend and apply automatically to matching usage with nothing to modify when workloads change.

2893
04:13:30,542 --> 04:13:32,580
清晰的判定标准是覆盖范围。
The clean tiebreaker is coverage.

2894
04:13:33,774 --> 04:13:39,940
如果场景中同时提到 Fargate 或 Lambda 以及 EC2，只有计算节省计划能涵盖这三者。
If a scenario mentions Fargate or Lambda alongside EC2, only a compute savings plan covers all three.

2895
04:13:41,742 --> 04:13:47,140
竞价实例通过使用 AWS 的闲置容量，提供高达 90% 的折扣。
Spot instances offer up to 90% off by using spare AWS capacity.

2896
04:13:47,680 --> 04:13:53,760
条件是当 AWS 需要收回这些容量时，可以在提前 2 分钟通知的情况下收回实例。
The condition is that AWS can reclaim the instance with a 2-minute warning when it needs the capacity back.

2897
04:13:54,862 --> 04:13:59,460
这使得竞价实例适用于容错、无状态且可重启的工作。
That makes spot suitable for fault-tolerant, stateless, restartable work.

2898
04:14:00,334 --> 04:14:06,692
批处理、数据分析、持续集成构建和渲染是典型的应用场景。
Batch processing, data analysis, continuous integration builds and rendering are the name use cases.

2899
04:14:08,080 --> 04:14:14,884
它不适用于任何必须不间断运行到完成，或在内存中保留重要状态的任务。
It is never suitable for anything that must run to completion uninterrupted or that holds important state in memory.

2900
04:14:16,590 --> 04:14:17,920
三种租约选项。
Three tenancy options.

2901
04:14:18,318 --> 04:14:25,156
共享租约是默认选项，您的实例与其它客户共享物理硬件，并通过虚拟机管理程序进行隔离。
Shared tenancy is the default where your instances share physical hardware with other customers isolated by the hypervisor.

2902
04:14:25,966 --> 04:14:31,428
专用实例运行在专门分配给您账户的硬件上，但您无法看到这些硬件细节。
Dedicated instances run on hardware dedicated to your account but give you no visibility into it.

2903
04:14:32,206 --> 04:14:37,508
专用主机提供物理服务器本身，您可以查看插槽和核心信息。
Dedicated hosts give you the physical server itself with visibility of sockets and cores.

2904
04:14:38,080 --> 04:14:44,900
最后一点是考试最喜欢的考点，因为您已经拥有的基于插槽或基于核心的许可证需要这种可见性。
That last point is the exam's favorite because socket based or core based licenses you already own require that visibility.

2905
04:14:45,614 --> 04:14:50,276
两种专用选项都是为了合规性或许可要求而选择的，而不是为了性能。
Both dedicated options are chosen for compliance or licensing, not performance.

2906
04:14:51,950 --> 04:14:53,324
这是决策表。
Here is the decision table.

2907
04:14:53,838 --> 04:14:58,404
稳定且运行多年的意味着预留实例或节省计划。
Steady and running for years means reserved instances or savings plans.

2908
04:14:58,990 --> 04:15:04,132
稳定，但可能迁移到 Fargate 或 Lambda，意味着计算节省计划。
Steady, but possibly moving to Fargate or Lambda means compute savings plans.

2909
04:15:04,654 --> 04:15:06,864
可中断且可重启的意味着竞价实例。
Interruptible and restartable means spot.

2910
04:15:07,264 --> 04:15:10,788
短期、不可预测或全新的需求意味着按需实例。
Short term, unpredictable, or brand new means on demand.

2911
04:15:11,758 --> 04:15:20,704
受基于套接字的许可限制意味着专用主机，并且需要在单个可用区中保证容量，且没有折扣
Bound by a socket-based license means dedicated hosts and needing guaranteed capacity in one availability zone without a discount

2912
04:15:20,944 --> 04:15:24,708
意味着按需容量预留
means on demand capacity reservations.

2913
04:15:26,094 --> 04:15:28,580
要看工作负载的性质，而不是它的规模
Read the workload shape rather than its size.

2914
04:15:30,318 --> 04:15:36,260
购买选项涵盖账单中的计算项，但考试还会考查还有哪些项目会产生费用
Purchase options cover the compute line of the bill, but the exam also tests what else costs money.

2915
04:15:36,864 --> 04:15:42,340
Data transfer 是经典的意外项，因为规则是不对称的且不直观
Data transfer is the classic surprise because the rules are asymmetric and not obvious.

2916
04:15:43,118 --> 04:15:49,412
值得好好学习这四条规则，因为它们不仅出现在这个领域，还会出现在多个领域的成本问题中
It is worth learning the four rules properly because they turn up in cost questions across several domains, not just this one.

2917
04:15:50,830 --> 04:15:53,828
这是四条规则，而且它们在设计上就是不对称的
Four rules and they are asymmetric by design.

2918
04:15:54,144 --> 04:15:59,012
从互联网进入 AWS 的 Data transfer 是免费的，所以上传不花钱
Data transfer into AWS from the internet is free, so uploading costs nothing.

2919
04:15:59,694 --> 04:16:04,676
传出到互联网的 Data transfer 是要收费的，这也是大多数意外费用产生的地方
Data transfer out to the internet is charged, and that is where most surprise costs come from.

2920
04:16:05,454 --> 04:16:08,932
在同一区域的不同可用区之间传输会收费
Transfer between availability zones in the same region is charged.

2921
04:16:09,838 --> 04:16:14,084
跨区域传输会收费，而且比跨可用区更贵
Transfer between regions is charged and costs more than between zones.

2922
04:16:14,384 --> 04:16:19,492
而在单个可用区内使用私有地址的传输是免费的
And transfer within a single availability zone using private addresses is free.

2923
04:16:21,166 --> 04:16:23,300
进入是免费的，流出要付费
In is free, out costs.

2924
04:16:24,078 --> 04:16:25,476
先检查方向
Check the direction first.

2925
04:16:27,182 --> 04:16:29,636
这是一个值得了解的变动领域
Here is a domain for change worth knowing.

2926
04:16:29,998 --> 04:16:36,292
考试中提到的免费套餐包含三部分：始终免费、12个月免费以及短期试用
The exam teaches a free tier with three parts always free, 12 months free, and short-term trials.

2927
04:16:36,686 --> 04:16:42,436
在 2025 年 7 月 15 日，AWS 为新账户将该模式替换为积分模型
On the 15th of July 2025, AWS replaced that for new accounts with a credit model.

2928
04:16:43,118 --> 04:16:49,828
新账户现在可以选择免费或付费计划，并获得 100 美元的积分，最多可再获 100 个
New accounts now choose a free or paid plan and receive $100 of credit plus up to 100 more.

2929
04:16:50,144 --> 04:16:52,292
免费计划有效期为 6 个月
The free plan runs for 6 months.

2930
04:16:53,486 --> 04:16:56,772
在那个日期之前创建的账户保留旧模型
Accounts created before that date keep the old model.

2931
04:16:57,422 --> 04:17:00,064
考试时按三部分模型来回答
Answer with the 3-part model on the exam.

2932
04:17:01,344 --> 04:17:03,744
有些服务本身是不收费的
Some services cost nothing themselves.

2933
04:17:12,064 --> 04:17:17,824
但你必须为它们产生的内容付费，所以 Beanstalk 是免费的，而它的 EC2 实例不是
But you always pay for what they create, so Beanstalk is free while its EC2 instances are not.

2934
04:17:18,094 --> 04:17:21,380
这种区别是这个领域中最常见的干扰项类型
That distinction is the most common distractor shape in this domain.

2935
04:17:22,126 --> 04:17:26,980
还要记住，停止的实例仍会为其 EBS 卷计费
Also remember that a stopped instance still builds for its EBS volume.

2936
04:17:27,424 --> 04:17:30,212
NAT 网关、未关联的
N80 gateways, unattached,

2937
04:17:31,854 --> 04:17:37,540
弹性 IP 地址和闲置的负载均衡器在没有任何操作时也会产生费用
elastic IP addresses and idle load balancers all cost money while doing nothing.

2938
04:17:39,214 --> 04:17:39,584
Web
Web

2939
04:17:43,314 --> 04:17:45,874
应用程序运行在 20 个 EC2 实例上
application on 20 EC2 instances.

2940
04:17:46,554 --> 04:17:50,774
它已经连续运行了 4 年，并预计将无限期继续运行
It has run continuously for 4 years and is expected to continue indefinitely.

2941
04:17:51,630 --> 04:17:54,692
实例类型没有改变，预计也不会改变。
The instance type has not changed and is not expected to.

2942
04:17:55,104 --> 04:17:57,572
公司希望成本尽可能低。
The company wants the lowest possible cost.

2943
04:17:58,224 --> 04:18:00,644
它应该选择哪种购买选项？
Which purchase option should it choose?

2944
04:18:01,024 --> 04:18:02,404
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2945
04:18:08,654 --> 04:18:09,984
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

2946
04:18:10,624 --> 04:18:21,604
题干中的每一个条款都在强调最大程度的承诺：有四年的历史、未来的长期运行，以及一个没有改变且预计不会改变的实例类型。
Every clause in the stem argues for maximum commitment, four years of history, an indefinite future, and an instance type that has not changed and is not expected to.

2947
04:18:22,894 --> 04:18:28,068
选项 D 是一个具有误导性的干扰项，因为可转换预留听起来更稳妥。
Option D is the instructive miss because convertible reservations sound safer.

2948
04:18:29,038 --> 04:18:31,076
但灵活性并不等于免费。
But flexibility is not flea.

2949
04:18:32,064 --> 04:18:37,732
你为了获得更改的权利而放弃一部分折扣，而这家公司已经告诉你它不需要更改。
You give up discount to buy the right to change, and this company has told you it will not need to change.

2950
04:18:38,222 --> 04:18:40,964
不要为没必要的灵活性买单，这个场景排除了它。
Do not pay for flexibility, the scenario rules out.

2951
04:18:42,542 --> 04:18:44,144
处理场景 2。
Worked scenario 2.

2952
04:18:44,398 --> 04:18:46,596
一家媒体公司在夜间渲染视频。
A media company renders video overnight.

2953
04:18:46,944 --> 04:18:53,344
每个渲染任务大约需要 20 分钟，各任务相互独立，任何失败的任务都可以重新运行。
Each render job takes about 20 minutes, jobs are independent, and any failed job can simply be run again.

2954
04:18:53,678 --> 04:18:55,684
总处理量每晚都在变化。
Total volume varies night to night.

2955
04:18:56,718 --> 04:19:01,380
公司希望降低计算成本，且除了第二天早上之外没有其他截止日期。
The company wants the lowest compute cost and has no deadline beyond the following morning.

2956
04:19:02,384 --> 04:19:03,812
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2957
04:19:09,646 --> 04:19:11,280
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

2958
04:19:11,694 --> 04:19:16,100
Spot 实例要保证安全需要三个条件，而这个场景明确包含了这三个条件。
Spot needs three things to be safe, and the scenario states all three explicitly.

2959
04:19:16,400 --> 04:19:19,652
任务是独立的，所以丢失一个不会影响其他任务。
The jobs are independent, so losing one does not affect others.

2960
04:19:19,840 --> 04:19:23,364
失败的任务可以重新运行，所以中断是可以恢复的。
A failed job can simply be run again, so interruption is recoverable.

2961
04:19:24,320 --> 04:19:29,028
而且除了第二天早上没有其他截止日期，所以延迟是可以接受的。
And there is no deadline beyond the following morning, so delay is tolerable.

2962
04:19:29,440 --> 04:19:33,764
当你看到这三个条件同时出现时，几乎总是指向 Spot 实例。
When you see those three together, spot is almost always intended.

2963
04:19:34,254 --> 04:19:39,940
对比一下场景 1，在那里面向客户和持续运行让 Spot 变得不可行。
Compare this with scenario 1, where customer facing and continuous made spot impossible.

2964
04:19:41,710 --> 04:19:42,820
处理场景 3。
Work scenario 3.

2965
04:19:43,200 --> 04:19:47,940
一家公司在 EC2 上运行稳定的工作负载，并希望获得 3 年的大幅折扣。
A company runs a steady workload on EC2 and wants a large discount for 3 years.

2966
04:19:49,920 --> 04:19:56,580
在此期间，它预计会将部分工作负载迁移到 Fargate，并重写一些组件和 Lambda 函数。
Over that period, it expects to move parts of the workload to Fargate and to rewrite some components and lambda functions.

2967
04:19:57,358 --> 04:20:00,804
它希望在架构变化时，它的承诺依然有效。
It wants its commitment to keep applying as the architecture changes.

2968
04:20:01,646 --> 04:20:02,852
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2969
04:20:09,070 --> 04:20:10,212
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

2970
04:20:10,990 --> 04:20:15,556
在 EC2 的同时提到 Fargate 和 Lambda，一下子就排除了三个选项。
Naming Fargate and Lambda alongside EC2 eliminates three options at once.

2971
04:20:16,302 --> 04:20:23,140
无论哪种类型的预留实例都只涵盖 EC2 和 EC2 实例，而节省计划仅限于一个区域。
Reserved instances of either kind cover only EC2 and EC2 instance, savings plans are limited to one region.

2972
04:20:23,822 --> 04:20:26,852
只有计算节省计划涵盖所有三种服务。
Only a compute savings plan spans all three services.

2973
04:20:27,758 --> 04:20:37,028
选项 B 差一点就对了，因为“可转换”听起来像是灵活的选择。但它的灵活性是指实例属性，而不是指你使用哪种服务。
Option B is the near miss because convertible sounds like the flexible choice. Its flexibility is about instance attributes, not about which service you use.

2974
04:20:38,638 --> 04:20:40,516
场景 4 成功了。
Worked scenario 4.

2975
04:20:40,880 --> 04:20:43,972
财务团队正在审核一笔异常高昂的账单。
A finance team is reviewing an unexpectedly large bill.

2976
04:20:44,400 --> 04:20:48,708
调查显示，大量数据流出区域产生了费用。
Investigation shows charges for a large volume of data leaving the region.

2977
04:20:49,120 --> 04:20:55,844
它还显示了闲置的弹性 IP 地址以及处理大量流量的 NAT 网关。
It also shows idle elastic IP addresses and a N80 gateway processing significant traffic.

2978
04:20:56,654 --> 04:21:01,700
他们还看到挂载在已停止数月的实例上的 EBS 卷产生了费用。
They also see charges for EBS volumes attached to instances stopped for months.

2979
04:21:02,160 --> 04:21:04,676
关于这些费用的哪项陈述是正确的？
Which statement about these charges is correct?

2980
04:21:05,454 --> 04:21:07,076
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2981
04:21:13,198 --> 04:21:14,244
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

2982
04:21:14,638 --> 04:21:20,000
这个问题与其他题目构建方式不同，因为它测试的是计费事实而非服务选择。
This question is built differently from the others because it tests pricing facts rather than service selection.

2983
04:21:20,240 --> 04:21:22,720
四个选项中有三个把规则说反了。
Three of the four options state a rule backwards.

2984
04:21:22,960 --> 04:21:25,892
流入的数据是免费的，流出的才收费，而不是相反的情况。
Transfer in is free and out is charged, not the reverse.

2985
04:21:26,720 --> 04:21:32,772
挂载在运行中的实例上的弹性 IP 地址是免费的，而闲置的则会收费。
An elastic IP address attached to a running instance is free while an idle one is charged.

2986
04:21:33,678 --> 04:21:36,644
而且停止的实例仍然会收取存储费用。
And a stopped instance still bins for storage.

2987
04:21:37,520 --> 04:21:43,844
这些都是被说反了的小知识点，这就是为什么这里的方向非常重要。
Each of those is a small fact stated the wrong way around, which is why direction matters so much here.

2988
04:21:45,550 --> 04:21:46,596
场景成功了。
Worked scenario.

2989
04:21:48,622 --> 04:21:49,120
5。
5.

2990
04:21:50,382 --> 04:21:56,800
一家公司必须运行一个旧有的数据库，其许可是按物理 CPU 插槽出售的。
A company must run a legacy database whose license is sold per physical CPU socket.

2991
04:21:57,294 --> 04:22:05,348
协议要求公司准确展示软件运行在多少个插槽上，且该公司已经拥有这些许可。
The agreement requires the company to demonstrate exactly how many sockets the software runs on and the company already owns the licenses.

2992
04:22:06,254 --> 04:22:09,828
他们想在 AWS 上使用这些许可，而不是购买新的。
It wants to use them on AWS rather than buying new ones.

2993
04:22:10,286 --> 04:22:11,524
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

2994
04:22:17,550 --> 04:22:18,480
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

2995
04:22:18,734 --> 04:22:25,220
选项 B 和 C 都提供专用硬件。所以“专用”和“隔离”这两个词无法区分它们。
Options B and C both give you dedicated hardware. So the words dedicated and isolated will not separate them.

2996
04:22:27,758 --> 04:22:29,476
决定性的词是“可见性”。
The deciding word is visibility.

2997
04:22:30,414 --> 04:22:38,084
公司必须准确展示软件运行在多少个插槽上，而只有专用主机会显示插槽和核心数量。
The company must demonstrate exactly how many sockets the software runs on, and only dedicated hosts expose socket and core counts.

2998
04:22:38,990 --> 04:22:43,120
专用实例隔离了硬件，但不会向你展示里面是什么。
Dedicated instances isolate the hardware without showing you what is in it.

2999
04:22:43,374 --> 04:22:50,084
每当题目提到“自带许可”并包含插槽或核心术语时，答案就是专用主机。
Whenever a question mentions bring your own license with socket or core terms, the answer is dedicated hosts.

3000
04:22:51,694 --> 04:22:56,900
总结一下，折扣仅源于承诺或接受中断，没有其他原因。
To recap, discounts come from commitment or from accepting interruption and nothing else.

3001
04:22:57,550 --> 04:23:04,420
稳定且不变意味着预留实例，而稳定但转向 Fargate 或 Lambda 则意味着计算节省计划。
Steady and unchanging means reserved, while steady but moving to Farget or Lambda means compute savings plans.

3002
04:23:05,710 --> 04:23:12,452
竞价实例需要场景中提到三点：可中断、可重启，且没有严格的截止日期。
Spot needs three things stated in the scenario interruptible, restartable, and no tight deadline.

3003
04:23:13,040 --> 04:23:18,468
基于插槽的许可意味着专用主机，因为只有它们会显示插槽信息。
Socket based licenses mean dedicated hosts because only they show you the sockets.

3004
04:23:18,720 --> 04:23:22,852
数据流入是免费的，而数据流出要收费，所以回答前要确认流量方向。
And data in is free while data out costs, so check direction before answering.

3005
04:23:27,054 --> 04:23:30,064
下一个模块是成本管理工具。
Next module the cost management tools.

3006
04:23:31,310 --> 04:23:33,860
上一个模块涵盖了哪些项目会产生费用。
The previous module covered what things cost.

3007
04:23:34,704 --> 04:23:38,948
这个模块涵盖的是用于规划、监控和理解这些支出的工具。
This one covers the tools for planning, watching, and understanding that spend.

3008
04:23:39,790 --> 04:23:46,660
相关服务很少且界限清晰，这使得它成为本课程中最容易答对的模块之一。
The services are few and their boundaries are clean, which makes this one of the most reliably answerable modules in the course.

3009
04:23:48,366 --> 04:23:54,224
这个模块中的每个工具都在不同时间点回答关于金钱的问题。
Every tool in this module answers a question about money at a different point in time.

3010
04:23:54,574 --> 04:23:57,252
在花钱之前，你进行估算。
Before you spend anything, you estimate.

3011
04:23:57,934 --> 04:24:01,668
在花钱的过程中，你设定限制并留意异常情况。
While you are spending, you set limits and watch for surprises.

3012
04:24:02,062 --> 04:24:04,868
花钱之后，你分析发生了什么。
After you have spent, you analyze what happened.

3013
04:24:05,504 --> 04:24:06,340
搞清楚
Work out

3014
04:24:07,086 --> 04:24:13,476
场景描述的是这三个阶段中的哪一个，对应的工具几乎是自动匹配的。
which of those three the scenario is describing, and the tool follows almost automatically.

3015
04:24:15,118 --> 04:24:16,864
这 5 个工具对应不同的时间点。
5 tools map to time.

3016
04:24:17,264 --> 04:24:20,704
在构建之前，价格计算器用于估算成本。
Before you build, the pricing calculator estimates cost.

3017
04:24:21,358 --> 04:24:28,772
在过程中，AWS 预算设置阈值并在你超出前发出警报，而成本异常检测则能发现异常情况。
During, AWS budget sets a threshold and alerts you before you exceed it, and cost anomaly detection spots unusual.

3018
04:24:29,326 --> 04:24:30,596
自动支出。
Spend automatically.

3019
04:24:31,086 --> 04:24:35,524
之后，成本管理器可视化并分析你实际花费的金额。
After, cost explorer visualizes and analyses what you actually spent.

3020
04:24:36,384 --> 04:24:42,384
成本和使用报告为你自己的分析提供最详细的明细数据。
The cost and usage report provides the most detailed line item data for your own analysis.

3021
04:24:42,624 --> 04:24:46,692
估算尚未构建的东西，永远是价格计算器。
Estimating something unbuilt is always the pricing calculator.

3022
04:24:48,142 --> 04:24:53,028
这是本模块的核心考点，并且在题库分析中出现了 16 次。
This is the pair the module turns on and it appeared 16 times in the bank analysis.

3023
04:24:53,424 --> 04:24:55,012
AWS 预算是向前看的。
Budgets looks forward.

3024
04:24:55,184 --> 04:25:02,692
你设置一个阈值，并在实际或预测支出达到时收到警报，它能在你超支前采取行动。
You set a threshold and receive an alert on either actual or forecast spend and it acts before you overspend.

3025
04:25:03,566 --> 04:25:05,572
成本管理器是向后看的。
Cost explorer looks backward.

3026
04:25:06,478 --> 04:25:14,948
你可以可视化并分析历史成本和使用情况，并按服务、标签、区域或账户进行过滤和分组。
You visualize and analyze historical cost and usage, filtering and grouping by service, tag, region or account.

3027
04:25:15,502 --> 04:25:18,180
“提醒我超出时”的意思就是预算。
Alert me when we exceed means budgets.

3028
04:25:20,174 --> 04:25:23,460
“展示我们花了多少以及花在哪里了”意味着成本管理器。
Show me what we spent and where means cost explorer.

3029
04:25:25,264 --> 04:25:32,836
使用 AWS 预算，你可以为成本或使用量设置阈值，并在实际或预测支出超过时收到通知。
With AWS budgets, you set a threshold for cost or usage and are notified when actual or forecast spend crosses it.

3030
04:25:33,344 --> 04:25:39,108
AWS 预算可以针对特定服务、标签、关联账户或整个组织进行范围划分。
Budgets can be scoped to a service, a tag, a linked account, or the whole organization.

3031
04:25:40,064 --> 04:25:45,860
基于预测的警报更有价值，因为它们能在月底前提醒你，而不是在月底之后。
Forecast-based alerts are the real value because they warn you before the month ends rather than after.

3032
04:25:47,342 --> 04:25:58,500
还有用于跟踪预留实例和节省计划使用的预算，当超过阈值时，预算操作可以自动执行策略或停止资源。
There are also budgets tracking reserved instance and savings plans utilization, and budget actions can automatically apply a policy or stop resources when a threshold is breached.

3033
04:25:59,790 --> 04:26:06,340
成本管理器通过你可以过滤和分组的图表和表格来可视化历史成本和使用情况。
Cost Explorer visualizes historical cost and usage with graphs and tables you can filter and group.

3034
04:26:06,958 --> 04:26:14,884
当每个部门都有自己的 AWS 账户时，按关联账户分组就是公司报告每个部门支出的方式。
Grouping by linked account is how a company reports spend per department when each department has its own AWS account.

3035
04:26:15,104 --> 04:26:17,824
而这种情况经常出现。
And that exact scenario appears often.

3036
04:26:18,384 --> 04:26:23,556
它还可以按服务、区域、实例类型和成本分配标签进行分组。
It also groups by service, region, instance type, and cost allocation tag.

3037
04:26:23,984 --> 04:26:26,980
它提供容量规划和购买建议。
It provides write sizing and purchase recommendations.

3038
04:26:27,264 --> 04:26:33,476
它确实会进行预测，但该预测是基于过去的用量，而不是针对新计划的预测。
And it does forecast, but that forecast comes from past usage rather than from a plan for something new.

3039
04:26:34,734 --> 04:26:37,264
两者都涉及你已经花费的内容。
Both concern what you already spent.

3040
04:26:37,424 --> 04:26:41,124
区别在于你是想要一个答案还是要原始数据。
And the separator is whether you want an answer or the data.

3041
04:26:41,742 --> 04:26:48,100
成本管理器是你在控制台中查看包含图表和表格的工具，可以直接回答问题。
Cost Explorer is a tool you look at with graphs and tables in the console that answer questions directly.

3042
04:26:49,006 --> 04:26:51,556
除了启用它之外，不需要任何设置。
It needs no setup beyond enabling it.

3043
04:26:52,462 --> 04:26:55,684
成本和使用报告是一个文件处理过程。
The cost and usage report is a file due process.

3044
04:26:56,544 --> 04:27:05,828
它是可用的最细粒度的账单数据，按计划交付到 S3，并可通过 Athena、Redshift 或商业智能工具进行查询。
It is the most granular billing data available, delivered to S3 on a schedule and queried with Athena, Redshift, or a business intelligence tool.

3045
04:27:06,144 --> 04:27:08,804
控制台分析意味着成本管理器。
Console analysis means cost explorer.

3046
04:27:10,094 --> 04:27:12,388
提供给你自己的系统意味着报告。
Feeding your own systems means the report.

3047
04:27:13,966 --> 04:27:18,288
价格计算器在你构建架构之前估算其成本。
The pricing calculator estimates the cost of an architecture before you build it.

3048
04:27:18,448 --> 04:27:23,428
你可以剔除服务和数量，它会生成一个可以分享的月度估算。
You discard the services and quantities, and it produces a monthly estimate you can share.

3049
04:27:23,918 --> 04:27:29,408
至关重要的一点是，它永远看不到你的账户，所以它不知道你实际运行或花费了什么。
Critically, it never sees your account, so it has no knowledge of what you actually run or spend.

3050
04:27:29,966 --> 04:27:33,604
这使得它在业务案例和比较架构时非常有用。
That makes it useful for business cases and comparing architectures.

3051
04:27:33,902 --> 04:27:36,004
记住第三模块提到的界限。
And remember the boundary from module 3.

3052
04:27:36,654 --> 04:27:39,588
它无法与你当前的本地部署成本进行比较，
It cannot compare against your current on-premises costs,

3053
04:27:40,430 --> 04:27:42,884
那是迁移评估器的功能。
which is what migration evaluator does.

3054
04:27:44,174 --> 04:27:50,884
标签是资源上的关键值标签，而成本分配标签能让这些标签出现在账单数据中。
Tags are key value labels on resources and cost allocation tags make those labels appear in billing data.

3055
04:27:51,598 --> 04:27:59,076
当所有内容都在一个账户中时，这就是公司将支出归属到项目、团队或环境的方法。
That is how a company attributes spend to a project, team, or environment when everything sits in one account.

3056
04:27:59,598 --> 04:28:09,060
它们必须在账单控制台中激活才会出现在报告中，且激活不具有追溯力，因此激活前的日期数据不会被标记。
They must be activated in the billing console before they appear in reports, and activation is not retrospective, so data from before activation is not tagged.

3057
04:28:09,838 --> 04:28:11,236
这里有一个有用的对应关系。
Here is the useful pairing.

3058
04:28:12,142 --> 04:28:14,372
每个部门使用独立账户意味着
Separate accounts per department means

3059
04:28:15,534 --> 04:28:17,124
按关联账户分组。
group by linked account.

3060
04:28:18,190 --> 04:28:21,380
一个共享账户意味着成本分配标签。
One shared account means cost allocation tags.

3061
04:28:23,022 --> 04:28:28,868
合并账单为组织中所有由管理账户支付的账户提供统一账单。
Consolidated billing gives one bin for all accounts in an organization paid by the management account.

3062
04:28:29,488 --> 04:28:37,156
使用量会在这些账户之间汇总，因此比任何单个账户单独达到更早地达到批量折扣层级。
Usage is aggregated across those accounts, so volume discount tiers are reached sooner than any single account would reach them alone.

3063
04:28:38,190 --> 04:28:42,948
预留实例和节省计划的优惠也可以跨账户适用。
Reserved instance and savings plans benefits can apply across accounts too.

3064
04:28:43,328 --> 04:28:48,356
每个账户的独立成本仍然可见，所以合并后不会隐藏任何信息。
Each account's individual costs remain visible, so nothing is hidden by combining them.

3065
04:28:49,194 --> 04:28:51,300
而且组织本身不产生费用。
And organizations itself cost nothing.

3066
04:28:51,566 --> 04:28:53,924
所以节省仅仅是来自于汇总。
So the saving comes purely from aggregation.

3067
04:28:55,630 --> 04:29:03,748
成本异常检测利用机器学习来学习您的正常支出模式，然后在支出偏离该模式时提醒您。
Cost anomaly detection uses machine learning to learn your normal spending pattern, then alerts you when spend deviates from it.

3068
04:29:05,358 --> 04:29:12,100
关键区别在于它检测的是异常支出，而不是超过某个阈值的支出，这决定了相关题目。
The key distinction is that it detects unusual spend rather than spend above a threshold and that decides questions.

3069
04:29:13,070 --> 04:29:18,276
它能捕捉到某项服务突然成本变高，或者有人不小心遗留运行的资源。
It catches a service suddenly costing more or a resource someone left running by mistake.

3070
04:29:18,608 --> 04:29:25,988
但一个每个月都持续超支的部门并不属于异常情况，所以异常检测不会报警，而预算功能会触发警报。
But a department that steadily overspends every month is not anomalous, so anomaly detection stays silent while budgets would fire.

3071
04:29:26,368 --> 04:29:29,892
它是免费的，且提醒通过电子邮件或 SNS 发送。
It is free and alerts go by email or SNS.

3072
04:29:31,470 --> 04:29:35,236
这七种表述涵盖了几乎所有的成本管理问题。
Seven phrasings covering nearly every cost management question.

3073
04:29:35,502 --> 04:29:39,012
在构建前进行估算意味着使用价格计算器。
Estimating before building means the pricing calculator.

3074
04:29:39,248 --> 04:29:42,528
在超过分配额之前发出警报意味着使用预算。
Alert before exceeding an allocation means budgets.

3075
04:29:42,768 --> 04:29:46,404
显示上个季度各部门的支出意味着使用成本管理器。
Showing last quarter spent by department means cost explorer.

3076
04:29:46,848 --> 04:29:50,564
检测到意外的激增意味着异常检测。
Detecting an unexpected spike means anomaly detection.

3077
04:29:51,534 --> 04:29:56,452
将详细的项目加载到您自己的工具中意味着成本和使用报告。
Loading detailed line items into your own tools means the cost and usage report.

3078
04:29:57,550 --> 04:30:01,732
在同一个账户内划分支出意味着成本分配标签。
Attributing spend within one account means cost allocation tags.

3079
04:30:02,606 --> 04:30:07,648
并且一份带有更好批量折扣的账单意味着合并账单。
And one bill with better volume discounts means consolidated billing.

3080
04:30:09,038 --> 04:30:09,924
工作场景。
Work scenario.

3081
04:30:10,208 --> 04:30:20,292
1. 一位财务总监想要一份按部门划分的 AWS 支出月度报告。每个部门都在一个启用合并账单的组织下拥有自己的 AWS 账户。
1. A finance director wants a monthly report of AWS spend broken down by department. Each department has its own AWS account under one organization with consolidated billing.

3082
04:30:21,070 --> 04:30:28,580
另外，当任何部门的预测月度支出有可能会超过其分配额时，总监要求发送一封电子邮件。
Separately, the director wants an email whenever any department's forecast monthly spend is on track to exceed its allocation.

3083
04:30:30,368 --> 04:30:32,676
选择暂停并做决定。
Choose to pause and decide.

3084
04:30:38,542 --> 04:30:42,884
答案是 A 和 B，两个需求分别对应一个工具。
The answers are A and B, two requirements and one tool each.

3085
04:30:46,030 --> 04:30:50,692
回顾性的部门细分是按关联账户分组的成本管理器。
The backward-looking departmental breakdown is cost explorer grouping by linked account.

3086
04:30:51,886 --> 04:30:54,532
前瞻性的阈值警报是预算。
The forward-looking threshold alert is budgets.

3087
04:30:55,694 --> 04:31:01,220
选项 E 是最强有力的干扰项，因为异常检测确实会发送关于支出的警报。
Option E is the sharpest distractor because anomaly detection does send alerts about spend.

3088
04:31:02,126 --> 04:31:08,068
但它提醒的是相对于您的模式不寻常的支出，而不是超过计划分配额。
But it alerts on spend that is unusual relative to your pattern, not on crossing a planned allocation.

3089
04:31:08,448 --> 04:31:12,644
一个每个月都持续超支的部门永远不会触发它。
A department that steadily overspends every month would never trigger it.

3090
04:31:14,384 --> 04:31:16,044
工作场景 2。
Work Scenario 2.

3091
04:31:17,198 --> 04:31:21,764
一家公司计划将一个三层架构的应用迁移到 AWS。
A company is planning to migrate a three-tier application to AWS.

3092
04:31:22,670 --> 04:31:27,364
在正式投入之前，团队需要对拟定的设计进行月度成本估算。
Before committing, the team needs a monthly cost estimate for the proposed design.

3093
04:31:28,078 --> 04:31:34,372
为了提交给董事会提案，这涵盖了 EC2 实例、RDS 数据库和 S3 storage。
It covers EC2 instances, an RDS database, and S3 storage for a board proposal.

3094
04:31:35,342 --> 04:31:37,732
目前还没有任何东西部署到 AWS 上。
Nothing has been deployed to AWS yet.

3095
04:31:44,784 --> 04:31:46,304
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

3096
04:31:46,944 --> 04:31:51,748
最后一句话起到了关键作用，值得注意的是它处理得非常高效。
The final sentence does all the work, and it is worth noticing how efficiently.

3097
04:31:56,782 --> 04:31:59,364
目前还没有任何东西部署到 AWS 上。
Nothing has been deployed to AWS yet.

3098
04:31:59,824 --> 04:32:07,012
本模块中的其他所有工具都是读取你账户的实际使用情况。所以，如果没有使用记录，它们就没东西可读了。
Every other tool in this module reads your actual account usage. So, with no usage, there is nothing for them to read.

3099
04:32:07,726 --> 04:32:12,964
价格计算器是唯一一个根据描述而非基于数据来工作的工具。
The pricing calculator is the only one that works from a description rather than from data.

3100
04:32:13,390 --> 04:32:20,740
每当场景中出现“在构建前”、“规划中”或“拟议中”时，都要检查账户是否有任何使用记录。
Whenever a scenario says before building, planning, or proposed, check whether the account has any usage at all.

3101
04:32:22,254 --> 04:32:23,236
实战案例。
Worked scenario.

3102
04:32:24,462 --> 04:32:30,308
3. 一家公司在由四个项目团队共享的单一 AWS 账户中运行所有内容。
3. A company runs everything in a single AWS account shared by four project teams.

3103
04:32:30,958 --> 04:32:37,956
财务部门想知道每个项目的成本，但所有资源都在同一个账户中，所以没有可以分组的依据。
Finance wants to know how much each project costs, but every resource sits in the same account, so there is nothing to group by.

3104
04:32:38,464 --> 04:32:41,316
该公司愿意更改资源的标注方式。
The company is willing to change how resources are labeled.

3105
04:32:41,984 --> 04:32:43,664
它应该采用什么？
What should it implement?

3106
04:32:44,142 --> 04:32:45,316
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3107
04:32:51,024 --> 04:32:52,452
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3108
04:32:53,134 --> 04:32:56,864
最后一句是一个提示，识别出这些信息是一个很有用的习惯。
The last sentence is an invitation and spotting those is a useful habit.

3109
04:32:57,104 --> 04:33:06,180
“愿意更改资源标注方式”直接指向标签功能，把它放在这里是为了让选项 B 正确而不是选项 A。选项 D 值得注意一下。
Willing to change how resources are labeled points directly at tagging and it is placed there to make option B correct rather than option A. Option D deserves a note.

3110
04:33:06,894 --> 04:33:12,098
成本和使用报告比任何其他东西都更详细，但这里的重点不是细节。
The cost and usage report is more detailed than anything else, but detail is not the problem here.

3111
04:33:12,464 --> 04:33:17,348
如果没有标签，账单明细中仍然没有任何内容可以识别出项目。
Without tags, the line items still contain nothing that identifies a project.

3112
04:33:18,956 --> 04:33:20,644
实战案例 4。
Worked scenario 4.

3113
04:33:21,806 --> 04:33:27,010
一家公司的 AWS 账单通常稳定在每月 3 万美元左右。
A company's AWS bill is normally stable at around $30,000 a month.

3114
04:33:27,598 --> 04:33:36,484
在一周内，某项服务的支出翻了三倍，而业务没有任何相应变化，直到账单送达时才有人注意到。
In one week, spending on a single service tripled with no corresponding change in the business and nobody noticed until the invoice arrived.

3115
04:33:37,390 --> 04:33:43,491
公司希望下次能自动收到通知，而不需要提前预测费用是多少。
The company wants to be told automatically next time without having to predict what it will be.

3116
04:33:44,174 --> 04:33:45,092
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3117
04:33:51,264 --> 04:33:52,784
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3118
04:33:53,344 --> 04:33:57,764
选项 A 其实非常接近，区分这两者正是考查重点。
Option A is genuinely close, and separating them is the point.

3119
04:33:58,254 --> 04:34:02,402
预算阈值要求有人提前决定哪个数值是关键的。
A budget threshold requires someone to decide in advance what number matters.

3120
04:34:02,926 --> 04:34:07,588
场景明确说明公司不想预测将会发生什么。
The scenario explicitly says the company does not want to predict what will happen.

3121
04:34:09,424 --> 04:34:12,132
从定义上讲，阈值就是一种预测。
A threshold is a prediction by definition.

3122
04:34:12,782 --> 04:34:18,052
异常检测则是学习模式，并标记出不符合规律的内容。
Anomaly detection learns the pattern instead and flags what does not fit.

3123
04:34:18,382 --> 04:34:23,812
还要注意，某项服务的费用翻三倍，可能根本还没达到月度总额的阈值。
Note also that one service tripling might not push the monthly total past a threshold at all.

3124
04:34:25,492 --> 04:34:26,152
实战案例
Worked Scenario

3125
04:34:29,358 --> 04:34:36,580
一家控股公司拥有 12 家企业，每家都有自己的 AWS 账户，并分别支付账单。
A holding company owns 12 businesses, each with its own AWS account, each paying its own bill separately.

3126
04:34:37,420 --> 04:34:42,340
财务部门想要一份统一的账单，并且被告知整个集团的总支出可能会减少。
Finance wants a single invoice and has been told the group might also pay less overall.

3127
04:34:42,894 --> 04:34:45,824
各家企业仍需看到各自的成本。
The businesses must still see their individual costs.

3128
04:34:46,478 --> 04:34:50,082
公司应该怎么做？为什么成本会下降？
What should the company do and why might costs fall?

3129
04:34:50,926 --> 04:34:52,068
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3130
04:34:57,934 --> 04:34:59,504
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3131
04:35:00,238 --> 04:35:08,612
有三个要求，而合并账单可以在不迁移任何工作负载的情况下满足所有要求。从管理账户生成一份统一账单。
Three requirements and consolidated billing satisfies all of them without moving a single workload. One invoice from the management account.

3132
04:35:10,188 --> 04:35:12,740
每个账户仍能看到各自的成本。
Individual costs still visible per account.

3133
04:35:13,614 --> 04:35:19,504
由于汇总后的使用量更快达到批量折扣标准，所以总费用会下降。
An aggregated usage reaching volume discount years sooner, which is why the total falls.

3134
04:35:20,078 --> 04:35:27,651
选项 A 是过度纠正，它通过破坏维持企业隔离的账户独立性来解决账单问题。
Option A is the overcorrection, solving the billing problem by destroying the account isolation that keeps the businesses separate.

3135
04:35:28,304 --> 04:35:32,740
合并账单存在的目的正是为了让你不必做出这种权衡。
Consolidated billing exists precisely, so you do not have to make that trade.

3136
04:35:34,348 --> 04:35:37,344
总结一下，按时间线来分类题目。
To recap, sort the question by time.

3137
04:35:37,646 --> 04:35:43,076
“之前”指价格计算器，“期间”指预算，“之后”指成本管理器。
Before means the pricing calculator, during means budgets, after means cost explorer.

3138
04:35:43,724 --> 04:35:47,556
“尚未部署”则排除了除价格计算器以外的所有工具。
Nothing deployed yet eliminates every tool except the pricing calculator.

3139
04:35:48,174 --> 04:35:54,308
预算是在你选择的阈值时发出警报，而异常检测是针对不符合模式的内容发出警报。
Budgets alerts on a threshold you chose, while anomaly detection alerts on what does not fit the pattern.

3140
04:35:54,894 --> 04:36:01,860
“多个账户”意味着按关联账户分组，而“一个共享账户”意味着使用成本分配标签。
Separate accounts means grouping by linked account, while one shared account means cost allocation tags.

3141
04:36:02,223 --> 04:36:04,676
别忘了，标签不是追溯性的。
And remember tags are not retrospective.

3142
04:36:05,504 --> 04:36:11,556
下一个模块是支持计划、合作伙伴和技术资源，这将完成第 4 个领域。
Next module support plans, partners and technical resources, which closes domain 4.

3143
04:36:13,294 --> 04:36:24,864
这个模块完成了第 4 个领域和教学内容。支持计划是考试中最容易预测的题目之一，因为场景会给出一个要求，而只有一个层级能提供它。
This module closes domain 4 and the teaching content. Support plans are among the most predictable questions on the exam because a scenario states a requirement and exactly one tier provides it.

3144
04:36:25,024 --> 04:36:29,264
尽管计划名称即将更改，但其背后的逻辑多年来都没有变。
The reasoning has not changed in years, even though the plan names are about to.

3145
04:36:30,574 --> 04:36:33,902
几乎所有的支持计划问题都取决于两点中的一点。
Almost every support plan question turns on one of two things.

3146
04:36:34,144 --> 04:36:41,060
当出现故障时 AWS 响应的速度有多快，以及是否分配了专门的技术联系人。
How quickly AWS responds when something is broken, and whether you are assigned a named technical contact.

3147
04:36:41,504 --> 04:36:44,356
其他所有因素，包括价格，都是次要的。
Everything else, including price, is secondary.

3148
04:36:45,230 --> 04:36:50,916
如果你能根据这两个问题来判断场景，你就能在几秒钟内回答支持计划问题。
If you can place a scenario against those two questions, you can answer support plan questions in seconds.

3149
04:36:52,812 --> 04:36:54,820
包含免费版在内的五个层级。
Five tiers including the free one.

3150
04:36:55,374 --> 04:37:04,196
基础版是免费的，提供文档、重新发布、健康仪表板和代码、顾问检查，但完全不提供技术支持案例。
Basic is free and gives documentation, repost, the health dashboard and code, trusted advisor checks, but no technical support cases at all.

3151
04:37:04,846 --> 04:37:06,692
Developer 计划增加了商务时间，
Developer adds business hours,

3152
04:37:07,404 --> 04:37:09,314
并为一名联系人提供邮件支持。
email support for one contact.

3153
04:37:10,188 --> 04:37:16,704
Business 增加了 24/7 的电话、邮件和聊天支持，以及完整的 顾问 检查。
Business adds 24-7 phone, email, and chat, plus the full trusted advisor checks it.

3154
04:37:17,100 --> 04:37:21,700
Enterprise on ramp 提供了更快的响应速度和一组技术客户经理（TAM）。
Enterprise on ramp adds faster response and a pool of technical account managers.

3155
04:37:22,144 --> 04:37:27,108
而 Enterprise 则提供最快的响应速度和一名指定的技术客户经理。
And Enterprise adds the fastest response and a designated technical account manager.

3156
04:37:28,846 --> 04:37:30,883
这些是决定题目的关键数据。
These are the numbers that decide questions.

3157
04:37:31,182 --> 04:37:34,304
通用准则是：所有付费计划都提供 24 小时内的响应。
General guidance is 24 hours on every paid plan.

3158
04:37:34,669 --> 04:37:36,164
系统受损（System impaired）是 12 小时。
System impaired is 12 hours.

3159
04:37:36,590 --> 04:37:41,668
生产环境受损（Production impaired）是 4 小时，生产环境中断（生产环境中断）是 1 小时，这两项在 Business 支持中都可用。
Production impaired is 4 hours and production down is 1 hour, both available from business supports.

3160
04:37:42,478 --> 04:37:46,820
而业务关键型系统中断（业务关键系统中断）是 15 分钟，仅在 Enterprise 中提供。
And business critical system down is 15 minutes, available only on enterprise.

3161
04:37:47,662 --> 04:37:51,170
Enterprise on ramp 为同等严重程度的情况提供 30 分钟响应。
Enterprise on ramp offers 30 minutes for that same severity.

3162
04:37:51,534 --> 04:37:56,452
注意 Developer 完全不涵盖生产环境级别的故障，这往往是决定性因素。
Notice that developer does not cover production severities at all, which is often the deciding fact.

3163
04:37:57,838 --> 04:38:04,098
在分析中，Business 和 Enterprise 同时出现 17 次。所以这是必须牢记的组合。
Business and enterprise co-occurred 17 times in the analysis. So this is the pair to hold firmly.

3164
04:38:04,652 --> 04:38:12,704
Business 提供 24/7 的电话、邮件和聊天，生产环境中断响应为 1 小时，以及完整的 顾问 检查，
Business gives 24-7 phone, email and chat, 1 hour response for production down, and the full trusted advisor checks

3165
04:38:12,944 --> 04:38:13,264
它包含这些。
it.

3166
04:38:13,838 --> 04:38:22,544
Enterprise 增加了一名指定的技术客户经理、业务关键型系统中断的 15 分钟响应、顾问 优先权，
Enterprise adds a designated technical account manager, 15-minute response for business critical systems down, trusted advisor priority,

3167
04:38:22,796 --> 04:38:25,732
架构良好审查，以及礼宾服务。
well-architected reviews, and concierge support.

3168
04:38:26,478 --> 04:38:29,314
最明显的信号是技术客户经理（TAM）。
The single tierest signal is the technical account manager.

3169
04:38:30,382 --> 04:38:32,324
Business 从未包含过它。
Business has never included one.

3170
04:38:33,966 --> 04:38:38,212
技术客户经理是这个领域中最可靠的辨别点。
The technical account manager is the most reliable giveaway in this domain.

3171
04:38:38,464 --> 04:38:50,500
它是指一位了解你环境并作为主要技术联系人的 AWS 员工。他们提供主动指导、架构审查，并协助规划诸如启动之类的活动。
It is a named AWS employee who knows your environment and acts as your primary technical contact. They provide proactive guidance, architectural review, and help planning events such as a launch.

3172
04:38:51,374 --> 04:38:54,916
只有在 Enterprise 中才会出现“指定的” TAM。
A designated TAM appears only at Enterprise.

3173
04:38:55,982 --> 04:39:00,386
Enterprise on ramp 提供的是一个资源池，而不是特定的个人。
Enterprise on ramp gives access to a pool rather than a named individual.

3174
04:39:01,230 --> 04:39:05,732
而基础的 Developer 和 Business 任何形式都不包含 TAM。
And basic developer and business include no TAM in any form.

3175
04:39:07,437 --> 04:39:11,856
支持计划涉及其他服务，这会产生一些不错的干扰项。
Support plans reach into other services, which produces some good distractors.

3176
04:39:12,205 --> 04:39:21,124
顾问 为每个账户提供代码检查，但全套功能需要 Business 或更高级别，而 顾问 优先权需要 Enterprise。
Trusted Advisor gives code checks on every account, but the full set requires business or above, and trusted advisor priority requires enterprise.

3177
04:39:22,016 --> 04:39:30,096
Shield 响应团队要求 Business 或 Enterprise，即使你已经为 Shield Advanced 每月支付 3000 美元。
The shield response team requires business or enterprise even if you already pay $3,000 a month for Shield Advanced,

3178
04:39:30,348 --> 04:39:31,844
这一点经常让考生掉进陷阱。
which catches people out.

3179
04:39:32,814 --> 04:39:41,540
此外，与 AWS 专家进行的架构审查随 Enterprise 提供，而支持 API 需要 Business 或更高级别。
Well, architecture reviews with an AWS expert come with enterprise and the support API requires business or above.

3180
04:39:43,214 --> 04:39:45,456
现在是影响本模块最多的变化。
Now the change that affects this module most.

3181
04:39:46,030 --> 04:39:56,292
2025年12月2日，AWS宣布开发者、业务和企业级 OnRamp 将于2027年1月1日退役。
On the 2nd of December 2025, AWS announced that developer, business and enterprise on ramp all retire on the 1st of January 2027.

3182
04:39:57,198 --> 04:40:04,484
Business Support Plus 取代了每月29美元的开发者和业务支持，提供30分钟的关键响应。
Business support plus replaces developer and business from $29 a month with 30-minute critical response.

3183
04:40:05,614 --> 04:40:10,096
企业级支持继续保留，但其最低费用从15,000美元降至5,000美元。
Enterprise support continues with its minimum reduced from $15,000 to $5,000.

3184
04:40:10,816 --> 04:40:15,428
一种全新的顶级统一运营服务起步价为50,000美元。
And a new top tier unified operations starts at $50,000.

3185
04:40:16,398 --> 04:40:19,332
在考试中，请按照旧的四个名称来回答。
On the exam, answer with the old four names.

3186
04:40:20,750 --> 04:40:23,936
AWS 合作伙伴网络有两种类型的成员。
The RWS Partner Network has two kinds of member.

3187
04:40:24,526 --> 04:40:30,404
咨询合作伙伴是为客户设计、构建和管理 AWS 环境的公司。
Consulting partners are firms that design, build and manage AWS environments for customers.

3188
04:40:31,246 --> 04:40:37,188
技术合作伙伴是独立软件供应商，其产品在 AWS 上运行或与 AWS 集成。
Technology partners are independent software vendors whose products run on or integrate with AWS.

3189
04:40:38,126 --> 04:40:43,652
合作伙伴由 AWS 认证，并在安全或迁移等领域拥有专业能力。
Partners are certified by AWS and hold competencies in areas such as security or migration.

3190
04:40:44,176 --> 04:40:49,764
另外，AWS 专业服务是 AWS 自有的咨询组织。
Separately, AWS Professional Services is AWS's own consulting organization.

3191
04:40:50,176 --> 04:40:56,676
所以，第三方执行工作意味着咨询合作伙伴，而由 AWS 执行则意味着专业服务。
So a third party doing the work means a consulting partner while AWS doing it means professional services.

3192
04:40:58,286 --> 04:41:06,564
AWS 市场是第三方软件的数字目录，这些软件在 AWS 上运行并由独立供应商销售。
AWS Marketplace is a digital catalog of third-party software that runs on AWS sold by independent vendors.

3193
04:41:06,976 --> 04:41:12,324
软件可以通过几次点击即可部署，通常作为预配置好的 Amazon machine image。
Software can be deployed in a few clicks, often as a pre-configured Amazon machine image.

3194
04:41:12,816 --> 04:41:18,148
费用会出现在您的 AWS 账单上，因此不需要针对每个供应商进行单独的采购流程。
Charges appear on your AWS bill, so there is no separate procurement process per vendor.

3195
04:41:18,976 --> 04:41:29,296
经典的考试场景是需要一个预装了第三方防火墙或安全工具的 EC2 实例，并将其与服务目录分开，
The classic exam scenario is needing an EC2 instance with a third-party firewall or security tool already installed and keep it separate from service catalog,

3196
04:41:29,454 --> 04:41:31,972
服务目录列出的是您自己批准的内部产品。
which lists your own approved internal products.

3197
04:41:33,710 --> 04:41:37,572
考试指南中直接提到了几种免费资源。
Several free resources are named directly in the exam guide.

3198
04:41:38,190 --> 04:41:44,336
AWS Repost 是社区问答服务，取代了之前的 AWS 论坛。
AWS Repost is the community question and answer service, which replace the old AWS forums.

3199
04:41:45,006 --> 04:41:49,892
AWS 知识中心包含对常见技术问题的解答。
The AWS Knowledge Center holds answers to frequently asked technical questions.

3200
04:41:50,830 --> 04:41:55,748
AWS 规范性指南发布模式、策略和迁移剧本。
AWS Prescriptive Guidance publishes patterns, strategies, and migration playbooks.

3201
04:41:56,016 --> 04:42:00,388
白皮书和文档对所有人免费，包括基础账户。
White papers and documentation are free to everyone, including basic accounts.

3202
04:42:00,656 --> 04:42:06,276
而 AWS 信任与安全是您举报源自 AWS 资源滥用行为的地方。
And AWS Trust and Safety is where you report abuse originating from AWS resources.

3203
04:42:07,950 --> 04:42:11,332
这七个要点涵盖了这里的几乎所有问题。
Seventh raisings covering nearly every question here.

3204
04:42:12,078 --> 04:42:15,492
指定的技术客户经理意味着企业级。
A designated technical account manager means enterprise.

3205
04:42:17,038 --> 04:42:18,496
业务关键型系统。
Business critical system.

3206
04:42:19,150 --> 04:42:22,340
15分钟响应时间意味着企业级。
Down with 15-minute response means enterprise.

3207
04:42:24,016 --> 04:42:28,900
提供无特定联系人名称的 24/7 电话支持意味着业务级。
24-7 phone support with no name contact means business.

3208
04:42:29,742 --> 04:42:33,508
仅限非生产环境在工作时间内通过邮件提供的支持意味着开发者级。
Business hours email only for non-production means developer.

3209
04:42:34,318 --> 04:42:38,628
免费的文档和社区答案意味着基础级别。
Documentation and community answers at no cost means basic.

3210
04:42:39,886 --> 04:42:43,364
预装第三方防火墙意味着市场（Marketplace）。
A third-party firewall pre-installed means marketplace.

3211
04:42:44,270 --> 04:42:48,772
而且提到合作伙伴公司来执行迁移，意味着是 APN 咨询合作伙伴。
And a partner firm to run a migration means an APN consulting partner.

3212
04:42:50,542 --> 04:42:51,460
案例场景。
Work scenario.

3213
04:42:52,176 --> 04:42:56,644
1. 一家公司在 AWS 上运行其主要的盈利平台。
1. A company runs its main revenue generating platform on AWS.

3214
04:42:56,976 --> 04:43:03,940
如果该平台宕机，它要求 15 分钟内做出响应，并需要一位了解其架构的指定 AWS 联系人。
It requires a 15 minute response if that platform goes down and a named AWS contact who understands its architecture.

3215
04:43:04,462 --> 04:43:08,260
它还希望由 AWS 专家进行年度的架构良好审查。
It also wants an annual well architected review by an AWS expert.

3216
04:43:09,134 --> 04:43:11,204
成本不是首要考虑因素。
Cost is not the primary concern.

3217
04:43:11,694 --> 04:43:12,836
停下来，做决定。
Pause and decide.

3218
04:43:18,926 --> 04:43:20,640
答案是 D。
The answer is D.

3219
04:43:21,134 --> 04:43:28,320
Enterprise OnRamp 是一个有趣的干扰项，因为它满足了两个要求的较弱版本。
Enterprise on ramp is the interesting distractor because it satisfies weaker versions of two requirements.

3220
04:43:28,480 --> 04:43:34,948
它提供的是 30 分钟而不是 15 分钟，并且是技术客户经理池而不是指定的联系人。
It gives 30 minutes rather than 15 and a pool of technical account managers rather than a named one.

3221
04:43:35,758 --> 04:43:39,120
两者都很接近，但都不是要求的选项。
Both are close and neither is what was asked for.

3222
04:43:39,662 --> 04:43:44,880
这是一个干扰项，如果题干中的数字稍微宽松一点，它就会是正确答案。
This is a distractor that would be correct if the numbers in the STEM were slightly softer.

3223
04:43:45,422 --> 04:43:48,036
要看给出的具体数值，而不是大概的轮廓。
Read the stated figure, not the general shape.

3224
04:43:49,710 --> 04:43:51,040
案例场景 2。
Worked scenario 2.

3225
04:43:51,280 --> 04:43:56,480
一家初创公司在 AWS 上仅运行开发和测试工作负载，没有生产系统。
A startup runs only development and test workloads on AWS with no production systems.

3226
04:43:56,720 --> 04:44:02,596
它希望在工作时间内以尽可能低的成本开启技术支持案例并获得指导。
It wants to open technical support cases and receive guidance during working hours at the lowest possible cost.

3227
04:44:03,886 --> 04:44:05,988
不需要有人提供全天候的联系。
Nobody needs to be reachable overnight.

3228
04:44:06,702 --> 04:44:08,132
它应该选择哪种方案？
Which plan should it choose?

3229
04:44:08,686 --> 04:44:10,244
停下来，做决定。
Pause and decide.

3230
04:44:16,142 --> 04:44:17,092
答案是
The answer is

3231
04:44:17,600 --> 04:44:17,920
B。
B.

3232
04:44:18,240 --> 04:44:22,820
选项 A 是一个真正的陷阱，它会误导那些只考虑成本优化的用户。
Option A is a genuine trap and it catches people who optimize on cost alone.

3233
04:44:26,382 --> 04:44:37,600
Basic 是免费的且最便宜，但它完全不包含技术支持案例。你只能获得文档、白皮书、再发布和健康仪表板，这些都是默认开启的。
Basic is free and it is the cheapest, but it includes no technical support cases whatsoever. You get documentation, white papers, repost, and the health dashboard, and that is on.

3234
04:44:38,254 --> 04:44:45,220
一旦场景提到公司想要开启支持案例，无论预算如何，BASIC 都会被排除。
The moment a scenario says the company wants to open support cases, BASIC is eliminated regardless of budget.

3235
04:44:45,998 --> 04:44:48,036
而选项 C 则从另一个方面失败了。
And option C fails the other way.

3236
04:44:48,430 --> 04:44:52,000
它增加了初创公司明确排除的夜间覆盖服务。
Adding overnight coverage the startup has explicitly ruled out.

3237
04:44:53,454 --> 04:44:54,564
案例场景。
Worked scenario.

3238
04:44:54,958 --> 04:45:00,420
3. 一家公司已经为其公共 Web 应用程序订阅了 Shield Advanced。
3. A company already subscribes to Shield Advanced for its public web application.

3239
04:45:01,102 --> 04:45:08,996
在发生大规模拒绝服务攻击期间，它试图联系 AWS Shield 响应团队，却发现无法创建案例。
During a large denial of service attack, it tries to contact the AWS Shield response team and finds it cannot open the case.

3240
04:45:09,710 --> 04:45:11,876
该公司使用的是开发者支持。
The company is on developer support.

3241
04:45:13,486 --> 04:45:15,520
为什么它联系不上团队？
Why can it not reach the team?

3242
04:45:16,960 --> 04:45:17,920
然后做出判断。
And decide.

3243
04:45:23,982 --> 04:45:26,000
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

3244
04:45:26,862 --> 04:45:30,756
这道题之所以存在，是因为它设了一个非常合理的假设。
This question exists because it catches a very reasonable assumption.

3245
04:45:31,280 --> 04:45:39,716
公司每月支付 3000 美元购买 Shield Advanced，理应认为这包含了 Shield Advanced 提供的所有功能。
The company has paid $3,000 a month for Shield Advanced and would expect that to include everything Shield Advanced offers.

3246
04:45:40,622 --> 04:45:45,700
但要联系到 Shield 响应团队，还需要额外的商务或企业支持计划。
But reaching the Shield response team depends on a business or enterprise support plan as well.

3247
04:45:46,320 --> 04:45:52,804
选项 D 是一个高难度的干扰项，因为它提到的关于开发者支持的描述虽然是正确的，但并不是原因。
Option D is the sophisticated distractor because it states something true about developer support that is not the reason.

3248
04:45:53,198 --> 04:45:56,836
要注意那些事实正确但回答了不同问题的选项。
Watch for options that are factually correct but answer a different question.

3249
04:45:58,446 --> 04:45:59,840
处理情景 4。
Worked scenario 4.

3250
04:46:00,080 --> 04:46:08,612
一家公司想在已经安装并获得授权软件的 EC2 实例上部署商用的 Network Firewall 设备。
A company wants to deploy a commercial network firewall appliance onto an EC2 instance with the software already installed and licensed.

3251
04:46:09,440 --> 04:46:11,780
它不想自己去安装。
It does not want to install it itself.

3252
04:46:12,590 --> 04:46:18,884
另外，它希望由一家拥有成熟 AWS 经验的外部公司来执行即将到来的迁移。
Separately, it wants an external firm with proven AWS expertise to run its upcoming migration.

3253
04:46:19,822 --> 04:46:22,404
停下来思考一下并做出决定。
Choose to pause and decide.

3254
04:46:28,480 --> 04:46:30,880
答案是 A 和 C。
The answers are A and C.

3255
04:46:31,360 --> 04:46:36,100
选项 B 是最接近的错误选项，而区分它们的关键点只是一个词。
Option B is the closest miss, and the separator is a single word.

3256
04:46:36,480 --> 04:46:45,924
公司想要的是外部公司，而 AWS 专业服务 是 AWS 自家的咨询组织，而不是外部机构。
The company wants an external firm and AWS Professional Services is AWS's own consulting organization rather than an external one.

3257
04:46:46,670 --> 04:46:49,028
两者都有能力执行迁移。
Both would be capable of running the migration.

3258
04:46:49,200 --> 04:46:52,324
所以情景中必须明确它想要哪一种，而且题目里确实说明了。
So the scenario has to tell you which it wants, and it does.

3259
04:46:53,710 --> 04:46:57,714
选项 B 是第九模块中提到的 Marketplace 和服务目录的区别。
Option B is the marketplace and service catalog distinction from module nine.

3260
04:46:58,494 --> 04:47:02,148
第三方商用软件意味着 Marketplace。
Third party commercial software means marketplace.

3261
04:47:03,822 --> 04:47:06,660
总结一下，这部分内容结束了领域 4。
To recap, and this closes domain 4.

3262
04:47:07,342 --> 04:47:14,116
指定的技术客户经理意味着企业计划，这是该领域中最明确的信号。
A designated technical account manager means enterprise, and it is the single clearest signal in this domain.

3263
04:47:15,150 --> 04:47:17,360
15 分钟意味着企业计划。
15 minutes means enterprise.

3264
04:47:17,678 --> 04:47:19,940
30 分钟意味着企业计划。
30 minutes means enterprise.

3265
04:47:20,430 --> 04:47:23,364
在 On Ramp 中，一小时意味着商务计划。
On ramp, one hour means business.

3266
04:47:24,238 --> 04:47:27,840
Basic 计划根本不包含任何技术支持案例。
Basic includes no technical support cases at all.

3267
04:47:28,398 --> 04:47:34,724
Shield Advanced 仍然需要商务或企业计划才能联系到 Shield 响应团队。
Shield Advanced still needs a business or enterprise plan to reach the Shield response team.

3268
04:47:35,022 --> 04:47:40,228
而且 Marketplace 销售第三方软件，而服务目录列出的是你自己的产品。
And Marketplace sells third party software while service catalog lists your own.

3269
04:47:40,814 --> 04:47:42,980
这完成了教学模块。
That completes the teaching modules.

3270
04:47:43,438 --> 04:47:47,300
接下来是三个跨领域模块和模拟考试。
Next come the three cross cutting modules and the practice exams.

3271
04:47:48,974 --> 04:47:54,436
这个模块几乎没有新信息，而这正是它的目的。
This module contains almost no new information, and that is exactly the point.

3272
04:47:54,894 --> 04:47:57,124
这里的内容你都已经遇到过了。
Everything here you have already met.

3273
04:47:57,646 --> 04:48:05,828
这个模块的作用是把经常一起出现在选项中的服务并列排放，并给每一对提供一句话来区分它们。
What this module does is put the services that appear together as options side by side and give you one sentence that separates each pair.

3274
04:48:06,656 --> 04:48:11,460
它把理解转化为识别，这正是你在面对时间压力时需要的。
It converts understanding into recognition, which is what you need under time pressure.

3275
04:48:12,942 --> 04:48:16,836
关于这个清单是如何选出的，简单说明一下，这不是瞎猜的。
A word on how this list was chosen because it is not guesswork.

3276
04:48:17,710 --> 04:48:24,356
我们分析了 900 道 AP 练习题，找出哪些服务经常出现在同一个问题中。
900 AP practice questions were analyzed for which services co-occur inside the same question.

3277
04:48:24,974 --> 04:48:31,492
这个模块中的配对是那些真正作为竞争选项同时出现的项，并按出现频率进行了排序。
The pairs in this module are the ones that genuinely turn up together as competing options ranked by how often.

3278
04:48:32,430 --> 04:48:38,980
这和你凭直觉列出的清单不同，而且它更有用。
That is a different list from the one you would write by intuition and it is a more useful one.

3279
04:48:40,750 --> 04:48:46,084
配对 1 是在整个分析中出现频率最高的单一配对。
Pair 1 and the single most frequently co-occurring pair in the whole analysis.

3280
04:48:48,014 --> 04:48:49,988
CloudTrail 记录谁做了什么。
Cloud Trail records who did what.

3281
04:48:50,884 --> 04:48:53,184
是哪个用户更新了那个安全组？
Which user updated that security group?

3282
04:48:53,584 --> 04:48:55,364
是哪个身份删除了那个存储桶？
Which identity deleted that bucket?

3283
04:48:56,558 --> 04:48:58,864
它是 API 调用的审计追踪。
It is an audit trail of API calls.

3284
04:48:59,598 --> 04:49:02,020
CloudWatch 记录事物运行的情况。
CloudWatch records how things are behaving.

3285
04:49:02,958 --> 04:49:07,332
CPU 指标、日志数据、警报、状态检查。
CPU metrics, log data, alarms, status checks.

3286
04:49:07,726 --> 04:49:11,972
区分点在于题目是问关于“操作者”还是“测量值”。
The separator is whether the question is asking about an actor or a measurement.

3287
04:49:12,336 --> 04:49:17,284
如果题干中提到了用户或身份，那几乎每次都是 CloudTrail。
If a user or identity is named in the STEM, it is loud trail almost every time.

3288
04:49:18,894 --> 04:49:21,696
配对 2，Shield 和 WAF。
Pair 2, Shield and WA.

3289
04:49:23,150 --> 04:49:29,220
它们都保护 Web 应用，并且都挂载在相似的位置，这就是它们会产生竞争的原因。
AF both protect web applications and both attach to similar places, which is why they compete.

3290
04:49:30,158 --> 04:49:31,780
Shield 处理的是流量。
Shield deals with volume.

3291
04:49:32,206 --> 04:49:41,892
它在网络层和传输层吸收拒绝服务攻击，而且 Shield 标准版对所有 AWS 客户都是免费且自动的。
It absorbs distributed denial of service attacks at the network and transport layers, and Shield standard is free and automatic for every AWS customer.

3292
04:49:42,830 --> 04:49:45,188
WAF 处理的是内容。
WAF deals with content.

3293
04:49:45,536 --> 04:49:52,964
它读取每个 HTTP 请求，并应用关于 SQL 注入、跨站脚本攻击、源地址或国家的规则。
It reads each HTTP request and applies rules about SQL injection, cross-site scripting, source address or country.

3294
04:49:53,678 --> 04:49:54,896
洪水攻击意味着 Shield。
Flooding means Shield.

3295
04:49:55,502 --> 04:49:58,148
检查请求内容意味着 WAF。
Inspecting the request means WAF.

3296
04:49:59,854 --> 04:50:05,856
配对 3，GuardDuty 和 Inspector 都是检测服务，且经常被混淆。
Pair 3, Guard Duty and Inspector are both detection services and they are constantly swapped.

3297
04:50:06,254 --> 04:50:07,972
GuardDuty 监控行为。
Guard duty watches behavior.

3298
04:50:08,206 --> 04:50:11,812
它读取日志和网络流来寻找异常情况。
It reads logs and network flow to find unusual.

3299
04:50:12,302 --> 04:50:17,892
API 调用、挖矿，或者从不寻常的地方使用的凭证。
API calls, crypto mining or credentials being used from somewhere improbable.

3300
04:50:19,086 --> 04:50:20,964
它能发现正在进行的攻击。
It finds an attack in progress.

3301
04:50:21,902 --> 04:50:28,324
Inspector 扫描弱点，比如 EC2 实例上未修复的软件漏洞，
Inspector scans for weaknesses, unpatched software vulnerabilities on EC2 instances,

3302
04:50:29,134 --> 04:50:34,244
在容器镜像和 Lambda 函数中，以及意外的网络暴露。
in container images and in lambda functions, plus unintended network exposure.

3303
04:50:34,958 --> 04:50:36,996
它能找出可能被利用的漏洞。
It finds what could be exploited.

3304
04:50:37,614 --> 04:50:39,972
正在进行的攻击意味着 GuardDuty。
Active attack means guard duty.

3305
04:50:40,558 --> 04:50:42,852
潜在的弱点意味着 Inspector。
Latent weakness means inspector.

3306
04:50:44,622 --> 04:50:46,852
第四对完成了检测三剑客的组合。
Pair 4 completes the detection trio.

3307
04:50:47,470 --> 04:50:49,572
Macie 会查看你的数据内容。
Machi looks inside your data.

3308
04:50:50,016 --> 04:50:58,948
它利用机器学习和模式匹配来扫描 Amazon S3，以查找个人身份信息和其他敏感内容并进行分类。
It uses machine learning and pattern matching over Amazon S3 to find personally identifiable information and other sensitive content and classify it.

3309
04:50:59,726 --> 04:51:04,612
GuardDuty 从不查看你的数据内容，只观察围绕数据的行为。
Guard duty never looks inside your data, only at behavior around it.

3310
04:51:05,326 --> 04:51:06,724
所以这个区分点很容易辨认。
So the separator is easy.

3311
04:51:07,118 --> 04:51:13,700
如果出现敏感数据、个人身份信息或 S3 内容这些词，就是 Macie。
If the word sensitive data, personally identifiable information, or S3 content appear, it is Makey.

3312
04:51:14,158 --> 04:51:17,732
Macie 是这三个服务中唯一一个会读取你实际内容的。
Makey is the only one of the three that reads your actual content.

3313
04:51:19,150 --> 04:51:21,956
第五对比较微妙，但经常出现。
Pair 5 is subtle and it appears often.

3314
04:51:22,336 --> 04:51:30,468
Config 和 CloudTrail 都保留历史记录。Config 保留资源状态的记录，并能根据这些记录评估规则。
Both config and cloud trail keep history. Config keeps the history of what a resource looked like and can evaluate rules against it.

3315
04:51:30,896 --> 04:51:32,576
这个存储桶曾经公开过吗？
Was this bucket ever public?

3316
04:51:32,878 --> 04:51:37,124
这个卷加密了吗？这个实例有要求的标签吗？
Is this volume encrypted? Does this instance have the required tags?

3317
04:51:37,806 --> 04:51:40,548
CloudTrail 保留谁做了某事的历史记录。
Cloud Trail keeps the history of who did something.

3318
04:51:41,070 --> 04:51:44,176
这两个是互补的，题目会利用这一点来考查。
The two are complementary and questions exploit that.

3319
04:51:44,496 --> 04:51:47,056
Config 回答配置是什么样的。
Config answers what the configuration was.

3320
04:51:47,376 --> 04:51:49,444
CloudTrail 回答是谁更改了它。
Cloud Trail answers who changed it.

3321
04:51:49,776 --> 04:51:52,736
任何提到合规性规则的地方都指向 Config。
Any mention of compliance rules points at config.

3322
04:51:54,542 --> 04:51:55,344
第六对。
Pair 6.

3323
04:51:55,662 --> 04:52:01,412
顾问和 Config 都会告诉你有些东西不对，区别在于应用的是谁的标准。
Trusted Advisor and Config both tell you something is wrong, and the difference is whose standard is being applied.

3324
04:52:02,286 --> 04:52:12,836
顾问在成本优化、性能、安全性、容错能力和服务限制方面应用 AWS 的最佳实践，这些检查不是你写的。
Trusted Advisor applies AWS's best practices across cost optimization, performance, security, fault tolerance, and service limits, and you did not write those checks.

3325
04:52:13,806 --> 04:52:20,548
Config 应用的是你启用或编写的规则。所以由你决定对你的组织来说合规性意味着什么。
Config applies rules that you enable or author. So you decide what compliance means for your organization.

3326
04:52:21,184 --> 04:52:24,548
最佳实践建议意味着顾问。
Best practice recommendation means trusted advisor.

3327
04:52:26,222 --> 04:52:28,644
符合我们的政策意味着 Config。
Compliance with our policy means config.

3328
04:52:30,446 --> 04:52:32,624
第七对，VPC 的经典考点。
Pair 7, the VPC classic.

3329
04:52:32,846 --> 04:52:41,156
设置在实例网络接口上的安全组是有状态的，因此回程流量会自动允许，并且只包含允许规则。
Security groups set on an instance's network interface are stateful, so return traffic is allowed automatically and only have allow rules.

3330
04:52:42,350 --> 04:52:43,024
网络。
Network.

3331
04:52:43,342 --> 04:52:48,228
ACL 位于子网上且是无状态的，所以回程流量需要自己的规则。
ACL sit on a subnet and are stateless, so return traffic needs its own rule.

3332
04:52:49,134 --> 04:52:53,184
它们包含允许和拒绝规则，并按编号顺序进行评估。
They have both allow and deny rules evaluated in numbered order.

3333
04:52:53,518 --> 04:52:54,468
两个区分点。
Two separators.

3334
04:52:55,118 --> 04:53:03,104
题目中出现的“实例”或“子网”这个词，以及需要拦截特定地址的要求，只有网络 ACL 能做到这一点
The word instance or subnet in the question and the requirement to block a specific address, which only a network ACL can do

3335
04:53:03,278 --> 04:53:05,028
因为安全组没有拒绝规则。
because security groups have no deny.

3336
04:53:06,766 --> 04:53:11,716
第 8 对是纯粹的命名陷阱，在分析中出现了 15 次。
Pair 8 is a pure naming trap and it showed up 15 times in the analysis.

3337
04:53:12,430 --> 04:53:22,788
AWS Direct Connect 是您本地与 AWS 之间的专用私有物理连接，用于提供稳定的带宽和混合网络。
AWS Direct Connect is a dedicated private physical connection between your premises and AWS used for consistent bandwidth and hybrid networking.

3338
04:53:23,758 --> 04:53:31,824
Amazon Connect 是用于语音和聊天客户服务的云呼叫中心。它们共用一个词，除此之外没有任何共同点。
Amazon Connect is a cloud contact center for voice and chat customer service. They share one word and absolutely nothing else.

3339
04:53:32,064 --> 04:53:33,796
Direct Connect 是一条线路。
Direct Connect is a cable.

3340
04:53:34,224 --> 04:53:38,724
Amazon Connect 是一个呼叫中心。每次都要读全称。
Amazon Connect is a call center. Read the whole name every time.

3341
04:53:40,462 --> 04:53:41,220
第 9 对。
Pair 9.

3342
04:53:41,924 --> 04:53:46,464
普通的 IAM 管理单个 AWS 账号内的身份。
Plain IAM manages identity inside a single AWS account.

3343
04:53:46,784 --> 04:53:49,316
用户、组、角色和策略。
Users, groups, roles and policies.

3344
04:53:49,710 --> 04:53:58,756
IAM Identity Center 为用户提供跨多个账号的单点登录，并可连接现有的企业身份提供商或直接连接。
IAM Identity Center gives people single sign on across many accounts and connects an existing corporate identity provider or directly.

3345
04:53:59,664 --> 04:54:05,732
它以前被称为 AWS Single Sign On，旧的资料仍在使用那个名称。
It used to be called AWS Single Sign On and older material still uses that name.

3346
04:54:06,606 --> 04:54:08,644
区分点是账号的数量。
The separator is the number of accounts.

3347
04:54:10,222 --> 04:54:12,304
一个账号就选 IAM。
One account means IAM.

3348
04:54:13,486 --> 04:54:19,876
多个账号或外部目录则选择 IAM Identity Center。
Many accounts or an external directory means IAM identity center.

3349
04:54:21,614 --> 04:54:22,404
第 10 对。
Pair 10.

3350
04:54:27,438 --> 04:54:31,300
Budgets 是向前看的，成本管理器 是向后看的。
Budgets looks forward and cost explorer looks backward.

3351
04:54:33,646 --> 04:54:40,324
Budgets 是设置阈值并在预测或实际支出超过该阈值时接收警报的地方。
Budgets is where you set a threshold and receive an alert when forecast or actual spend crosses it.

3352
04:54:41,614 --> 04:54:46,304
Cost explorer 是可视化并分析历史成本和使用情况的地方。
Cost explorer is where you visualize and analyze historical cost and usage.

3353
04:54:46,510 --> 04:54:50,276
按服务、标签或关联账户进行过滤和分组。
Filtering and grouping by service, tag or linked account.

3354
04:54:50,798 --> 04:54:56,676
所以，关于审查跨多个账号的部门支出问题，选 成本管理器。
So a question about reviewing spend by department across several accounts is cost explorer.

3355
04:54:57,102 --> 04:55:00,544
关于在超支前收到警告的问题，选 预算。
A question about being warned before overspending is budgets.

3356
04:55:00,878 --> 04:55:02,660
“提醒我”意味着 预算。
Alert me means budgets.

3357
04:55:03,054 --> 04:55:05,424
“展示给我看”意味着 成本管理器。
Show me means cost explorer.

3358
04:55:06,638 --> 04:55:09,156
接下来是每行一个的更多配对。
Then more pairs at one line each.

3359
04:55:09,584 --> 04:55:13,860
关系型意味着 RDS。键值对意味着 DynamoDB。
Relational means RDS. Key value means dynamo DB.

3360
04:55:14,190 --> 04:55:18,404
操作性查询意味着 DynamoDB。分析类意味着 Redshift。
Operational lookups means dynamo DB. Analytics means red shift.

3361
04:55:19,584 --> 04:55:27,620
Aurora 是支持 MySQL 和 Postgres 的 RDS 引擎。所以 Oracle 或 SQL Server 就意味着普通的 RDS。
Aurora is an RDS engine for my SQL and Postgres. So Oracle or SQL server means plain RDS.

3362
04:55:28,494 --> 04:55:30,864
Linux 和 NFS 对应的是 EFS。
Linux and NFS means EFS.

3363
04:55:31,118 --> 04:55:33,444
Windows 和 SMB 对应的是 FSX。
Windows and SMB means FSX.

3364
04:55:33,824 --> 04:55:45,092
单实例上的磁盘是 EBS。任何规模的对象存储是 S3。AWS 自有的编排器是 ECS。Kubernetes 是 EKS。无服务器架构则是 Fargate。
A disk on one instance is EBS. Objects at any scale is S3. AWS's own orchestrator is ECS. Kubernetes is EKS. No servers means Fargate.

3365
04:55:45,742 --> 04:55:46,944
区域（区域）对应的是地理位置。
Region is geography.

3366
04:55:47,184 --> 04:55:50,372
可用区（Availability zone）是隔离的数据中心。
Availability zone is isolated data centers.

3367
04:55:50,894 --> 04:55:53,028
边缘站点（边缘站点）是内容分发。
Edge location is content delivery.

3368
04:55:53,550 --> 04:55:58,276
而 CloudFormation 定义任何基础设施，而 Beanstalk 只负责运行你的应用。
And cloud formation defines any infrastructure while Beanstalk just runs your app.

3369
04:55:59,950 --> 04:56:01,028
实战案例
Worked scenario

3370
04:56:02,702 --> 04:56:03,172
1。
1.

3371
04:56:03,886 --> 04:56:06,788
安全团队正在调查一起事件。
A security team is investigating an incident.

3372
04:56:07,246 --> 04:56:15,492
在夜间，一个原本是私有的 Amazon S3 存储桶变成了公开可读，到了早上又变回了私有。
Overnight, an Amazon S3 bucket that had been private became publicly readable, and by morning, it was private again.

3373
04:56:16,174 --> 04:56:17,668
团队需要两样东西。
The team needs two things.

3374
04:56:18,318 --> 04:56:25,924
是哪个身份（IAM identity）做了更改，以及该存储桶在过去一年中的任何时间点是否被公开读取过。
Which I AM identity made the change and whether the bucket has ever been publicly readable at any point in the last year.

3375
04:56:26,734 --> 04:56:28,864
他们应该使用哪两个服务？
Which two services should they use?

3376
04:56:29,134 --> 04:56:30,404
暂停一下，做个决定。
Pause and decide.

3377
04:56:37,166 --> 04:56:39,012
答案是 A 和 C。
The answers are A and C.

3378
04:56:39,662 --> 04:56:44,832
这个案例故意要求你同时区分两个最容易混淆的组合。
This scenario deliberately requires you to split the two most confused pairs at once.

3379
04:56:45,166 --> 04:56:49,028
哪个身份做了更改是一个“谁”的问题，所以用 CloudTrail。
Which identity made the change is a WHO question. So Cloud Trail.

3380
04:56:50,606 --> 04:56:55,072
过去一年中是否曾经公开过？这是一个关于随时间变化的配置状态的问题。
Has it ever been public over the last year? Is a configuration state over time question.

3381
04:56:55,246 --> 04:56:56,196
所以用 Config。
So config.

3382
04:56:57,710 --> 04:56:58,852
不过看看 D 选项。
Look at D though.

3383
04:56:59,758 --> 04:57:08,132
Mackay 在真实的调查中确实是合理的下一步，但在这里它是错误的，纯粹是因为题目并没有问到数据相关的问题。
Mckay. Is genuinely the sensible next step in a real investigation and it is wrong here purely because the question did not ask about the data.

3384
04:57:09,710 --> 04:57:16,228
这种模式——即一个正确的现实操作却回答了一个没人问过的问题——是这次考试中最常见的干扰项设计。
That pattern, a correct real-world action that answers a question nobody asked, is the most common distractor design on this exam.

3385
04:57:17,902 --> 04:57:19,140
什么场景？
What scenario?

3386
04:57:19,630 --> 04:57:28,432
2. 一个位于应用负载均衡器（ALB）后的公共 Web 应用正受到来自数千个地址的攻击。这里有两个独立的问题。
2. A public web application behind an application load balancer is being hit from thousands of addresses. There are two separate problems.

3387
04:57:28,782 --> 04:57:36,548
大量的无意义流量占满了连接，以及一小部分试图对登录表单进行 SQL 注入的请求。
A flood of meaningless traffic saturating the connection and a smaller set of requests attempting SQL injection against the login form.

3388
04:57:37,390 --> 04:57:39,524
哪种组合能同时解决这两个问题？
Which combination addresses both?

3389
04:57:40,206 --> 04:57:41,636
暂停一下，做个决定。
Pause and decide.

3390
04:57:48,270 --> 04:57:49,632
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3391
04:57:50,030 --> 04:57:55,940
这个场景在两个不同的层级上设置了两个问题，所以单一服务无法涵盖所有内容。
This scenario plants two problems at two different layers so that neither service alone can cover it.

3392
04:57:56,462 --> 04:58:01,232
流量饱和连接是第三层和第四层的问题，对应的是 Shield。
Volume saturating the connection is a layer 3 and 4 problem, which is Shield.

3393
04:58:02,030 --> 04:58:07,172
请求中的 SQL 注入是第七层内容问题，对应的是 WAF。
SQL injection in a request is a layer 7 content problem, which is WAF.

3394
04:58:08,046 --> 04:58:09,988
选项 D 值得仔细思考一下。
Option D is worth dwelling on.

3395
04:58:10,862 --> 04:58:14,308
GuardDuty 会注意到这两个问题并通知你。
Guard duty would notice both of these and tell you about them.

3396
04:58:14,926 --> 04:58:20,672
但检测和防护是两回事，而题目问的是如何解决这些问题。
But detecting and protecting are different jobs, and the question asks how to address the problems.

3397
04:58:21,166 --> 04:58:28,068
这种“检测服务”与“保护服务”的区别，是区分这门考试中多个问题的关键。
That distinction between detection services and protection services separates several questions on this exam.

3398
04:58:29,806 --> 04:58:31,460
做对的场景 3。
Worked scenario 3.

3399
04:58:31,918 --> 04:58:37,252
一家公司在本地运行 Windows 服务器，并使用 SMB 协议共享文件。
A company runs Windows servers on premises that share files using the SMB protocol.

