04:58:37,646 --> 04:58:45,348
它正在迁移到 AWS，并希望有一个全托管的文件系统。现有的 Windows 应用程序无需修改即可挂载。
It is migrating to AWS and wants a fully managed file system. The existing Windows applications can mount without modification.

3401
04:58:46,062 --> 04:58:53,860
第二个团队运行 Linux 应用服务器，需要一个能被多个实例同时挂载的共享文件系统。
A second team runs Linux application servers that need a shared file system mounted by many instances at once.

3402
04:58:54,352 --> 04:58:57,220
公司应该使用哪两个服务？
Which two services should the company use?

3403
04:58:59,374 --> 04:59:00,708
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3404
04:59:07,374 --> 04:59:08,804
答案是 C 和 D。
The answers are C and D.

3405
04:59:09,232 --> 04:59:12,900
这里主要是通过协议名称来做判断，这是很典型的考法。
The protocol names are doing all the work here, which is typical.

3406
04:59:13,232 --> 04:59:16,772
SMB 和 Windows 意味着 FSX for Windows File Server。
SMB and Windows means FSX for Windows File Server.

3407
04:59:17,232 --> 04:59:24,900
许多 Linux 实例共享一个文件系统意味着 EFS。注意“无需修改”这个短语是如何排除 S3 的。
Many Linux instances sharing a file system means EFS. Notice how the phrase without modification quietly eliminates S3.

3408
04:59:25,774 --> 04:59:29,924
对象存储非常出色，但它不是可挂载的文件系统。
Object storage is excellent, but it is not a mountable file system.

3409
04:59:30,254 --> 04:59:33,604
因此，针对文件共享编写的应用程序必须重新编写。
So applications written against a file share would have to be rewritten.

3410
04:59:33,934 --> 04:59:38,660
注意像“无需修改”和“不改变应用”之类的短语。
Watch for phrases like without modification and without changing the application.

3411
04:59:40,014 --> 04:59:43,792
它们几乎总是为了排除一个特定的选项。
They almost always exist to eliminate one specific option.

3412
04:59:45,102 --> 04:59:45,988
做对了。
