04:59:46,798 --> 04:59:52,192
4. 一位财务总监想要一份按部门划分的每月 AWS 支出报告。
4. A finance director wants a monthly report of AWS spend broken down by department.

3414
04:59:52,430 --> 04:59:58,532
每个部门都有自己的 AWS 账户，所有账户都在一个具有合并账单的组织下。
Each department has its own AWS account and all accounts sit under one organization with consolidated billing.

3415
04:59:59,054 --> 05:00:06,724
另外，如果任何单个部门的月度预测支出超过其分配额，总监希望收到一封电子邮件通知。
Separately, the director wants an email whenever any single department's forecast monthly spend exceeds its allocation.

3416
05:00:08,014 --> 05:00:10,500
哪两个服务符合这些要求？
Which two services meet these requirements?

3417
05:00:11,278 --> 05:00:12,452
