他们决定不再对任何 EC2 实例进行补丁更新或调整规模。
It has decided it no longer wants to patch or size any EC2 instances.

3438
05:02:23,072 --> 05:02:26,052
他们还需要一个地方来存储容器镜像。
It also needs somewhere to store its container images.

3439
05:02:26,992 --> 05:02:31,204
他们在编排和计算方面应该使用哪两个服务？
Which two services should it use for orchestration and compute?

3440
05:02:31,632 --> 05:02:33,060
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3441
05:02:39,566 --> 05:02:41,220
答案是 B 和 C。
The answers are B and C.

3442
05:02:41,966 --> 05:02:45,252
这个场景要求你同时进行两个维度的区分。
This scenario asks you to make two separations at once.

3443
05:02:45,838 --> 05:02:55,972
Kubernetes 清单决定了选择 EKS 而不是 ECS。不再补丁或调整实例规模则决定了选择 Fargate 而不是 EC2 启动类型。
Kubernetes manifests decide EKS over ECS. No longer patching or sizing instances decides Fargate over the EC2 launch type.

3444
05:02:57,870 --> 05:03:03,332
选项 D 有点有迷惑性，因为这里确实需要 ECR 来存储镜像。
Option D is the interesting one because ECR genuinely is needed here for the images.

3445
05:03:04,272 --> 05:03:11,108
它之所以错误，仅仅是因为问题明确要求的是编排和计算，而 ECR 并不属于这两者。
It is wrong only because the question asks specifically about orchestration and compute, and ECR does neither.

3446
05:03:11,566 --> 05:03:16,100
要读题目的具体要求，而不是公司整体的需求。
Read what the question asks for, not what the company needs overall.

3447
05:03:17,712 --> 05:03:18,884
处理成功的案例。
Worked scenario.

3448
05:03:19,232 --> 05:03:25,828
7. 一家公司已经在其负载均衡器后，跨三个可用区运行 Web 应用程序。
7. A company already runs its web application across three availability zones behind a load balancer.

3449
05:03:26,592 --> 05:03:30,500
可用性一直非常好，一年来没有任何故障发生。
Availability has been excellent and nothing has failed in a year.

3450
05:03:30,990 --> 05:03:38,564
但在亚洲和南美洲的用户仍反映页面加载需要数秒钟，而靠近该区域的用户不受影响。
Users in Asia and South America still report pages taking several seconds to load while users near the region are unaffected.

3451
05:03:40,014 --> 05:03:41,312
公司应该怎么做？
What should the company do?

3452
05:03:41,552 --> 05:03:42,852
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3453
05:03:49,472 --> 05:03:50,724
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3454
05:03:51,152 --> 05:03:54,628
这一句决定了答案，而且很容易被忽略过去。
One sentence decides this, and it is easy to skim past.

3455
05:03:55,392 --> 05:03:57,924
靠近该区域的用户不受影响。
Users near the region are unaffected.

3456
05:03:58,272 --> 05:04:06,116
这个事实排除了所有涉及应用程序本身的解释，因为如果应用变慢，所有人都会受到影响。
That single fact eliminates every explanation involving the application itself because a slow application would be slow for everyone.

3457
05:04:06,958 --> 05:04:11,108
剩下的因素就是距离，而边缘站点存在的目的就是为了解决距离问题。
What is left is distance, and distance is what edge locations exist to solve.

3458
05:04:12,334 --> 05:04:15,652
可用区提供的是区域内的“高可用性”。
Availability zones give you high availability inside a region.

3459
05:04:16,462 --> 05:04:20,004
它们对用户离得有多远没有任何帮助。
They do nothing whatsoever about how far away a user is.

3460
05:04:21,390 --> 05:04:22,372
已完成的案例。
Worked scenario.

3461
05:04:26,830 --> 05:04:27,232
8。
8.

3462
05:04:28,718 --> 05:04:32,292
一家保险公司正在开设一个客户服务中心。
An insurance company is opening a customer service center.

3463
05:04:32,622 --> 05:04:40,228
它需要一个按需付费的系统来处理入站客户电话和聊天，供远程代理从家中使用。
It needs a pay-as-you-go system for handling inbound customer calls and chats, which remote agents will use from home.

3464
05:04:40,974 --> 05:04:48,912
同一家公司还需要在总部和 AWS 之间建立专用的私有网络连接
The same company separately needs a dedicated private network link between its head office and AWS

3465
05:04:49,232 --> 05:04:52,196
为理赔系统提供稳定的带宽。
with consistent bandwidth for a claim system.

3466
05:04:52,718 --> 05:04:55,364
哪两个服务符合这些要求？
Which two services meet these requirements?

3467
05:04:55,918 --> 05:04:57,124
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3468
05:05:03,728 --> 05:05:09,828
答案是 A 和 B，这个案例纯粹是为了明确区分名称冲突。
The answers are A and B, and this scenario exists purely to make the name collision explicit.

3469
05:05:10,128 --> 05:05:14,148
两个正确答案都包含 connect 这个词，除此之外没有任何共同点。
Both correct answers contain the word connect and they have nothing else in common.

3470
05:05:14,528 --> 05:05:17,956
Amazon Connect 是用于与客户通话的呼叫中心。
Amazon Connect is a contact center for talking to customers.

3471
05:05:18,382 --> 05:05:22,468
AWS Direct Connect 是连接你的大楼和 AWS 的线缆。
AWS Direct Connect is a cable between your building and AWS.

3472
05:05:23,406 --> 05:05:28,612
一家公司确实可能同时需要这两者，而这正是本题所描述的情况。
A company can genuinely need both at once, which is exactly what this question describes.

3473
05:05:29,088 --> 05:05:31,396
每次都要读出完整的服务名称。
Read the whole service name every time.

3474
05:05:33,166 --> 05:05:34,564
本模块的使用方法。
How to use this module.

3475
05:05:35,086 --> 05:05:41,008
在考试前的两天里重温一遍，因为它是为复习设计的，而不是为了初次学习。
Rewatch it last in the two days before your exam because it is built for recall rather than for learning.

3476
05:05:41,248 --> 05:05:48,452
去记那些“区分性句子”而不是服务描述，因为这些句子是你能在 90 秒内实际用上的。
Learn the separator sentence rather than the service description because the separator is what you can actually apply in 90 seconds.

3477
05:05:49,198 --> 05:05:54,468
当两个选项看起来都很像时，先确定这一对，然后再应用它的区分句。
When two options both look light, name the pair first and then apply its separator.

3478
05:05:55,086 --> 05:05:59,236
记住：检测服务（detection）是告诉你发生了什么，而保护服务（protection）是阻止它发生。
Remember that detection services tell you and protection services stop it.

3479
05:05:59,598 --> 05:06:06,372
还要警惕最常见的干扰项：即那些符合现实逻辑但并非题目要求的正确操作。
And watch for that most common distractor of all, the correct real-world action that answers a question nobody asked.

3480
05:06:07,888 --> 05:06:16,548
这个模块之所以存在，是因为认证内容落后于 AWS 产品目录，而在这次考试中，这个差距变得异常巨大。
This module exists because certification content lags the AWS catalog, and on this exam, the gap has become unusually wide.

3481
05:06:17,326 --> 05:06:25,220
一些仍被标记为正确答案的选项，描述的是那些与新客户相似、更名或计划停用的服务。
Several answers that are still marked correct describe services that are close to new customers renamed or scheduled for shutdown.

3482
05:06:25,774 --> 05:06:34,564
没人会告诉你这一点，而一旦你打开当前的 AWS 文档，就会遇到所有这些矛盾之处。
Nobody else will tell you this, and you will hit every one of these contradictions the moment you open current AWS documentation.

3483
05:06:36,206 --> 05:06:40,196
在开始之前，这是 governing 这个整个模块的规则。
Before anything else, here is the rule that governs this whole module.

3484
05:06:40,622 --> 05:06:43,844
在考试中，请根据官方文档中的目录来回答。
In the exam, answer from the documented catalog.

3485
05:06:44,686 --> 05:06:51,876
考试指南和题库决定了当天的正确答案，而与评分系统争论并不是一种策略。
The exam guide and the question bank define what is correct on the day, and arguing with a scoring engine is not a strategy.

3486
05:06:52,750 --> 05:06:57,252
在考试之外，你要了解实际情况，因为你以后会操作当前的控制台。
Outside the exam, know the reality because you will be working with the current console.

3487
05:06:57,806 --> 05:06:59,172
这两部分都很重要。
Both halves matter.

3488
05:06:59,694 --> 05:07:04,608
这里的“标记”和“事实”是两回事，而且这个差距只是暂时的。
The mark and the truth are different things here, and the gap is temporary.

3489
05:07:05,966 --> 05:07:08,292
简单解释一下为什么会出现这个差距。
A little context on why the gap opened.

3490
05:07:08,848 --> 05:07:16,208
CLF-C02 于 2023 年 9 月发布，因此它的题库早于大多数这些变化。
CLF-C02 launched in September 2023. So its question pool predates most of these changes.

3491
05:07:16,448 --> 05:07:23,748
从那时起，AWS 在 2024 年 7 月和 2025 年底进行了两次大规模的组合调整。
Since then, AWS has run two large portfolio calls, one in July 2024 and another in late 2025.

3492
05:07:24,590 --> 05:07:30,468
考试指南中的在范围内服务列表更新频率比题库重写要高得多。
The exam guides in scope service list gets refreshed more often than the question pool gets rewritten.

3493
05:07:30,798 --> 05:07:33,888
因此，你可能会在现行的题目中看到测试这些服务的考题。
So you can find questions in circulation testing services.

3494
05:07:34,190 --> 05:07:36,164
当前的指南中完全没有列出它们。
The current guide does not list at all.

3495
05:07:36,528 --> 05:07:39,012
当两者不一致时，请以指南为准。
Where those two disagree, trust the guide.

3496
05:07:40,750 --> 05:07:46,596
从最大的单一变化开始，因为它影响的题目比这里任何其他内容都要多。
Start with the largest single change because it affects more questions than anything else here.

3497
05:07:47,886 --> 05:07:54,048
RWS Snow 系列（即你用于传输数据的物理设备）正在被完全淘汰。
The RWS Snow family, the physical devices you ship data on, is being wound down completely.

3498
05:07:54,382 --> 05:07:58,084
这很重要，因为 Snow 设备是考试中的经典答案。
This matters because Snow devices are a classic exam answer.

3499
05:07:58,862 --> 05:08:03,396
大数据集、网络差、截止日期紧，就用 snowball 发货。
Large data set, poor network, tight deadline, ship a snowball.

3500
05:08:04,462 --> 05:08:07,396
这种逻辑贯穿在旧的题库中。
That reasoning appears throughout older question banks.

3501
05:08:08,910 --> 05:08:10,048
这是时间线。
Here is the timeline.

3502
05:08:10,382 --> 05:08:14,148
Snowmobile（运输集装箱）已于 2024 年 3 月退役。
Snowmobile, the shipping container, retired in March 2024.

3503
05:08:14,794 --> 05:08:19,524
Snowcone 于 2024 年 11 月停止生产，并在一年后停止支持。
Snowcone discontinued in November 2024 with support ending a year later.

3504
05:08:20,014 --> 05:08:22,692
旧款的 snowball 模型也在同一时间退役。
The older snowball models went at the same time.

3505
05:08:23,662 --> 05:08:27,524
Snowball Edge 于 11 月 7 日停止面向新客户提供服务。
Snowball Edge closed to new customers on the 7th of November

3506
05:08:28,558 --> 05:08:29,668
2025 年
2025

3507
05:08:30,446 --> 05:08:38,436
并且所有 snowball 设备在商业区域的 dukungan 将于 2026 年 12 月 31 日结束。
and support for all snowball devices ends in commercial regions on the 31st of December 2026.

3508
05:08:39,374 --> 05:08:48,528
至关重要的是，Snow 系列已不再出现在本次考试的“在范围内”服务列表中，而旧题库仍在大量测试
Critically, the Snow family no longer appears on the InScope service list for this exam at all, while older question banks still test

3509
05:08:48,688 --> 05:08:49,348
它。
it heavily.

3510
05:08:50,926 --> 05:08:55,460
那么，用于托管在线传输的 AWS DataSync 取代了它？
So what replaced it for managed online transfer AWS DataSync?

3511
05:08:55,968 --> 05:09:01,348
对于不通过运输自己的设备而进行实物交付，选择 Data Transfer Family。
For a physical drop-off without shipping your own device, the AWS Data Transfer Terminal.

3512
05:09:01,998 --> 05:09:04,548
对于专用私有连接，选择 Direct Connect。
For a dedicated private link, direct connect.

3513
05:09:05,328 --> 05:09:10,468
而在真正需求是边缘计算而非传输时，选择 AWS Outposts。
And where the real need was edge compute rather than transfer AWS outposts.

3514
05:09:11,406 --> 05:09:16,608
注意 DataSync 本身不在本次考试的在范围内列表中，这是说明该问题的很好例子。
Note that data sync itself is not on the in scope list for this exam, which is a good illustration of the problem.

3515
05:09:16,848 --> 05:09:22,500
旧答案是可考但不可用的，而新答案是可用但不可考的。
The old answer is examinable and unavailable, while the current answer is available and not examinable.

3516
05:09:24,046 --> 05:09:26,980
现在，对领域 4造成最大影响的变化是：
Now, the change that does the most damage to domain 4.

3517
05:09:27,758 --> 05:09:34,852
准备工作。2025年12月2日，AWS 宣布对其支持组合进行全面重组。
Preparation. On the 2nd of December 2025, AWS announced a complete restructure of its support portfolio.

3518
05:09:35,694 --> 05:09:43,492
每份学习指南中提到的四个付费层级正被三个新的层级取代。旧名称将在2027年初消失。
The four paid tiers every study guide features are being replaced by three new ones. The old names disappear at the start of 2027.

3519
05:09:45,070 --> 05:09:46,212
这是对应的映射关系：
Here is the mapping.

3520
05:09:46,638 --> 05:09:49,252
基础支持（Basic）保持不变，且仍然免费。
Basic support is unchanged and still free.

3521
05:09:49,774 --> 05:09:55,332
开发者和业务支持都被一个全新的层级取代，即 Business Support Plus。
Developer and business support are both replaced by a single new tier, Business Support Plus.

3522
05:09:56,430 --> 05:10:00,836
它的起步价是每月 29 美元，提供 30 分钟的紧急响应。
It starts at $29 a month with 30-minute critical response.

3523
05:10:01,486 --> 05:10:07,824
Enterprise OnRamp 将在 2026 年前自动升级为 Enterprise Support。
Enterprise OnRamp is being automatically upgraded to Enterprise Support through 2026.

3524
05:10:08,302 --> 05:10:14,784
Enterprise 支持依然存在，其最低价格从每月 15,000 美元降至 5,000 美元。
Enterprise support survives with its minimum price cut from $15,000 a month to $5,000.

3525
05:10:15,438 --> 05:10:19,748
还有一个新的顶级层级，称为 Unified Operations，起步价为每月 50,000 美元。
And there is a new top tier called Unified Operations from $50,000 a month.

3526
05:10:20,110 --> 05:10:22,692
在考试中，请用旧的四个名称来回答。
On the exam, answer with the old four names.

3527
05:10:24,398 --> 05:10:29,956
幸运的是，支持类问题的逻辑没有改变，变的只是标签。
Fortunately, the reasoning behind support questions has not changed, only the labels.

3528
05:10:30,304 --> 05:10:37,604
Basic 是免费的，提供文档、重新发布、健康仪表板以及核心的顾问检查。
Basic is free and gives documentation, repost, the health, dashboard, and core trusted advisor checks.

3529
05:10:38,670 --> 05:10:43,588
技术客户经理首先出现在 Enterprise 层级中，这是经典的考点提示。
A technical account manager first appears at Enterprise and that is the classic giveaway.

3530
05:10:44,494 --> 05:10:50,944
Business 是第一个提供 24/7 电话和聊天以及全套顾问检查的层级。
Business is the first tier with 24-7 phone and chat and the full trusted advisor check set.

3531
05:10:51,310 --> 05:10:55,344
Enterprise 为业务关键系统提供 15 分钟响应。
Enterprise gives 15-minute response for business critical systems.

3532
05:10:55,664 --> 05:11:02,116
而在下方，Enterprise OnRamp 提供 30 分钟。在考试中不要写 Business Support Plus。
Down where Enterprise OnRamp gives 30. Do not write business support plus on the exam.

3533
05:11:02,574 --> 05:11:04,324
那个名字不在题库里。
That name is not in the pool.

3534
05:11:05,838 --> 05:11:07,184
接下来是剩下的部分。
And here is the rest of it.

3535
05:11:07,278 --> 05:11:14,148
QuickSight 在 2025 年 10 月更名为 Amazon QuickSight，然后又缩短为 Amazon Quick。
QuickSight was renamed to Amazon Quick Suite in October 2025, then shortened again to Amazon Quick.

3536
05:11:14,704 --> 05:11:19,428
目前的考试指南将其写为两个单词的 Amazon QuickSight。
The exam guide currently writes it as Amazon QuickSight, 2 words.

3537
05:11:21,678 --> 05:11:24,100
SageMaker 现在就是 SageMaker。
SageMaker is now SageMaker.

3538
05:11:24,704 --> 05:11:26,532
指南中的 AI 部分。
AI in the guide.

3539
05:11:27,342 --> 05:11:31,812
Amazon Q 在今年 7 月底停止面向新客户提供业务服务。
Amazon Q business closed to new customers at the end of July this year.

3540
05:11:32,526 --> 05:11:41,156
CodeCatlist 在 2025 年 11 月关闭且不在在范围内列表中，但旧题库仍将其作为正确的 CICD 答案。
Code Catlist closed in November 2025 and is not on the in-scope list, yet older banks use it as the correct CICD answer.

3541
05:11:41,998 --> 05:11:52,356
Code commit、Cloud9、Forecast、S3 Select、Cloud Search、SimpleDB 以及 Data Pipeline 都在 2024 年 7 月 25 日停止面向新客户提供服务。
Code commit, Cloud9, Forecast, S3 Select, Cloud Search, SimpleDB, and Data Pipeline all close to new customers on the 25th of July 2024.

3542
05:11:53,870 --> 05:12:01,412
还有第二类值得了解的服务，这些是旧版题库中的内容，但当前指南明确标注为超出范围。
There is a second category worth knowing services that older banks test, but the current guide explicitly puts out of scope.

3543
05:12:02,062 --> 05:12:11,172
AWS Cloud Shell 就是个很好的例子，因为它在旧材料中被视为正确答案，现在已列入超出范围清单。
AWS Cloud Shell is a good example because it appears as a correct answer in older material and is now on the out of scope list.

3544
05:12:11,822 --> 05:12:15,344
Amazon Personalize、Fraud Detector 和 Web Docs 也是如此。
So are Amazon personalize fraud detector and web docs.

3545
05:12:15,664 --> 05:12:25,604
所以 Billing Conductor、Data Exchange、Key Spaces 和 MemoryDB、Code Deploy 以及 Network Firewall 都被排除在外，而 Code Build 和 Code Pipeline 则在范围内。
So our billing conductor, data exchange, key spaces and memoryDB, Code Deploy and Network Firewall are out, while code build and code pipeline are in.

3546
05:12:27,470 --> 05:12:30,020
识别这些成本，毫无意义。
Being able to recognize these costs, nothing.

3547
05:12:30,464 --> 05:12:32,196
研究它们只是浪费时间。
Studying them costs time.

3548
05:12:33,934 --> 05:12:37,060
这四个服务的状态不仅是停止面向新客户，而是彻底关停。
These four went further than closing to new customers.

3549
05:12:37,390 --> 05:12:38,308
它们已经终结了。
They ended.

3550
05:12:39,024 --> 05:12:45,508
账本数据库 Amazon QLDB 已于 2025 年 7 月 31 日停止支持。
Amazon QLDB, the ledger database, reached end of support on the 31st of July 2025.

3551
05:12:46,064 --> 05:12:48,612
Aurora Postgres 是迁移路径。
Aurora Postgres was the migration path.

3552
05:12:49,518 --> 05:12:55,332
独立的 Amazon Glacier Vault Service 已于 2025 年 12 月停止面向新客户提供服务。
The standalone Amazon Glacier Ward Service closed to new customers in December 2025.

3553
05:12:55,584 --> 05:13:00,164
S3 Glacier 存储类别不受影响，且完全可用。
The S3 Glacier Storage classes are unaffected and fully available.

3554
05:13:01,582 --> 05:13:06,852
AWS WAF Classic 已于 2025 年 9 月正式退役。
AWS WAF Classic was fully retired in September 2025.

3555
05:13:08,014 --> 05:13:12,292
而且 DMS Fleet Advisor 已于今年 5 月结束。
And DMS Fleet Advisor ended in May this year.

3556
05:13:13,582 --> 05:13:18,980
这一类情况比较微妙，容易被忽略，因为这些服务的名称并没有改变。
This second category is subtler and easier to miss because the names did not change.

3557
05:13:19,424 --> 05:13:28,100
根用户的 MFA 在各处都被描述为推荐项，并且自 2025 年 6 月起在所有账户类型中强制执行。
Root user MFA is described everywhere as recommended and has been enforced on all account types since June 2025.

3558
05:13:30,126 --> 05:13:33,316
顾问 的 5 个检查类别变为了 6 个。
Trusted Advisors 5 check categories became 6.

3559
05:13:34,254 --> 05:13:39,684
免费套餐的 3 部分模型，对于 2025 年 7 月后创建的账户变成了积分模式。
The Free Tiers 3-part model became a credit model for accounts created after July 2025.

3560
05:13:40,110 --> 05:13:44,164
组织 增加了资源控制策略和声明式策略。
Organizations gained resource control policies and declarative policies.

3561
05:13:45,198 --> 05:13:46,980
Elasticache 获得了 Valkey。
Elasticage gained Valky.

3562
05:13:47,886 --> 05:13:55,364
而且经典负载均衡器仅在 EC2 Classic 中退役，在 VPC 内部仍受支持。
And the classic load balancer was retired only in EC2 Classic, remaining supported inside a VPC.

3563
05:13:57,006 --> 05:13:58,756
工作场景 1。
Work scenario 1.

3564
05:13:59,182 --> 05:14:02,660
这一题考查的是考试行为，而不是架构。
And this one is about exam behavior rather than architecture.

3565
05:14:04,206 --> 05:14:05,348
你正在参加考试。
You are sitting the exam.

3566
05:14:06,158 --> 05:14:15,812
题目描述了 80 TB 的归档数据、一个缓慢且不可靠的互联网连接，以及在 1 个月内将其上传到 Amazon S3 的截止日期。
A question describes 80 terabytes of archive data, a slow unreliable internet link, and a one month deadline to get it into Amazon S3.

3567
05:14:16,686 --> 05:14:25,024
选项包括 AWS Snowball Edge、AWS Direct Connect、AWS DataSync 以及通过公共互联网上传。
The options include AWS Snowball Edge, AWS Direct Connect, AWS Datasync, and uploading over the public internet.

3568
05:14:26,478 --> 05:14:30,304
你知道 Snowball 已于去年 11 月停止面向新客户提供服务。
You know Snowball closed to new customers last November.

3569
05:14:30,544 --> 05:14:31,824
你应该选哪个？
What should you select?

3570
05:14:32,270 --> 05:14:33,380
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3571
05:14:39,982 --> 05:14:42,244
选择一个 Snowball Edge。
Select a snowball edge.

3572
05:14:42,734 --> 05:14:46,756
这感觉可能不对，而这种感觉正是本模块的重点。
This will feel wrong, and that feeling is the point of the module.

3573
05:14:47,406 --> 05:14:52,900
评分标准是在 Snowball 作为离线传输答案时编写的，且尚未重新修订。
The scoring key was written when snowball was the offline transfer answer and it has not been rewritten.

3574
05:14:54,382 --> 05:14:57,424
选项 C 才是你现在实际会做的操作。
Option C is what you would actually do today.

3575
05:14:57,966 --> 05:15:03,652
它被故意放入这个列表中，是为了奖励那些阅读过近期文档的人。
It is deliberately in this list because it claps anyone who has read recent documentation.

3576
05:15:03,950 --> 05:15:05,444
注意额外的提示。
Note the additional clue.

3577
05:15:05,744 --> 05:15:15,012
数据同步不在在范围内服务列表中，这通常是它不是预期答案的强力暗示。请回答题目原本要求的那个答案。
Data sync is not on the in-scope service list, which is usually a strong hint that it is not the expected answer. Answer the question that was written.

3578
05:15:16,430 --> 05:15:17,252
案例研究。
Work scenario.

3579
05:15:17,966 --> 05:15:22,372
2. 有个问题询问公司应该选择哪种支持计划。
2. A question asks which support plan a company should choose.

3580
05:15:22,990 --> 05:15:31,524
它运行业务关键型生产工作负载，要求配备专门的技术客户经理，并且在生产环境宕机时需要 15 分钟响应。
It runs business critical production workloads, wants a designated technical account manager, and needs a 15-minute response when production is down.

3581
05:15:32,462 --> 05:15:38,372
选项包括基础、开发者、商业和符合要求的企业支持。
The options are basic, developer, business, and enterprise support, which meets the requirements.

3582
05:15:38,926 --> 05:15:40,260
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3583
05:15:46,958 --> 05:15:50,212
答案是 D 企业支持。
The answer is D enterprise support.

3584
05:15:50,702 --> 05:15:52,804
这个案例是为了给你提供信心。
This scenario is here to reassure you.

3585
05:15:54,542 --> 05:16:00,704
支持计划的重组非常剧烈，但它几乎不影响考试实际考查的逻辑。
The support plan restructure is dramatic, but it barely touches the reasoning the exam actually tests.

3586
05:16:01,230 --> 05:16:10,468
专门的技术客户经理和 15 分钟业务关键型响应一直意味着企业级，在新的产品线中依然如此。
Designated technical account manager and 15-minute business critical response have always meant enterprise and they still do in the new lineup.

3587
05:16:11,022 --> 05:16:16,228
变化的是开发者、商业以及企业 On Ramp 正在被整合掉。
What changed is that developer, business, and enterprise on ramp are being folded away.

3588
05:16:17,198 --> 05:16:20,068
从需求到层级的对应关系是稳定的。
The mapping from requirement to tier is stable.

3589
05:16:20,910 --> 05:16:23,556
学习对应的逻辑，而不是价目表。
Learn the mapping, not the price list.

3590
05:16:25,070 --> 05:16:26,308
成功的案例。
Worked scenario.

3591
05:16:26,784 --> 05:16:30,372
3. 你正在使用较旧的题库进行复习。
3. You are revising with an older practice bank.

3592
05:16:32,174 --> 05:16:41,264
一个问题询问哪种服务模型可以可视化并自动化应用发布工作流，并将 Amazon Code Catalyst 作为标注答案。
A question asks which service models visualizes and automates an application release workflow and gives Amazon Code Catalyst as the marked answer.

3593
05:16:41,838 --> 05:16:48,676
你查阅当前的考试指南，发现 Code Catalyst 不在范围内，而 Code Pipeline 和 Code Build 都在。
You check the current exam guide and find code catalyst is not listed in scope, while code pipeline and code build both are.

3594
05:16:49,104 --> 05:16:50,948
正确的结论是什么？
What is the right conclusion to draw?

3595
05:16:51,438 --> 05:16:52,548
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3596
05:16:59,264 --> 05:17:00,864
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

3597
05:17:01,230 --> 05:17:05,892
这是整个模块的一般性流程，所以值得明确说明一下。
This is the general procedure for the whole module, so it is worth stating plainly.

3598
05:17:06,224 --> 05:17:14,244
当题库和官方在范围内列表不一致时，以在范围内列表为准，因为它更新得更近。
When a question bank and the official in scope list disagree, the in scope list wins because it is the more recently updated document.

3599
05:17:15,182 --> 05:17:22,148
“建模、可视化并自动化发布工作流”是 Code Pipeline 的产品描述，且 Code Pipeline 在范围内。
Model, visualize, and automate a release workflow is code pipeline's own product description and code pipeline is in scope.

3600
05:17:22,464 --> 05:17:26,628
注意与案例 1 的对比，在那个例子中我让你选择 Snowball。
Note the contrast with scenario 1 where I told you to pick snowball.

3601
05:17:27,278 --> 05:17:33,316
区别在于，那里的备选方案也超出了范围，所以旧答案仍然是最好的选择。
The difference is that there the alternative was also out of scope, so the old answer was still the best available.

3602
05:17:33,934 --> 05:17:37,220
而这里有一个在范围内的替代方案就在眼前。
Here there is an in-scope replacement sitting right there.

3603
05:17:39,024 --> 05:17:40,708
这就是情景 4 的逻辑。
Worked scenario 4.

3604
05:17:41,614 --> 05:17:44,900
你上个月创建了一个 AWS 账号来练习。
You created an AWS account last month to practice.

3605
05:17:46,510 --> 05:17:53,956
注册时，你选择了一个方案，获得了 100 美元的积分，并通过完成新手任务又获得了 100 美元。
At sign up, you chose a plan, received $100 in credits, and earned another 100 by completing onboarding tasks.

3606
05:17:54,304 --> 05:17:56,580
当时并没有提到任何关于“12个月”的内容。
There was no mention of 12 months of anything.

3607
05:17:57,454 --> 05:18:05,824
随后一个练习题要求你描述 AWS 免费套餐，并提供了“始终免费”、“12个月免费”和“短期试用”等选项。
A practice question then asks you to describe the AWS free tier and offers an option naming always free, 12 months free, and short

3608
05:18:05,984 --> 05:18:06,692
短期试用。
term trials.

3609
05:18:07,104 --> 05:18:08,452
你应该选哪个？
What should you select?

3610
05:18:09,582 --> 05:18:10,820
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3611
05:18:17,326 --> 05:18:22,308
答案是 A，这个情景就是把整个模块的内容浓缩成了一个问题。
The answer is A, and this scenario is the entire module compressed into one question.

3612
05:18:22,958 --> 05:18:30,628
这里你有来自你自己 AWS 账号的第一手证据，它与考试内容相矛盾，而这是最有说服力的证据类型，
Here you have first hand evidence from your own AWS account that contradicts the exam, which is the most convincing kind of evidence there is,

3613
05:18:31,310 --> 05:18:33,380
但它仍然不是回答问题的正确依据。
and it is still the wrong basis for answering.

3614
05:18:34,350 --> 05:18:40,720
考试测试的是带有发布日期的官方目录，而不是你面前的控制台。
The exam tests a documented catalog with a publication date, not the console in front of you.

3615
05:18:41,550 --> 05:18:43,520
选项 C 也值得提一下。
Option C deserves a word too.

3616
05:18:43,758 --> 05:18:49,092
瞎猜不会扣分，提出异议也不会加分，所以千万不要空着题目不填。
There is no penalty for guessing and no credit for objecting, so never leave a question blank.

3617
05:18:50,766 --> 05:18:55,040
要运用这个模块的逻辑，在考试中请根据官方目录来回答。
To use this module, in the exam, answer from the documented catalog.

3618
05:18:55,342 --> 05:19:00,960
当存在范围内替代方案时，优先选择它，就像在 Code Pipeline 优于 Code Catalyst 一样。
Where an in-scope replacement exists, prefer it as with code pipeline over code catalyst.

3619
05:19:01,486 --> 05:19:06,180
当不存在范围内替代方案时，旧答案依然有效，就像 Snowball 那样。
Where no in-scope replacement exists, the old answer stands, as with Snowball.

3620
05:19:06,638 --> 05:19:09,444
你自己去读一下“在范围内”和“超出范围”的列表。
Read the in-scope and out-of-scope lists yourself.

3621
05:19:09,998 --> 05:19:14,756
它们只需要 10 分钟，而且是 AWS 发布关于此考试的最新的内容。
They take 10 minutes and they're the most current thing AWS publishes about this exam.

3622
05:19:14,990 --> 05:19:20,868
并且记住，有些变化是删除，而另一些则是功能在不改变名称的情况下迁移。
And remember that some changes are removals while others are behavior moving under an unchanged name.

3623
05:19:21,134 --> 05:19:23,300
第二种情况更难被察觉。
The second kind is harder to spot.

3624
05:19:23,630 --> 05:19:24,320
最后一点。
One last

3625
05:19:24,320 --> 05:19:30,884
这个模块中的每一个事实都有日期标注，而且 AWS 会不断更新目录。
thing. Every fact in this module has a date attached and AWS keeps changing the catalog.

3626
05:19:32,654 --> 05:19:33,860
在入场前检查一下。
Check before you sit.

3627
05:19:35,310 --> 05:19:39,396
这个模块里根本不包含任何具体的 AWS 产品内容。
There is no AWS product content in this module at all.

3628
05:19:39,680 --> 05:19:44,612
它讲的是 AWS 是如何出题的，以及如何在时间压力下阅读题目。
It is about how AWS writes questions and how to read them under time pressure.

3629
05:19:45,422 --> 05:19:50,756
很大一部分错误答案是因为误读了问题，而不是因为不熟悉内容。
A real share of wrong answers come from misreading the question rather than not knowing the material.

3630
05:19:51,278 --> 05:19:54,000
这部分错误可以通过 20 分钟的练习来避免。
That share is recoverable in 20 minutes.

3631
05:19:55,310 --> 05:19:56,516
这是基本前提。
Here is the premise.

3632
05:19:57,326 --> 05:20:04,260
在真正的考试中，你会遇到这类题目：即便你能定义出选项列表中的每一个服务，你依然可能答错。
On the real exam, you will meet questions where you can define every single service in the option list and you will still get it wrong.

3633
05:20:05,230 --> 05:20:10,500
这不是因为你知识不够，而是因为题目中包含了一个你略过掉的关键词。
Not because you did not know enough, but because the question contained a word you skimmed past.

3634
05:20:11,438 --> 05:20:16,676
这些分数是你能拿到的最容易的分数，因为你已经完成了相关的学习。
Those marks are the cheapest ones available to you because you already did the studying.

3635
05:20:18,414 --> 05:20:24,196
AWS 会刻意将限定词大写，每一个词都指向特定的含义。
AWS capitalizes qualifier words deliberately and each one points somewhere specific.

3636
05:20:24,686 --> 05:20:32,420
“最具成本效益”意味着在满足所有陈述要求的前提下，选择最便宜的选项，这并不等同于仅仅是“最便宜”。
Most cost effective means the cheapest option that still meets every stated requirement, which is not the same as simply cheapest.

3637
05:20:33,360 --> 05:20:39,652
“运维开销最小”意味着管理程度最高的服务。因此，无服务器（Serverless）优于托管服务，而托管服务优于自托管。
Least operational overhead means the most managed service. So serverless beats managed beats self-run.

3638
05:20:40,302 --> 05:20:44,228
“最安全”意味着权限最严格，即使这意味着更多的工作量。
Most secure means tightest permissions, even if it is more work.

3639
05:20:44,846 --> 05:20:49,316
“部署最快”意味着目前的设置工作最少，即便后期成本更高。
Fasties to implement means least setup now, even if it costs more later.

3640
05:20:50,254 --> 05:20:56,068
而“设计目的为……”是指该服务的首要功能就是此项，而不是一个可以被强行扭转用途来完成这项任务的服务。
And design to means the service whose primary purpose this is, not one that could be bent into doing it.

3641
05:20:57,582 --> 05:20:59,396
这里有一种有效的阅读顺序。
Here is a reading order that works.

3642
05:20:59,680 --> 05:21:08,068
先读最后一行，因为真正的考点在末尾，而且知道了问题是什么之后，场景描述才会变得更清晰。
Read the last line first because the actual question lives at the end and the scenario makes more sense once you know what is being asked.

3643
05:21:08,400 --> 05:21:11,268
找到限定词并标注它排除掉的选项。
Find the qualifier and note what it eliminates.

3644
05:21:12,046 --> 05:21:17,988
阅读场景时寻找约束条件，因为每一个约束都会排除掉某些选项。
Read the scenario hunting for constraints because each constraint kills options.

3645
05:21:18,830 --> 05:21:22,212
然后，在看选项之前就先预测答案。
Then predict the answer before you read the options at all.

3646
05:21:24,046 --> 05:21:26,916
这个习惯是本模块中最有价值的技巧。
That habit is the most valuable one in this module.

3647
05:21:27,758 --> 05:21:32,240
如果你读到四个看似合理的选项，首先，其中一个会成为你的锚点。
If you read four plausible options, first, one of them will anchor you.

3648
05:21:32,782 --> 05:21:35,652
最后，采用排除法而非直接选择。
Finally, eliminate rather than select.

3649
05:21:37,166 --> 05:21:40,644
AWS 会重复使用一类常见的干扰项模式。
AWS reuses a small set of distractor shapes.

3650
05:21:41,120 --> 05:21:47,520
最常见的情况是：正确回答了另一个问题，即一个完全合理但并非题目要求的动作。
The right answer to a different question is the commonest, a perfectly sensible action that nobody asked for.

3651
05:21:47,760 --> 05:21:53,924
这种“更强力”的选项虽然可行，但比需要的更多，且当限定词要求较低开销时，它就会被排除。
The heavier version works but takes more effort than needed and loses whenever the qualifier is less overhead.

3652
05:21:54,830 --> 05:21:58,308
相邻服务：属于同一类别但功能不匹配的服务。
The adjacent service sits in the same category with the wrong job.

3653
05:21:58,880 --> 05:22:07,652
绝对化表述包含 all、always、never、unlimited 等词，这类选项通常会被完全排除且几乎总是错误的。
The absolute contains words like all, always, never, unlimited, or eliminates entirely and is nearly always wrong.

3654
05:22:08,526 --> 05:22:13,252
还有名称冲突，这只需要通过读全称就能判断出来。
And the name collision, which needs no explanation beyond reading the whole name.

3655
05:22:14,510 --> 05:22:20,100
另外 5 种模式，这些都出现在本课程之前的实战案例中。
5 more patterns, all of which appeared in worked scenarios earlier in this course.

3656
05:22:21,198 --> 05:22:27,620
“缓解”而非“消除”：三个选项能更好地处理缺陷，而只有一个能彻底消除它。
Mitigate instead of eliminate, where three options manage a flaw better and only one removes it.

3657
05:22:28,176 --> 05:22:33,348
半成品方案：场景描述了两个问题，但选项只解决了一个。
The half solution, where the scenario names two problems and the option fixes one.

3658
05:22:34,350 --> 05:22:39,236
虚构功能：由相邻服务的真实词汇拼凑出来的功能。
The invented feature, built from real vocabulary borrowed from a neighboring service.

3659
05:22:40,142 --> 05:22:41,892
正确但偏题。
Correct but off question.

3660
05:22:42,256 --> 05:22:45,092
一个正确的陈述，但回答的是没人问的问题。
A true statement answering something nobody asked.

3661
05:22:46,286 --> 05:22:50,336
还有那些看似接近但细节不对的选项。
And the near-miss number, right in shape but wrong in figure.

3662
05:22:51,630 --> 05:22:55,492
题干由四种类型的从句组成，每种的作用各不相同。
Stems are built from four kinds of clause and each behaves differently.

3663
05:22:56,174 --> 05:23:06,436
由 wants to 或 needs to 提示的目标决定答案。而由 must 或 cannot 或 without 提示的约束条件会在权衡任何因素之前排除掉某些选项。
A goal signaled by wants to or needs to picks the answer. A constraint signaled by must or cannot or without eliminates options before anything else is weighed.

3664
05:23:07,118 --> 05:23:19,620
由 would prefer 或 ideally 提示的偏好用于在平局时做选择，但它永远不能战胜约束条件。而由 willing to 或 able to 提示的邀请则允许你选择题目想要的那种方法。
A preference signaled by would prefer or ideally breaks a tie but never beats a constraint. And an invitation signaled by willing to or able to permits an approach the question wants you to choose.

3665
05:23:20,334 --> 05:23:25,136
把目标和约束条件搞混是这次考试中最常见的阅读错误。
Confusing a goal with a constraint is the commonest reading error on this exam.

3666
05:23:26,446 --> 05:23:27,332
有两种题型。
Two formats.

3667
05:23:27,776 --> 05:23:31,460
单选题有一个正确答案，有三个干扰项。
Multiple choice has one correct answer and three distractors.

3668
05:23:32,736 --> 05:23:40,004
多选题在五个或更多选项中包含两个或更多正确答案，且题干总是会告诉你需要选择几个。
Multiple response has two or more correct out of five or more options, and the stem always tells you how many to select.

3669
05:23:40,974 --> 05:23:45,508
多选题没有部分得分，所以选对两个、错一个也是零分。
There is no partial credit on multiple response, so two right and one wrong scores.

3670
05:23:46,115 --> 05:23:46,295
就是零分。
Zero.

3671
05:23:47,470 --> 05:23:49,572
这里有一个有用的结构性见解。
Here is the useful structural insight.

3672
05:23:50,016 --> 05:23:55,876
「选择两个」这类题目几乎总是包含两个不同的需求，每个需求对应一个服务。
Choose two questions almost always contain two distinct requirements with one service answering each.

3673
05:23:57,326 --> 05:24:03,844
如果你发现自己选了两个功能相同的服务，就去重新阅读场景，找出你漏掉的第二个需求。
If you find yourself picking two services that do the same thing, reread the scenario for the second requirement you missed.

3674
05:24:05,358 --> 05:24:14,180
关于时间分配，65 道题有 90 分钟，大约每题有 83 秒，大部分准备充分的考生都能在留有余量的情况下完成考试。
On timing, 90 minutes for 65 questions is about 83 seconds each, and most prepared candidates finish with time to spare.

3675
05:24:14,656 --> 05:24:18,896
任何耗时超过 90 秒的题目都要标记一下，然后立即跳过。
Flag anything taking more than 90 seconds and move on at once.

3676
05:24:19,136 --> 05:24:23,588
稍后再用清醒的头脑回来处理，因为后面的题目往往能帮你想起一些模糊的记忆。
Come back with fresh eyes because later questions often jog something loose.

3677
05:24:24,462 --> 05:24:30,256
在进入下一题之前一定要填上答案，即使是标记过的题目，因为猜题没有扣分。
Always put an answer down before moving on, even on flagged questions, because there is no penalty for guessing.

3678
05:24:30,336 --> 05:24:35,492
而且除非你能明确指出第一次阅读时错在哪了，否则不要在第三次看的时候去更改答案。
And do not change an answer on a third look unless you can name the specific thing you misread the first time.

3679
05:24:35,950 --> 05:24:38,404
还要记住，有 15 道题是不计分的。
Remember too that 15 questions are unscored.

3680
05:24:39,214 --> 05:24:41,732
那些让你卡壳的题目可能根本不计分。
The one that defeats you may not count.

3681
05:24:43,342 --> 05:24:47,460
当你真的不知道时，有一套合理的猜测顺序。
When you genuinely do not know, there is a reasonable order of guessing.

3682
05:24:48,334 --> 05:24:49,956
首先排除绝对化的表述。
Eliminate absolutes first.

3683
05:24:50,510 --> 05:24:54,596
任何包含 all、always、never 或 unlimited 的选项。
Anything promising all, always, never or unlimited.

3684
05:24:55,470 --> 05:25:01,188
如果限定词是「运维开销最少」，就排除掉任何涉及管理服务器的选项。
If the qualifier says least operational overhead, eliminate anything that means managing servers.

3685
05:25:02,094 --> 05:25:07,012
比起可以通过配置来完成任务的通用服务，更倾向于选择专用服务。
Prefer a purpose built service over a general one that could be configured to do the job.

3686
05:25:07,456 --> 05:25:14,852
比起自己构建，更倾向于选择 AWS 管理的选项，因为这次考试非常一致地奖励这种做法。
Prefer the AWS managed option over building it yourself because this exam rewards managed with great consistency.

3687
05:25:15,296 --> 05:25:20,388
而且如果一个服务不在在范围内列表中，它极不可能是正确答案。
And if a service is not on the in scope list, it is very unlikely to be the answer.

3688
05:25:21,646 --> 05:25:26,500
工作场景 1。这个题目考查的是限定词，而不是服务本身。
Work scenario 1. And this one is about the qualifier rather than the services.

3689
05:25:26,816 --> 05:25:29,476
一家公司需要一个每晚缩放图像的任务。
A company needs a nightly image resizing job.

3690
05:25:29,696 --> 05:25:35,140
该任务大约耗时 4 分钟，每天运行一次，且公司不想管理基础设施。
It takes about 4 minutes, runs once a day, and the company does not want to manage infrastructure.

3691
05:25:36,046 --> 05:25:41,924
题目以「哪种方案能以最低的运维开销满足这些要求？」结尾。
The question ends with the phrase which solution will meet these requirements with the least operational overhead?

3692
05:25:42,336 --> 05:25:44,676
这个限定词指向哪个选项？
Which option does the qualifier point at?

3693
05:25:45,390 --> 05:25:46,756
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3694
05:25:53,422 --> 05:26:00,144
答案是 C。注意，仅凭这个限定词，即使不了解任何工作负载信息，你也能对这四个选项进行排序。
The answer is C. Notice that you could rank these four options without knowing anything about the workload purely from the qualifier.

3695
05:26:00,304 --> 05:26:05,744
「最低运维开销」的排序是：无服务器、托管型，然后是自运行。
Least operational overhead orders them serverless, then managed, then self-run.

3696
05:26:06,144 --> 05:26:11,264
即 Lambda、接着是自动扩容，然后是 EC2，最后是 EKS。
Lambda, then autoscaling, then EC2, then EKS.

3697
05:26:12,142 --> 05:26:20,036
4 分钟的运行时是唯一相关的技术细节，它之所以重要，是因为它确认了该任务符合 Lambda 15 分钟的限制。
The 4 minute runtime is the only technical detail that matters, and it only matters because it confirms the job fits inside Lambda's 15 minute limit.

3698
05:26:20,464 --> 05:26:22,980
同样值得注意的是题目里没提到的内容。
Also worth noticing what the question did not say.

3699
05:26:23,824 --> 05:26:27,172
从未提到成本，所以廉价并不是这里的决定性因素。
Cost is never mentioned, so cheapness is not a tiebreaker here.

3700
05:26:28,686 --> 05:26:30,116
工作场景 2。
Work scenario 2.

3701
05:26:30,624 --> 05:26:42,308
同样的每晚图像处理任务，但现在题目以「最具成本效益」结尾。公司补充说他们已经有一组在夜间利用率较低的 EC2 实例。
Same nightly image job, but the question now ends with most cost effectively. The company adds that it already runs a fleet of EC2 instances sitting at low utilization overnight.

3702
05:26:42,544 --> 05:26:47,684
该任务是无状态的，如果中断也可以重启。答案变了吗？
The job is stateless and can be restarted if interrupted. Does the answer change?

3703
05:26:48,784 --> 05:26:50,084
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3704
05:26:56,398 --> 05:27:03,264
答案是 B，这一对对比正是本模块的核心重点。这个场景与前一个几乎完全相同。
The answer is B and this pair is the whole point of the module. The scenario is nearly identical to the previous one.

3705
05:27:03,502 --> 05:27:10,372
仅仅改变了一个限定词，正确答案就变了。在「最低运维开销」下，Lambda 胜出，因为它无需管理。
One qualifier changed and the correct answer moved. Under least overhead, lambda wins because there is nothing to manage.

3706
05:27:11,022 --> 05:27:18,404
在「最具成本效益」下，利用已经支付的容量胜出，因为夜间闲置容量没有边际成本。
Under most cost effective, using capacity you already pay for wins because idle overnight capacity has no marginal cost.

3707
05:27:18,944 --> 05:27:24,708
选项 C 是典型的过度设计。为了解决一个每晚的批处理任务而去重构生产环境集群。
Option C is the classic overreach. Re-architecting a production fleet to solve a nightly batch job.

3708
05:27:25,184 --> 05:27:28,484
每一次在阅读选项之前，都要先找到限定词。
Find the qualifier before you read the options every single time.

3709
05:27:30,055 --> 05:27:31,235
工作场景 3
Worked Scenario 3

3710
05:27:31,235 --> 05:27:34,276
这是你在考试当天会产生的一种感觉。
which is about a feeling you will have on exam day.

3711
05:27:35,374 --> 05:27:39,264
题目读到：一家公司想要改善其安全态势。
A question reads A company wants to improve its security posture.

3712
05:27:39,566 --> 05:27:40,964
它应该使用哪个服务？
Which service should it use?

3713
05:27:41,486 --> 05:27:47,908
选项是 GuardDuty、Inspector、Security Hub 和 Macie，而且场景中没有提供其他细节。
The options are guard duty, inspector, security hub, and Macy, and the scenario gives no other detail.

3714
05:27:48,718 --> 05:27:51,344
遇到这种题目该怎么办？
What should you do with a question like this?

3715
05:27:51,726 --> 05:27:52,868
停下来思考一下。
Pause and decide.

3716
05:27:59,534 --> 05:28:03,172
答案是 B，而且原因比得分更重要。
The answer is B and the reason matters more than the mark.

3717
05:28:03,904 --> 05:28:08,132
AWS 不会发布四个选项都同样正确的题目。
AWS does not publish questions with four equally correct answers.

3718
05:28:08,398 --> 05:28:11,076
他们专门审查题目就是为了防止这种情况发生。
They are reviewed specifically to prevent that.

3719
05:28:11,584 --> 05:28:16,900
所以当所有选项看起来都对时，正确的解读不是「题目不公平」。
So when every option looks right, the correct interpretation is not that the question is unfair.

3720
05:28:17,838 --> 05:28:19,396
而是你漏掉了一个词。
It is that you have skimmed a word.

3721
05:28:19,758 --> 05:28:28,772
这种感觉——即四个选项看起来都像正确答案——其实是一种信息。把它当作一个信号，提醒你重新阅读题干，区分性的细节通常就在第二句里。
That feeling of all four being plausible is information. Treat it as a signal to reread the stem, and the distinguishing detail will usually be sitting in the second sentence.

3722
05:28:35,264 --> 05:28:36,384
来看看这个题干。
Consider this STEM.

3723
05:28:36,944 --> 05:28:41,344
一家公司想要缩短配置测试环境所需的时间。
A company wants to reduce the time it takes to provision test environments.

3724
05:28:41,584 --> 05:28:45,604
法规要求所有测试数据必须保留在英国境内。
Regulation requires that all test data remains within the United Kingdom.

3725
05:28:46,478 --> 05:28:49,636
团队更倾向于使用工程师们已经熟悉的解决方案。
The team would prefer a solution its engineers already know.

3726
05:28:50,606 --> 05:28:53,956
而且，如果必要的话，公司愿意采用新的工具。
And the company is willing to adopt new tooling if necessary.

3727
05:28:55,022 --> 05:28:58,052
哪一个条款能排除掉最多的选项？
Which clause will eliminate the most answer options?

3728
05:28:59,022 --> 05:29:00,260
停下来思考一下并做决定。
Pause and decide.

3729
05:29:06,944 --> 05:29:08,304
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

3730
05:29:08,895 --> 05:29:11,940
按照这个顺序来分析题干，做题速度会明显变快。
Work a stem in this order and questions get noticeably faster.

3731
05:29:12,304 --> 05:29:14,980
先看约束条件，因为它们能直接排除选项。
Constraints first because they remove options outright.

3732
05:29:15,406 --> 05:29:17,604
接着看目标，从剩下的选项中进行筛选。
Then the goal which selects among what survives.

3733
05:29:18,670 --> 05:29:21,540
最后看偏好，仅当仍有两个选项时才考虑。
Then preferences, only if two options still remain.

3734
05:29:22,382 --> 05:29:24,900
注意 C 和 D 这两个条款在这里共同起到了什么作用。
Notice what clauses C and D do together here.

3735
05:29:25,744 --> 05:29:33,504
团队倾向于使用熟悉的工具，但公司愿意采用新工具，这几乎完全抵消了那个偏好。
The team would prefer familiar tooling, but the company is willing to adopt new tooling which cancels that preference almost entirely.

3736
05:29:34,035 --> 05:29:38,244
题干中有时包含某些条款，其唯一作用就是去抵消另一个条款。
Stems sometimes contain a clause whose only job is to neutralize another one.

3737
05:29:39,854 --> 05:29:42,372
一些考试前一晚的实用建议。
Some practicalities for the evening before.

3738
05:29:43,278 --> 05:29:47,104
重温一下「易混淆对项」模块，因为它就是专门为这种情况设计的。
Rewatch the confusion pairs module because it is built for that moment.

3739
05:29:47,264 --> 05:29:51,396
重新阅读“在范围内”和“不在范围内”的清单，这只需要 10 分钟。
Reread the in-scope and out-of-scope lists, which takes 10 minutes.

3740
05:29:52,366 --> 05:29:59,076
不要在考试前一晚做新的模拟题，因为糟糕的分数会让你没睡好，而且学不到任何能实操的知识。
Do not take a fresh practice exam the night before because a poor score costs you sleep and teaches you nothing you can act on.

3741
05:29:59,504 --> 05:30:04,624
如果你是参加在线考试，请提前运行系统测试，并把桌面清理干净。
If you are testing online, run the system test in advance and clear your desk completely.

3742
05:30:05,486 --> 05:30:10,852
记住评分是补偿性的，所以一个弱项领域不会导致你直接挂科。
And remember the scoring is compensatory, so one weak domain cannot fail you on its own.

3743
05:30:11,470 --> 05:30:17,188
这里的信心来自于你有应对难题的流程，而不是因为你掌握了每一个服务。
Confidence here comes from having a procedure for hard questions, not from having met every service.

3744
05:30:18,704 --> 05:30:21,252
这是三个模拟考试中的第一个。
This is the first of three practice exams.

3745
05:30:21,584 --> 05:30:25,444
包含 20 道题，各领域的分布与考试当天完全一致。
20 questions with the domains mixed exactly as they will be on the day.

3746
05:30:25,824 --> 05:30:31,716
在讲解每一道题之前会停顿 9 秒，所以你可以不用按暂停键来做这套练习。
Each question pauses for 9 seconds before the walkthrough, so you can take this without touching the pause button.

3747
05:30:32,464 --> 05:30:36,100
在每项解析开始前，大声说出你的答案。
Commit to an answer out loud before each walkthrough begins.

3748
05:30:37,806 --> 05:30:39,428
开始之前有四件事要注意。
Four things before you start.

3749
05:30:39,760 --> 05:30:49,600
回答每一道题，包括你不确定的题目，因为瞎猜是免费的，而且这是在练习这种习惯。把你的答案写下来，因为你无法凭记忆来计算各领域的得分。
Answer every question, including ones you are unsure of, because guessing is free and this is practice for that habit. Write your answers down since you cannot score by domain from memory.

3750
05:30:49,806 --> 05:30:54,020
每次讲解都会标明所属领域，这样你之后就可以统计每个领域的总分了。
Each walkthrough names its domain so you can total per domain afterwards.

3751
05:30:54,542 --> 05:31:00,580
而且不要停下来查资料，因为靠笔记撑起来的高分对你没有任何实际帮助。
And do not pause to look things up because a score inflated by notes tells you nothing you can act on.

3752
05:31:01,998 --> 05:31:02,788
第1题。
Question 1.

3753
05:31:03,342 --> 05:31:09,028
一家公司需要在 CSV 文件上传到 S3 存储桶后立即进行验证。
A company needs to validate uploaded CSV files as soon as they arrive in an S3 bucket.

3754
05:31:09,520 --> 05:31:16,516
每个文件的验证大约需要 90 秒，且文件以不可预测的突发流量到达，有时甚至连续几小时都没有新文件。
Validation takes about 90 seconds per file and files arrive in unpredictable bursts, sometimes none for hours.

3755
05:31:16,880 --> 05:31:20,612
该公司不想管理服务器，也不想为闲置容量付费。
The company does not want to manage servers or pay for idle capacity.

3756
05:31:21,440 --> 05:31:23,396
它应该使用哪项服务？
Which service should it use?

3757
05:31:33,838 --> 05:31:37,444
答案是 B，Lambda，这是领域 3。
The answer is B, lambda, and this is domain 3.

3758
05:31:37,742 --> 05:31:41,252
由 S3 上传触发的四个信号：
Four signals lineup triggered by an S3 upload.

3759
05:31:42,350 --> 05:31:45,156
有闲置期的不可预测突发流量，
Unpredictable bursts with idle periods,

3760
05:31:45,806 --> 05:31:52,068
无需管理服务器，且 90 秒的时间在 15 分钟的限制内。
no servers to manage, and 90 seconds, which sits comfortably inside the 15 minute limit.

3761
05:31:52,686 --> 05:31:57,572
每当计算类题目出现时长时，都要先对照这个限制。
Whenever a duration appears in a compute question, check it against that limit first.

3762
05:31:59,182 --> 05:32:00,132
第2题。
Question 2.

3763
05:32:00,878 --> 05:32:06,916
一家医院的预约系统在每个冬天需求激增，而在夏天大幅下降。
A hospital's appointment booking system sees demand rise sharply every winter and fall away in summer.

3764
05:32:07,630 --> 05:32:12,960
在本地部署时，他们为冬季高峰购买了服务器，但这些服务器在全年的其余时间里大部分处于闲置状态。
On premises, it bought servers for the winter peak, which sat mostly idle the rest of the

3765
05:32:12,960 --> 05:32:21,476
迁移后，实例数量现在会随着需求的波动自动增加或减少。
year. After migrating, the number of instances now grows and shrinks automatically as demand changes.

3766
05:32:32,078 --> 05:32:35,396
答案是 B，弹性，这是领域 1。
The answer is B, elasticity, and this is domain one.

3767
05:32:35,760 --> 05:32:39,460
需要区分的一对概念始终是敏捷性和弹性。
The pair to separate is always agility and elasticity.

3768
05:32:39,760 --> 05:32:42,180
敏捷性衡量的是完成新任务所需的时间。
Agility measures time to do something new.

3769
05:32:42,830 --> 05:32:45,732
弹性衡量的是容量如何随需求变化。
Elasticity measures capacity following demand.

3770
05:32:46,318 --> 05:32:52,740
在这里，需求曲线没有改变。冬天依然是冬天，只是现在只有容量在随之变动。
Here, the demand curve is unchanged. Winter is still winter, and only the capacity now moves with it.

3771
05:32:54,030 --> 05:32:54,756
第3题。
Question 3.

3772
05:32:55,246 --> 05:32:59,044
一家公司在 AWS Lambda 上运行一个图像处理功能。
A company runs an image processing function on AWS Lambda.

3773
05:32:59,534 --> 05:33:08,065
一项安全性审计要求确认谁负责修复底层操作系统的补丁，以及谁负责函数自身代码中的
A security audit asks who patches the operating system underneath the function and who is responsible for vulnerabilities in the function's own

3774
05:33:08,320 --> 05:33:08,960
漏洞。
code.

3775
05:33:10,606 --> 05:33:12,100
哪项陈述是正确的？
Which statement is correct?

3776
05:33:22,734 --> 05:33:25,120
答案是 A，这是领域
The answer is A, and this is domain

3777
05:33:25,120 --> 05:33:29,732
2。这条线按服务划分，而 Lambda 位于它的最远端。
2. The line moves by service and lambda sits at the far end of it.

3778
05:33:30,254 --> 05:33:34,340
你无法接触到操作系统，所以由 AWS 来负责打补丁。
There is no operating system you can reach, so AWS patches it.

3779
05:33:35,022 --> 05:33:40,580
在任何服务中都不会变动的是你的数据、你的权限以及你自己的代码。
What never moves on any service is your data, your permissions, and your own code.

3780
05:33:41,774 --> 05:33:42,820
第4题。
Question 4.

3781
05:33:43,120 --> 05:33:48,800
一家公司在 EC2 上运行稳定的生产工作负载，并希望在 3 年内获得大幅折扣。
A company runs a steady production workload on EC2 and wants a substantial discount over 3 years.

3782
05:33:49,040 --> 05:33:54,532
在此期间，他们计划将一些组件迁移到 Fargate，并将其他部分重写为 Lambda 函数。
During that period, it plans to migrate some components to Fargate and rewrite others as Lambda functions.

3783
05:33:54,720 --> 05:33:57,956
他们希望在这些迁移发生时，折扣依然能够继续适用。
It wants the discount to keep applying as those migrations happen.

3784
05:34:08,526 --> 05:34:11,120
答案是 B，这是领域 4。
The answer is B, and this is domain 4.

3785
05:34:11,630 --> 05:34:16,708
将 Fargate 和 Lambda 与 EC2 并列出现，一下就排除了其他所有选项。
Naming Fargate and Lambda alongside EC2 eliminates everything else in one move.

3786
05:34:19,246 --> 05:34:28,000
预留实例仅涵盖 EC2，EC2 实例节省计划也是如此。只有计算节省计划涵盖这三种服务。
Reserved instances cover only EC2, and so do EC2 instance savings plans. Only a compute savings plan spans all three services.

3787
05:34:29,294 --> 05:34:33,680
问题 5。一家公司将渲染好的视频缩略图存储在 Amazon S3 中。
Question 5. A company stores rendered video thumbnails in Amazon S3.

3788
05:34:34,062 --> 05:34:44,292
这些内容访问频率较低，但请求时必须在毫秒内可用。如果丢失了，公司可以在一小时内从原始视频中重新生成所有内容。
They are accessed infrequently but must be available in milliseconds when requested. If they were ever lost, the company could regenerate everyone from the source video within an hour.

3789
05:34:45,134 --> 05:34:49,028
它要求在符合这些事实的前提下，寻求最低的存储成本。
It wants the lowest storage cost consistent with those facts.

3790
05:34:59,758 --> 05:35:02,660
答案是 C，这是领域 3。
The answer is C, and this is domain 3.

3791
05:35:03,566 --> 05:35:06,180
这两个事实决定了 S3 的类别。
Two facts pick an S3 class.

3792
05:35:07,600 --> 05:35:12,996
低频访问且具有毫秒级检索要求，将其范围缩小到低频访问层。
Infrequent access with millisecond retrieval narrows it to the infrequent access tiers.

3793
05:35:13,806 --> 05:35:21,680
然后重新生成的条款就在它们之间做选择，因为丢失一个可用区只会导致公司多花一小时去渲染
Then the regeneration clause decides between them because losing an availability zone would cause this company an hour of rendering

3794
05:35:21,920 --> 05:35:23,760
而不是导致数据本身丢失。
rather than the data itself.

3795
05:35:25,070 --> 05:35:26,160
问题 6。
Question 6.

3796
05:35:26,400 --> 05:35:33,124
一家公司的财务总监需要更改 AWS 账户的注册邮箱地址，并降低其支持计划级别。
A company's finance director needs to change the AWS account's registered email address and downgrade its support plan.

3797
05:35:34,862 --> 05:35:40,900
一个拥有管理员访问策略的管理员尝试这两项操作都失败了。两者都不可能完成。
An administrator with the administrator access policy attached attempts both and fines. Neither is possible.

3798
05:35:42,190 --> 05:35:44,964
为什么该管理员无法执行这些任务？
Why can the administrator not perform these tasks?

3799
05:35:55,694 --> 05:35:58,564
答案是 B，这是领域 2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

3800
05:35:58,990 --> 05:36:02,372
与其去死记硬背根用户任务列表，不如去了解它的逻辑结构。
Rather than memorizing the root task list, learn its shape.

3801
05:36:03,040 --> 05:36:08,708
这些是账户层面的操作，改变的是账户本身，而不是其中的任何内容。
These are account level actions changing the account itself rather than anything inside it.

3802
05:36:10,062 --> 05:36:16,612
任何涉及更改账户、身份、计划或其存在的操作都需要根用户。
Anything that changes the account, its identity, its plan, or its existence needs the root user.

3803
05:36:18,318 --> 05:36:19,140
问题 7。
Question 7.

3804
05:36:19,680 --> 05:36:24,320
一家公司正在重新设计工作负载，以减少它消耗的能源。
A company is redesigning a workload to reduce the energy it consumes.

3805
05:36:24,480 --> 05:36:32,868
他们计划迁移到更高效的实例类型，在夜间关闭非生产环境，并选择碳强度较低的区域。
It plans to move to more efficient instance types, shut down non-production environments overnight, and choose regions with lower carbon intensity.

3806
05:36:33,760 --> 05:36:38,308
这代表 Well-Architected Framework 中的哪一支柱？
Which pillar of the well-architected framework does this represent.

3807
05:36:48,622 --> 05:36:49,840
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

3808
05:36:50,000 --> 05:36:52,560
可持续性，这是领域 1。
Sustainability and this is domain one.

3809
05:36:53,102 --> 05:36:54,948
注意为什么选项 A 很诱人。
Notice why option A is tempting.

3810
05:36:55,374 --> 05:36:59,920
列出的每一个操作也都在降低成本，所以选成本相关的答案听起来似乎也是合理的。
Every action listed also reduces cost, so a cost answer would feel defensible.

3811
05:37:00,174 --> 05:37:03,812
但目标句子说的是消耗的能源，而不是花费的钱。
But the goal sentence says energy consumed, not money spent.

3812
05:37:04,654 --> 05:37:11,120
这个目标选择了对应的支柱，而可持续性是旧教材中忽略的第六个支柱。
The goal picks the pillar, and sustainability is the sixth pillar that older material omits.

3813
05:37:12,985 --> 05:37:21,188
问题 8：一个运行在私有子网 EC2 实例上的应用程序，将大量数据写入 Amazon S3。
Question 8 An application on EC2 instances in a private subnet writes large volumes of data to Amazon S3.

3814
05:37:22,160 --> 05:37:30,436
合规性要求流量绝不能经过公共互联网，而且财务团队询问了 NAT 网关的处理费用。
Compliance requires the traffic never to traverse the public internet, and the finance team has queried the NAT gateway processing charges.

3815
05:37:31,120 --> 05:37:33,188
公司应该采用什么？
What should the company implement?

3816
05:37:43,840 --> 05:37:45,188
答案是 A。
The answer is A.

3817
05:37:45,440 --> 05:37:46,948
这是第三个领域。
And this is domain three.

3818
05:37:47,680 --> 05:37:53,028
有两个不同的考量点：合规性和成本，而一个选项能同时解决这两个问题。
Two separate concerns: compliance and cost, and one answer resolves both.

3819
05:37:53,774 --> 05:37:58,372
S3 和 Dynamo DB 的网关端点不收取额外费用。
Gateway endpoints for S3 and Dynamo DB carry no additional charge.

3820
05:37:59,502 --> 05:38:03,120
这就是为什么它能在满足合规性的同时，解决财务方面的异议。
That is why they settle the finance objection at the same time as the compliance.

3821
05:38:03,360 --> 05:38:04,000
下一个。
One.

3822
05:38:05,390 --> 05:38:06,212
问题 9。
Question 9.

3823
05:38:06,702 --> 05:38:15,360
一家公司将容器镜像推送到 Amazon ECR。安全团队想持续了解任何镜像是否包含已知发布的漏洞。
A company pushes container images to Amazon ECR. Security wants to know continuously whether any image contains software with known published vulnerabilities.

3824
05:38:15,520 --> 05:38:22,340
他们还希望在新的漏洞影响已存储的镜像时收到警报。不应在镜像中安装任何内容。
It also wants alerting when a new vulnerability affects a stored image. Nothing should need installing into the images.

3825
05:38:32,960 --> 05:38:36,800
答案是 B，这是第二个领域。
The answer is B, and this is domain two.

3826
05:38:37,280 --> 05:38:44,160
行为特征对应 GuardDuty，数据内容属于 Messy，而漏洞检测则是 Inspector。
Behavior is guard duty, data content is messy, and vulnerabilities are inspector.

3827
05:38:44,720 --> 05:38:54,800
重新扫描的细节确认了这一点，因为 Inspector 会在发布新漏洞时持续重新评估存储的镜像，而不是仅在推送时进行扫描。
The rescanning detail confirms it because inspector continuously re-evaluates stored images as new vulnerabilities are published rather than only scanning at push

3828
05:38:55,040 --> 05:38:55,360
（此处为上条句子的延续）
time.

3829
05:38:56,782 --> 05:38:57,668
问题 10。
Question 10.

3830
05:38:58,190 --> 05:39:06,468
一家公司必须将 Microsoft SQL Server 数据库迁移到托管的 AWS 数据库服务。
A company must migrate a Microsoft SQL server database to a managed AWS database service.

3831
05:39:07,790 --> 05:39:12,868
应用程序不能修改，且明确要求使用 SQL Server。
The application cannot be modified and requires SQL Server specifically.

3832
05:39:13,998 --> 05:39:20,548
该公司还要求自动备份，并具备到另一个可用区的自动故障转移选项。
The company also wants automated backups and the option of automatic failover to another availability zone.

3833
05:39:30,830 --> 05:39:33,284
答案是 B，这是相关领域。
The answer is B, and this is domain play.

3834
05:39:33,806 --> 05:39:38,596
Aurora 在几乎每一个关系型数据库问题中都作为干扰项出现，因为它听起来像是个高级答案。
Aurora appears in almost every relational question as a distractor because it sounds like the premium answer.

3835
05:39:39,278 --> 05:39:41,892
它仅兼容 MySQL 和 Postgres。
It is compatible with MySQL and Postgres only.

3836
05:39:42,638 --> 05:39:48,804
一旦场景中提到 SQL Server、Oracle、MariaDB 或 DB2，答案就是标准的 RDS。
The moment a scenario names SQL server Oracle MariaDB or DB2, the answer is standard RDS.

3837
05:39:50,574 --> 05:39:51,428
问题 11。
Question 11.

3838
05:39:51,790 --> 05:39:56,388
一家公司在自己的本地数据中心通过 VMware 运行数百台虚拟机。
A company runs several hundred virtual machines on VMware in its cone data center.

3839
05:39:56,768 --> 05:40:04,548
它希望快速将整个资产迁移到 AWS，且无需重新购买硬件，也不需要改变运维团队的日常工作方式。
It wants to move the whole estate to AWS quickly without rebuying hardware and without changing how its operations team works day to day.

3840
05:40:04,928 --> 05:40:07,908
任何应用程序都不会被修改或重新架构。
No applications will be modified or re-architected.

3841
05:40:18,368 --> 05:40:19,888
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

3842
05:40:20,334 --> 05:40:22,212
Relocate，这是领域一。
Relocate, and this is domain one.

3843
05:40:22,848 --> 05:40:28,676
Relocate 是大多数学习资料都会忽略的策略，这让它成为一个可靠的考题。
Relocate is the strategy most study material omits, which makes it a reliable exam question.

3844
05:40:29,198 --> 05:40:32,196
与 重新托管 的区别在于规模和运维。
The separator from re-host is scale and operations.

3845
05:40:33,888 --> 05:40:37,284
Re-host 是将服务器逐一迁移到 EC2 上。
Re-host moves servers onto EC2 individually.

3846
05:40:38,158 --> 05:40:42,852
Relocate 是在保持原有运营模型不变的情况下，迁移整个虚拟化环境。
Relocate moves an entire virtualization estate with the operating model intact.

3847
05:40:44,302 --> 05:40:45,168
第 12 题。
Question 12.

3848
05:40:45,518 --> 05:40:50,820
由于 TLS 证书过期且未被察觉，一家公司的公共网站出现了故障。
A company's public website suffered an outage when its TLS certificate expired unnoticed.

3849
05:40:51,470 --> 05:40:56,580
该证书是从第三方购买的，并手动安装在应用负载均衡器上。
The certificate was bought from a third party and installed manually on an application load balancer.

3850
05:40:57,134 --> 05:41:01,188
公司希望在无需任何人去主动操作的情况下完成续约。
The company wants renewal to happen without anyone remembering to act.

3851
05:41:11,470 --> 05:41:14,116
答案是 C，这是领域 2。
The answer is C, and this is domain 2.

3852
05:41:16,558 --> 05:41:21,380
四个选项中有三个是关于更安全地存储某些内容，但存储从来不是问题所在。
Three of the four options store something more securely, and storage was never the problem.

3853
05:41:22,638 --> 05:41:30,180
证书过期了。只有 Certificate Manager 能从续约过程中排除人工操作，而这正是最后一个条款要求的。
The certificate expired. Only certificate manager removes the human from the renewal, which is what the final clause demands.

3854
05:41:31,408 --> 05:41:32,676
第 13 题。
Question 13.

3855
05:41:33,038 --> 05:41:43,300
运维团队收到关于 EC2 实例集群 CPU 和网络的 CloudWatch 警报，但无法看到实例内部的内存使用情况或剩余磁盘空间。
An operations team receives CloudWatch alarms for CPU and network on its EC2 fleet, but it has no visibility of memory usage or free disk space inside the instances.

3856
05:41:44,878 --> 05:41:47,408
他们希望在同一个仪表板中看到这些指标。
It wants those metrics in the same dashboards.

3857
05:41:47,726 --> 05:41:50,660
这些实例运行的是标准的 Amazon Linux 镜像。
The instances run a standard Amazon Linux image.

3858
05:42:01,358 --> 05:42:04,260
答案是 B，这是领域 3。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

3859
05:42:04,622 --> 05:42:08,048
这直接源于共享责任模型。
This follows directly from the shared responsibility model.

3860
05:42:08,368 --> 05:42:22,116
AWS 能看到虚拟机管理程序所能看到的，即 CPU 和网络。内存和剩余磁盘空间存在于客户操作系统内部，也就是属于你的部分。因此，必须由你安装的软件来报告这些信息。
AWS can see what the hypervisor sees, which is CPU and network. Memory and free disk space exist inside the guest operating system, which is yours. So something you install has to report them.

3861
05:42:23,758 --> 05:42:24,644
第 14 题。
Question 14.

3862
05:42:24,848 --> 05:42:28,768
一家公司在 AWS 上运行一个业务关键型的交易平台。
A company runs a business critical trading platform on AWS.

3863
05:42:28,928 --> 05:42:37,892
如果该平台宕机，它需要 15 分钟内的响应，并需要一名了解其架构并能提供主动建议的指定 AWS 联系人。
It needs a 15-minute response if that platform goes down and a named AWS contact who understands its architecture and can advise proactively.

3864
05:42:38,208 --> 05:42:39,620
预算充足。
Budget is available.

3865
05:42:50,126 --> 05:42:52,964
答案是 D，这是领域 4。
The answer is D, and this is domain 4.

3866
05:42:53,262 --> 05:42:56,036
这两个陈述的条件都是企业级信号。
Both stated requirements are enterprise signals.

3867
05:42:56,750 --> 05:43:01,476
针对业务关键型宕机的 15 分钟响应以及指定的技术客户经理。
15 minutes for business critical down and a designated technical account manager.

3868
05:43:02,286 --> 05:43:03,300
Enterprise On
Enterprise on

3869
05:43:04,142 --> 05:43:09,380
Ramp 是故意设计的，提供的是 30 分钟响应和一个团队支持，而不是特定的个人。
Ramp is deliberately closed, offering 30 minutes and a pool rather than a named individual.

3870
05:43:10,126 --> 05:43:13,028
要看题目给出的具体数值，而不是泛泛的概括。
Read the stated figure, not the general shape.

3871
05:43:14,254 --> 05:43:15,328
第 15 题。
Question 15.

3872
05:43:15,726 --> 05:43:28,292
一家公司刚开始开展云计划，没有构建环境的标准方法，没有着陆区，也没有达成一致的应用程序现代化方案。其工程师们各自按照不同的方式进行设置。
A company beginning its cloud program has no standard way to build environments, no landing zone, and no agreed approach to modernizing its applications. Its engineers each set things up differently.

3873
05:43:29,070 --> 05:43:32,068
哪种云采用框架视角能解决这个问题？
Which CAF perspective addresses this?

3874
05:43:42,576 --> 05:43:46,656
答案是 A，这是领域一。
The answer is a platform, and this is domain one.

3875
05:43:47,214 --> 05:43:50,660
关键点在于缺失的所有内容都是技术基础设施，
The tell is that everything missing is technical infrastructure,

3876
05:43:52,110 --> 05:43:56,068
包括着陆区、构建标准和现代化方案。
a landing zone, build standards, a modernization approach.

3877
05:43:56,976 --> 05:44:06,020
与之相对的是人员（即缺乏技能的工程师）和治理（即没有人控制成本或风险）。
Contrast that with people, which would be engineers lacking the skills, and governance, which would be nobody controlling cost or risk.

3878
05:44:07,470 --> 05:44:08,516
第 16 题。
Question 16.

3879
05:44:08,816 --> 05:44:11,620
一个保险索赔申请分七个步骤处理。
An insurance claim is processed in seven steps.

3880
05:44:12,016 --> 05:44:15,684
其中一些步骤并行运行，并且有一个根据索赔金额进行分支处理的步骤。
Some run in parallel and one branches depending on the claim value.

3881
05:44:16,256 --> 05:44:21,060
任何失败的步骤在进入人工审核前必须重试三次。
Any step that fails must be retried three times before the claim goes for manual review.

3882
05:44:21,710 --> 05:44:25,796
公司希望在出现问题时，能看到索赔申请停在了哪个环节。
The company wants to see where a claim stopped when something goes wrong.

3883
05:44:36,558 --> 05:44:39,268
答案是 C，这是领域三。
The answer is C, and this is domain 3.

3884
05:44:39,694 --> 05:44:42,020
四个信号都指向“编排”。
Four signals all point at orchestration.

3885
05:44:42,286 --> 05:44:43,780
按定义顺序排列的步骤。
Steps in a defined order.

3886
05:44:44,270 --> 05:44:45,508
并行执行，
Parallel execution,

3887
05:44:46,318 --> 05:44:50,244
条件分支，以及带有回退机制的重试行为。
conditional branching, and retry behavior with a fallback.

3888
05:44:51,086 --> 05:44:58,404
再加上查看运行中断位置的要求，步骤函数是唯一提供可视化工作流的服务。
Add the requirement to see where a run stopped, and step functions is the only service that offers a visual workflow.

3889
05:44:59,982 --> 05:45:01,056
第 17 题。
Question 17.

3890
05:45:01,230 --> 05:45:04,736
一家公司正从一个 AWS 账号扩展到约 40 个。
A company is expanding from one AWS account to about 40.

3891
05:45:04,910 --> 05:45:14,372
它希望快速建立一个安全的多账号环境，并从一开始就具备标准控制措施。它还要求集中式日志记录以及一种可重复申请新账号的方法。
It wants a secure multi-account environment established quickly with standard controls from the outset. It also wants centralized logging and a repeatable way to request new accounts.

3892
05:45:15,214 --> 05:45:17,956
它目前没有现成的设计方案，且时间紧迫。
It has no existing design and little time.

3893
05:45:28,885 --> 05:45:36,964
答案是 B。这是领域二。从功能上讲，组织并不错误，这正是它作为一个很好的干扰项的原因。
The answer is B And this is domain 2. Organizations is not wrong in the sense of being incapable, and that is what makes it a good distractor.

3894
05:45:37,230 --> 05:45:41,220
将其排除掉的原因是“快速”和“没有现成设计”这两个条件的结合。
What rules it out is the combination of quickly and no existing design.

3895
05:45:42,030 --> 05:45:44,976
控制塔提供的是一种有预设观点的配置方案。
Control tower is the opinionated setup.

3896
05:45:45,205 --> 05:45:49,465
组织则是其底层的原始能力。
organizations is the raw capability underneath it.

3897
05:45:49,902 --> 05:45:50,756
第 18 题。
Question 18.

3898
05:45:51,214 --> 05:45:57,220
一家公司在单一 AWS 区域的三个可用区内运行其整个平台。
A company runs its entire platform in a single AWS region across three availability zones.

3899
05:45:57,536 --> 05:46:05,988
监管机构现在要求它证明，如果整个区域长时间不可用，它仍能继续运营。
Its regulator now requires it to demonstrate it can continue operating if that entire region became unavailable for an extended period.

3900
05:46:06,478 --> 05:46:09,828
该区域内的可用性从未成为过问题。
Availability within the region has never been a problem.

3901
05:46:20,462 --> 05:46:23,236
答案是 B，这是领域 3。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

3902
05:46:23,918 --> 05:46:25,348
这里的区别非常明确。
The distinction is precise.

3903
05:46:26,574 --> 05:46:32,196
多个可用区可以防止数据中心丢失，而这家公司已经具备了这一点。
Multiple availability zones protect against losing a data center, and this company already has that.

3904
05:46:33,166 --> 05:46:38,020
整个区域的丢失是另一种故障，只有第二个区域才能防范这种情况。
Losing an entire region is a different failure, and only a second region protects against it.

3905
05:46:38,896 --> 05:46:46,096
最后一句确认了区域内的可用性不是问题。
The final sentence confirms that availability inside the region is not the problem.

3906
05:46:47,776 --> 05:46:48,996
第 19 题。
Question 19.

3907
05:46:49,296 --> 05:46:53,056
一个财务团队正在对比本地部署成本与 AWS 的成本。
A finance team is comparing on-premises costs with AWS.

3908
05:46:53,216 --> 05:47:01,476
它列出了数据中心租赁、每三年的服务器更换、安全运营团队以及冷却系统的电费账单。
It lists the data center lease, the three yearly server refresh, its security operations team, and the electricity bill for cooling.

3909
05:47:03,936 --> 05:47:07,140
这些中哪些在迁移后会完全消失？
Which of these disappear entirely after migrating?

3910
05:47:08,256 --> 05:47:09,156
选择两个。
Choose two.

3911
05:47:23,470 --> 05:47:27,716
关键词是“被消除”，而不是减少或转移。
The word doing the work is eliminated, not reduced, not shifted.

3912
05:47:27,982 --> 05:47:31,268
只有设施和硬件采购会完全消失。
Only the facilities and the hardware purchase disappear completely.

3913
05:47:32,302 --> 05:47:41,700
安全、培训和授权都会以某种形式继续存在，这就是为什么它们经常作为干扰项出现在这类题目中。
Security, training, and licensing all continue in some form, which is why they appear so often as distractors in this question shape.

3914
05:47:43,278 --> 05:47:44,228
第 20 题。
Question 20.

3915
05:47:45,646 --> 05:47:50,916
一名承包商需要在六周内获得读取一个 Amazon S3 存储桶中对象的临时权限。
A contractor needs temporary access to read objects in one Amazon S3 bucket for six weeks.

3916
05:47:51,406 --> 05:47:58,340
一名初级管理员建议附加管理员访问策略，因为这比编写特定内容更快。
A junior administrator proposes attaching the administrator access policy because it is quicker than writing something specific.

3917
05:47:59,374 --> 05:48:01,092
安全团队提出了反对意见。
The security team objects.

3918
05:48:01,710 --> 05:48:03,300
应该采取什么措施？
What should be done instead?

3919
05:48:14,094 --> 05:48:16,772
答案是 B，这是领域 2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

3920
05:48:17,294 --> 05:48:20,740
这门考试永远不会为了方便而牺牲最小权限原则。
This exam never rewards convenience over least privilege.

3921
05:48:21,968 --> 05:48:28,228
选项 A 和 D 是同样的错误，只是换了种说法，一个是直接授权，一个是通过组授权。
Options A and D are the same mistake wearing different clothes, one direct and one through a group.

3922
05:48:30,368 --> 05:48:32,996
选项 C 的情况值得明确说明。
And option C is worth stating plainly.

3923
05:48:33,870 --> 05:48:37,988
凭证绝不能与任何人共享，无论任何时长。
Rude credentials are never shared with anyone for any duration.

3924
05:48:39,598 --> 05:48:40,900
这是评分指南。
Here is the scoring guide.

3925
05:48:41,328 --> 05:48:44,900
领域 1 是第 2、7、11、15 和 19 题。
Domain 1 was questions 2, 7, 11, 15, and 19.

3926
05:48:45,248 --> 05:48:49,476
领域 2 是 3、6、9、12、17 和 20 题。
Domain 2 was 3, 6, 9, 12, 17, and 20.

3927
05:48:50,542 --> 05:48:55,012
领域 3 是 1、5、8、10、13、16 和 18 题。
Domain 3 was 1, 5, 8, 10, 13, 16, and 18.

3928
05:48:55,598 --> 05:48:57,412
领域 4 是 4 和 14 题。
Domain 4 was 4 and 14.

3929
05:48:58,318 --> 05:49:01,636
如果 20 题中答对 16 题或更多，就是一个稳妥的位置。
16 or more out of 20 is a comfortable position.

3930
05:49:02,126 --> 05:49:05,700
如果低于 12 分，在参加考试前先强化你最弱的领域。
Below 12, work your weakest domain before taking exam.

3931
05:49:06,542 --> 05:49:06,928
2.
2.

3932
05:49:08,334 --> 05:49:09,476
接下来该怎么做？
What to do next?

3933
05:49:09,888 --> 05:49:12,100
按领域评分，而不是看总分。
Score by domain rather than by total.

3934
05:49:12,368 --> 05:49:18,148
因为同一个领域错 2 个比分散在不同领域的 5 个更重要。只复习你最弱的那个领域。
Because 2 misses in one domain matters more than 5 spread evenly. Rewatch only your weakest domain.

3935
05:49:18,766 --> 05:49:23,428
不要立即参加考试 2，因为只有跨度足够大，第二次得分才有意义。
Do not take exam 2 immediately because the gap is what makes the second score meaningful.

3936
05:49:24,238 --> 05:49:30,020
并且复习所有你猜对的题目，因为蒙对的题是分数无法体现出的知识漏洞。
And review any question you guessed correctly, since a lucky guess is a gap the score cannot show you.

3937
05:49:34,062 --> 05:49:38,692
考试 2 涵盖的是完全不同的主题，而不是重复考这套卷子。
Exam 2 covers different topics entirely rather than retesting this paper.

3938
05:49:40,046 --> 05:49:41,252
练习考试 2。
Practice exam 2.

3939
05:49:42,128 --> 05:49:45,764
共 20 道题，没有任何题目会重复考试中的主题。
20 questions, none of them repeating a topic from exam.

3940
05:49:47,648 --> 05:49:52,068
1. 其中 3 道题是故意设计的、与你已经见过的题目非常相似的“孪生题”。
1. 3 of them are deliberate near twins of questions you have already seen.

3941
05:49:52,448 --> 05:49:56,228
情况相同，只是改变了一个细节，导致答案不同。
Same situation, one detail changed, different answer.

3942
05:49:57,102 --> 05:50:03,108
这三道题是本卷子中最有用的题目，因为它们在测试你是真的读懂了还是仅仅记住了。
Those three are the most useful questions in this paper because they test whether you read or whether you remembered.

3943
05:50:04,718 --> 05:50:07,268
遵循之前的规则，并增加一条：
Same rules as before with one addition.

3944
05:50:08,526 --> 05:50:13,252
只有在你已经攻克了考试 1 中最弱领域的情况下，才做这套卷子。
Only take this paper if you have already worked your weakest domain from exam 1.

3945
05:50:13,998 --> 05:50:17,892
否则，你只是在重复测量同样的漏洞，学不到任何东西。
Otherwise, you are measuring the same gap twice and learning nothing.

3946
05:50:18,574 --> 05:50:20,964
把你的答案写下来，并按领域评分。
Write your answers down and score by domain.

3947
05:50:21,966 --> 05:50:28,068
并且不要因为题目长得像就掉以轻心，因为这三道题看起来很像，但结果完全不同。
And resist recognizing a question shape because three of these look familiar and end differently.

3948
05:50:29,486 --> 05:50:33,488
把考试 1 的分数记在手边，以便最后进行对比。
Keep your exam one score to hand for the comparison at the end.

3949
05:50:34,862 --> 05:50:35,588
问题 1。
Question 1.

3950
05:50:36,526 --> 05:50:40,288
一家公司在 Amazon RDS for Postgres 上运行数据库。
A company runs a database on Amazon RDS for Postgres.

3951
05:50:42,478 --> 05:50:49,156
安全审计要求确认是谁负责给数据库引擎打补丁，以及谁负责给底层操作系统打补丁。
A security audit asks who applies patches to the database engine and who patches the underlying operating system.

3952
05:50:51,022 --> 05:50:54,820
它还询问谁负责管理数据库用户账户。
It also asks who manages database user accounts.

3953
05:50:55,790 --> 05:50:57,764
哪项陈述是正确的？
Which statement is correct?

3954
05:51:08,078 --> 05:51:10,448
答案是 A，这属于领域 2。
The answer is A and this is domain 2.

3955
05:51:10,670 --> 05:51:12,996
这是三道成对题目中的第一题。
This is the first of the three paired questions.

3956
05:51:13,518 --> 05:51:19,140
考试 1 中也问过关于 Lambda 的同样问题，答案也是由 AWS 来打补丁。
Exam 1 asked the same thing about Lambda, and the answer was also that AWS patches.

3957
05:51:19,950 --> 05:51:21,252
但原因不同。
But the reason differs.

3958
05:51:22,158 --> 05:51:25,648
对于 Lambda，你根本无法接触到操作系统。
With Lambda, there is no operating system you can reach at all.

3959
05:51:26,128 --> 05:51:31,172
而对于 RDS，存在操作系统，且作为托管服务的一部分由 AWS 进行打补丁。
With RDS, there is one and AWS patches it as part of the managed service.

3960
05:51:31,648 --> 05:51:35,620
无论哪种情况，数据库用户和访问控制始终由你负责。
Either way, database users and access control stay yours.

3961
05:51:37,358 --> 05:51:38,052
问题 2。
Question 2.

3962
05:51:39,182 --> 05:51:45,316
一家公司在分布于三个可用区的 15 个 Linux EC2 实例上运行一个文档管理应用程序。
A company runs a document management application on 15 Linux EC2 instances spread across three.

3963
05:51:46,702 --> 05:51:47,940
可用区。
Availability zones.

3964
05:51:48,208 --> 05:51:54,052
每个实例都必须读写同一组文件，且该程序要求挂载的文件系统路径。
Every instance must read and write the same set of files and the application expects a mounted file system path.

3965
05:51:54,958 --> 05:51:58,340
源代码不可获取且无法更改。
The source code is not available and cannot be changed.

3966
05:52:08,878 --> 05:52:12,004
答案是 C，这属于领域 3。
The answer is C and this is domain 3.

3967
05:52:12,398 --> 05:52:14,928
两个条款共同作用排除了 S3。
Two clauses work together to eliminate S3.

3968
05:52:15,406 --> 05:52:19,748
应用程序要求挂载的文件系统路径，且代码无法更改。
The application expects a mounted file system path and the code cannot be changed.

3969
05:52:20,558 --> 05:52:24,964
任何一个单独条件都可能让 S3 存在争议，但两者结合就排除了 S3。
Either alone might leave S3 arguable and together they close it.

3970
05:52:25,806 --> 05:52:32,388
接着，Linux 和跨区域的多个实例将 EFS 与 FSx 区分开来。
Then Linux and many instances across zones separates EFS from FSX.

3971
05:52:33,806 --> 05:52:34,596
问题 3。
Question 3.

3972
05:52:34,848 --> 05:52:42,052
一家零售商过去需要 11 周才能上线一个新的区域门店，其中大部分时间花在采购和安装服务器上。
A retailer used to take 11 weeks to launch a new regional storefront. Most of it spent procuring and installing servers.

3973
05:52:43,630 --> 05:52:46,820
最后四个门店中有两个在开业不到一年内就关闭了。
Two of the last four storefronts closed within a year of opening.

3974
05:52:47,694 --> 05:52:54,564
在 AWS 上，同样的上线流程现在只需 9 天，零售商也能更轻松地尝试新区域。
On AWS, the same launch now takes 9 days, and the retailer trials new regions far more readily.

3975
05:53:05,166 --> 05:53:09,028
答案是 B 敏捷性，这属于领域 1。
The answer is B Agility and this is domain one.

3976
05:53:09,966 --> 05:53:11,968
这是第二组成对问题。
This is the second paired question.

3977
05:53:13,518 --> 05:53:19,460
考试 1 中描述了一家容量随季节变化的医院，那是弹性。
Exam 1 described a hospital whose capacity moved with the seasons, and that was elasticity.

3978
05:53:19,888 --> 05:53:22,288
这个零售商的容量从不改变。
This retailer's capacity never changes.

3979
05:53:22,510 --> 05:53:26,660
变化的是上线时间，从 11 周缩短到了 9 天。
What changed is the time to launch from 11 weeks to 9 days.

3980
05:53:27,488 --> 05:53:29,252
敏捷性衡量的是时间。
Agility measures time.

3981
05:53:29,648 --> 05:53:31,876
弹性衡量的是容量。
Elasticity measures capacity.

3982
05:53:33,582 --> 05:53:36,388
识别出哪一个发生了变化是核心任务。
Leading which one moved is the whole task.

3983
05:53:38,094 --> 05:53:38,916
问题 4。
Question 4.

3984
05:53:39,502 --> 05:53:44,484
一款手游需要根据玩家标识符来存储玩家的库存信息。
A mobile game needs to store player inventories retrieved by player identifier.

3985
05:53:44,768 --> 05:53:53,924
开发人员预计会有 1 万到 500 万名玩家，无法预测增长曲线，且需要稳定的单位数毫秒级读取。
The developers expect between 10,000 and 5 million players, cannot predict the growth curve and need consistent single-digit millisecond reads.

3986
05:53:54,702 --> 05:54:00,484
没有连接查询，且团队不希望对数据库服务器进行扩容或管理。
There are no joins, and the team does not want to size or manage database servers.

3987
05:54:11,150 --> 05:54:13,732
答案是 C，这属于领域 3。
The answer is C, and this is domain 3.

3988
05:54:14,766 --> 05:54:19,908
有四个信号同时出现，将它们作为一个整体识别出来比逐一推理要快。
Four signals appear together, and recognizing them as a set is faster than reasoning through each.

3989
05:54:28,206 --> 05:54:30,805
还有通过单一标识符检索且无连接查询。
And retrieval by a single identifier with no joins.

3990
05:54:31,886 --> 05:54:34,948
这种组合正是 DynamoDB 的典型特征。
That combination is DynamoDB's signature.

3991
05:54:36,238 --> 05:54:37,124
问题 5。
Question 5.

3992
05:54:37,774 --> 05:54:42,500
一个运行在 EC2 实例上的应用程序需要将对象写入 S3 存储桶。
An application on an EC2 instance needs to write objects to an S3 bucket.

3993
05:54:42,862 --> 05:54:49,668
一名开发人员创建了一个 IAM 用户，生成了访问密钥，并将其保存在实例上的一个文件中。
A developer created an IAM user, generated access keys, and stored them in a file on the instance.

3994
05:54:50,190 --> 05:54:52,708
安全审查要求采用更好的方法。
A security review asks for a better approach.

3995
05:54:53,422 --> 05:54:55,168
公司应该怎么做？
What should the company do?

3996
05:55:05,582 --> 05:55:08,324
答案是 C，这属于领域 2。
The answer is C, and this is domain 2.

3997
05:55:08,928 --> 05:55:12,580
这是模块 23 中提到的「缓解与消除」模式。
This is the mitigate versus eliminate pattern from module 23.

3998
05:55:13,358 --> 05:55:18,660
三个选项让长期凭证更安全，而其中一个则完全消除了对它的需求。
Three options make the long-term credential safer, and one removes the need for it entirely.

3999
05:55:19,470 --> 05:55:30,756
选项 D 在这三个中是最巧妙的，因为虽然机密管理器确实是存放密钥的正确地方，但实例仍需要凭证来访问它。所以问题只是转移了位置。
Option D is the cleverest of the three because secrets manager is genuinely the right home for a secret, but the instance still needs credentials to reach it. So the problem has only moved.

4000
05:55:32,110 --> 05:55:33,088
问题 6。
Question 6.

4001
05:55:33,422 --> 05:55:36,848
一家研究机构在夜间处理基因组序列。
A research institute processes genome sequences overnight.

4002
05:55:37,102 --> 05:55:44,644
每个任务运行大约两个小时。这些任务是独立的，任何中途中断的任务都可以重新排队执行。
Each job runs for roughly two hours. The jobs are independent, and any job interrupted part way through can simply be stacked again.

4003
05:55:45,008 --> 05:55:49,668
结果需要在第二天早上 9 点前提供，且成本是首要考虑因素。
Results are needed by 9 the next morning, and cost is the primary concern.

4004
05:55:59,918 --> 05:56:02,916
答案是 B，这属于领域 4。
The answer is B, and this is domain 4.

4005
05:56:03,630 --> 05:56:09,968
Spot 实例需要满足三个条件才安全，而这个场景明确说明了每一项。任务是独立的。
Spot requires 3 things to be safe, and this scenario states each one deliberately. The jobs are independent.

4006
05:56:10,208 --> 05:56:17,124
中断的任务可以重新开始，且结果不需要在第二天早上 9 点前提供，因此延迟是可以接受的。
An interrupted job can be started again, and results are not needed until 9 the next morning, so delay is tolerable.

4007
05:56:18,062 --> 05:56:24,932
注意，2 小时的运行时间与 Spot 无关，尽管它会排除 Lambda 的可能性。
Note that the 2-hour runtime is irrelevant to Spot, though it would have ruled out Lambda.

4008
05:56:26,542 --> 05:56:27,460
问题 7。
Question 7.

4009
05:56:27,888 --> 05:56:33,348
一家公司在跨越 3 个可用区的单一区域运行其平台。
A company runs its platform in a single region across 3 availability zones.

4010
05:56:34,126 --> 05:56:41,892
可用性一直非常好，两年内没有发生过停机，欧洲和北美的用户都很满意。
Availability has been excellent with no outage in 2 years, and users in Europe and North America are satisfied.

4011
05:56:42,350 --> 05:56:47,488
东南亚的用户反映页面加载需要 4 到 6 秒。
Users in Southeast Asia report pages taking 4 to 6 seconds to load.

4012
05:56:47,982 --> 05:56:52,740
内容大部分是静态的，且对每个用户都相同。
The content is largely static and identical for every user.

4013
05:57:03,278 --> 05:57:05,732
答案是 C，这属于领域 3。
The answer is C, and this is domain 3.

4014
05:57:06,158 --> 05:57:09,380
这是第三组对比题，也是最有启发性的一个。
This is the third pair question and the most instructive.

4015
05:57:10,670 --> 05:57:14,244
题目 1 描述了同样的跨三个可用区的单一区域。
Exam 1 described the same single region across three zones.

4016
05:57:14,606 --> 05:57:19,492
但当时的监管机构询问如何应对该区域的故障，所以答案是第二个区域。
But its regulator asked about surviving the loss of that region, so the answer was a second region.

4017
05:57:20,430 --> 05:57:23,620
这里没有任何东西故障，其他地方的用户都很满意。
Here nothing has failed, and users elsewhere are happy.

4018
05:57:24,046 --> 05:57:26,564
这让它变成了距离问题，而不是可用性问题。
That makes it distance, not availability.

4019
05:57:26,990 --> 05:57:29,248
而距离意味着边缘站点。
And distance means edge locations.

4020
05:57:30,862 --> 05:57:31,808
问题 8。
Question 8.

4021
05:57:32,128 --> 05:57:40,516
一个团队每月发布一次大型更新，没有自动回滚功能，并且通过阅读单个服务器上的日志来诊断故障。
A team ships one large release each month, has no automated rollback, and diagnoses incidents by reading logs on individual servers.

4022
05:57:40,848 --> 05:57:48,868
它提议频繁部署小更变，编写回滚脚本，集中化日志，并在每次事故后进行审查。
It proposes to deploy small changes frequently, script its rollback, centralize logging, and hold a review after every incident.

4023
05:57:49,518 --> 05:57:52,420
不计划对应用程序架构进行任何更改。
No change to the application architecture is planned.

4024
05:58:02,862 --> 05:58:05,924
答案是 B，这是领域一。
The answer is B, and this is domain one.

4025
05:58:06,768 --> 05:58:12,516
卓越运营和可靠性之间的区别在于修复方案所在的位置。
The separator between operational excellence and reliability is where the fix lives.

4026
05:58:13,294 --> 05:58:17,796
可靠性通过改变架构来确保系统在故障时仍能生存。
Reliability changes the architecture so the system survives failure.

4027
05:58:18,702 --> 05:58:21,764
卓越运营是改变团队的工作方式。
Operational excellence changes how the team works.

4028
05:58:22,608 --> 05:58:29,988
这个列表中的每一项都是流程上的变化，而最后一句明确说明架构未动，从而排除了任何疑虑。
Every item on this list is a process change, and the final sentence removes any doubt by saying the architecture is untouched.

4029
05:58:31,598 --> 05:58:32,448
问题 9。
Question 9.

4030
05:58:32,768 --> 05:58:40,608
一家公司的安全团队收到警报，提示一个 EC2 实例正在与已知的僵尸网络地址建立外网连接。
A company security team is alerted that an EC2 instance is making outbound connections to a known botnet address.

4031
05:58:40,848 --> 05:58:45,636
同时，一个 IAM 访问密钥正被用于一个没有办公室的国家。
An IAM access key is also being used from a country with no offices.

4032
05:58:46,446 --> 05:58:52,708
团队需要一种能在实例上不安装任何内容的情况下自动识别这两类情况的服务。
The team wants a service that would surface both automatically with nothing installed on the instances.

4033
05:59:03,502 --> 05:59:05,892
答案是 B，这是领域 2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

4034
05:59:06,158 --> 05:59:11,076
这两个症状都是行为特征而非弱点，因此直接排除 Inspector。
Both symptoms are behaviors rather than weaknesses, which removes inspector immediately.

4035
05:59:11,248 --> 05:59:20,772
两者都不涉及数据内容，所以排除 多可用区。而且“在实例上不安装任何内容”这一短语起到了关键作用，因为 GuardDuty 在设计上就是无代理的。
Neither concerns data content, which removes Mickey. And the phrase nothing installed on the instances is doing deliberate work because guard duty is agentless by design.

4036
05:59:22,222 --> 05:59:23,076
问题 10。
Question 10.

4037
05:59:24,174 --> 05:59:30,564
一个 Amazon S3 存储桶策略在深夜某个时间点被更改过，并短暂允许了公共访问。
An Amazon S3 buckets policy was changed at some point overnight, briefly allowing public access.

4038
05:59:31,168 --> 05:59:37,252
公司需要确定是哪个 IAM 身份在什么时间进行了该更改。
The company needs to establish which IAAM identity made the change and at what time.

4039
05:59:37,488 --> 05:59:41,220
它已经启用了 CloudTrail、CloudWatch 和 Config。
It has Cloud Trail, CloudWatch, and Config all enabled.

4040
05:59:51,854 --> 05:59:54,692
答案是 C。这是领域 3。
The answer is C. And this is domain 3.

4041
05:59:55,278 --> 05:59:58,884
选项 B 是最接近的干扰项，值得仔细思考。
Option B is the closest miss and worth dwelling on.

4042
05:59:59,598 --> 06:00:06,212
Config 确实保留了历史记录，它能告诉你存储桶在两个时间戳之间处于公开状态。
Config genuinely holds the history, and it would tell you the bucket was public between two timestamps.

4043
06:00:06,702 --> 06:00:09,892
但它无法告诉你是谁操作的。
What it cannot tell you is who did it.

4044
06:00:10,830 --> 06:00:13,764
Config 回答的是配置是什么。
Config answers what the configuration was.

4045
06:00:15,150 --> 06:00:17,348
CloudRail 回答的是谁更改了它。
CloudRail answers who changed it.

4046
06:00:18,798 --> 06:00:19,728
问题 11。
Question 11.

4047
06:00:20,046 --> 06:00:24,612
一家公司运行着一个陈旧的自托管客户关系管理系统。
A company runs an aging self-hosted customer relationship management system.

4048
06:00:25,038 --> 06:00:33,764
该公司不打算迁移它，而是决定彻底取消它，并订阅一款作为 SaaS 提供的商业 CRM 产品。
Rather than move it, the company will cancel it entirely and subscribe to a commercial CRM product delivered as software as a service.

4049
06:00:34,606 --> 06:00:40,260
不会有任何代码被迁移，且公司将不再自行运行该软件。
No code will be migrated and the company will no longer run the software itself.

4050
06:00:50,958 --> 06:00:52,048
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

4051
06:00:52,208 --> 06:00:54,404
重新购买，这是领域一。
Repurchase, and this is domain one.

4052
06:00:54,768 --> 06:00:59,300
重构和重新购买都放弃了原有的系统，所以它们可以互换。
Refactor and repurchase both abandon the system you had, so they get swapped.

4053
06:01:02,702 --> 06:01:05,124
区分点在于之后的拥有权。
The separator is ownership afterwards.

4054
06:01:05,934 --> 06:01:08,580
重构意味着你重写它并且仍然拥有它。
Refactor means you rewrite it and still own it.

4055
06:01:10,126 --> 06:01:13,988
重新购买意味着你完全不再拥有软件，而是租用别人的。
Repurchase means you stop owning software at all and rent someone else's.

4056
06:01:15,694 --> 06:01:16,804
第12题。
Question 12.

4057
06:01:17,168 --> 06:01:24,356
银行必须将保护最敏感记录的密钥存储在硬件中。且不与其他AWS客户共享。
A bank must store the keys protecting its most sensitive records in hardware. No other AWS customer shares.

4058
06:01:24,928 --> 06:01:32,420
监管机构要求银行证明，在任何情况下AWS人员都无法访问密钥材料。
Its regulator requires the bank to demonstrate that AWS personnel cannot access the key material under any circumstances.

4059
06:01:33,390 --> 06:01:35,620
成本和运维工作是次要的。
Cost and operational effort are secondary.

4060
06:01:46,350 --> 06:01:48,900
答案是B，这是领域2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

4061
06:01:49,262 --> 06:01:55,908
通常情况下，关于密钥的问题选KMS是正确的，如果没有明确理由就选择CloudHSM则是错误的。
KMS is normally the right answer for keys, and choosing CloudHSM without a stated reason would be wrong.

4062
06:01:56,462 --> 06:01:58,724
而在这里，原因被明确提到了两次。
Here, the reason is stated twice over.

4063
06:01:59,470 --> 06:02:06,180
硬件、不与其他客户共享，以及AWS人员无法访问密钥材料。
Hardware, no other customer shares, and AWS personnel unable to access the key material.

4064
06:02:07,022 --> 06:02:12,036
这两项条款的存在正是为了让CloudHSM成为正确选项。
Those two clauses exist precisely to make Cloud HSM correct.

4065
06:02:13,518 --> 06:02:14,468
第13题。
Question 13.

4066
06:02:16,590 --> 06:02:24,580
一个订单服务写入订单，然后依次调用库存服务、支付服务和通知服务。
An order service writes an order, then calls a stock service, a payment service, and a notification service one after another.

4067
06:02:25,198 --> 06:02:30,148
当通知服务变慢时，订单提交会超时，导致客户放弃。
When the notification service is slow, order submissions time out and customers give

4068
06:02:30,208 --> 06:02:37,988
公司希望订单提交能立即返回，并保证后续的下游工作一定会执行。
up. The company wants order submission to return immediately with downstream work guaranteed to happen afterwards.

4069
06:02:48,270 --> 06:02:51,076
答案是B，这是领域3。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

4070
06:02:52,174 --> 06:02:55,364
这两个要求共同精准描述了一个队列。
The two requirements together describe a queue precisely.

4071
06:02:56,238 --> 06:03:02,724
立即返回意味着调用者不必等待，而保证后续执行意味着工作不能丢失。
Return immediately means the caller must not wait, and guaranteed afterwards means the work must not be lost.

4072
06:03:03,502 --> 06:03:06,308
缓冲加上持久化就是SQS。
Buffering plus persistence is SQS.

4073
06:03:07,246 --> 06:03:12,260
对比一下考试1中的第16题，那里强调的是排序和重试。
Compare it with question 16 in exam 1, where ordering and retree is made it.

4074
06:03:12,608 --> 06:03:14,276
那时候选步骤函数。
Step functions instead.

4075
06:03:15,758 --> 06:03:16,836
第14题。
Question 14.

4076
06:03:17,088 --> 06:03:26,308
财务总监想要一份报告，显示上季度AWS支出按六个部门划分，每个部门都在同一个组织下的独立账号中。
A finance director wants a report showing last quarter's AWS spend broken down by six departments, each with its own AWS account under one organization.

4077
06:03:26,958 --> 06:03:34,768
另外，如果任何部门的预测支出显示本月将超过其配额，总监要求立即收到邮件通知。
Separately, the director wants an email as soon as any department's forecast spend indicates it will exceed its allocation this month.

4078
06:03:34,990 --> 06:03:35,716
选择两个。
Choose two.

4079
06:03:46,318 --> 06:03:49,732
答案是A和B，这是领域四。
The answers are A and B, and this is domain four.

4080
06:03:50,094 --> 06:03:52,004
按时间排序即可解决。
Sort by time and it resolves.

4081
06:03:52,448 --> 06:03:57,668
上季度的支出是回顾性的，对应的是按关联账户分组的成本管理器。
Last quarter spend is backward looking, which is cost explorer grouping by linked account.

4082
06:03:58,190 --> 06:04:03,012
超过分配额度的预测是前瞻性的，对应的是预算。
A forecast crossing an allocation is forward looking, which is budgets.

4083
06:04:03,950 --> 06:04:12,388
选项 D 是一个强有力的干扰项，因为它也会发送关于支出的邮件，但只有在支出异常时才会发送，而不是在超出计划时。
Option D is the sharp distractor because it also emails about spend, but only when spend is unusual rather than when it crosses a plan.

4084
06:04:13,966 --> 06:04:14,848
第 15 题。
Question 15.

4085
06:04:15,118 --> 06:04:26,116
迁移已经完成。基础设施已构建并投入运行，但运维团队从未运行过云环境，他们担心失去专业能力，且没有培训计划。
A migration has stored. The infrastructure is built and working, but the operations team has never run a cloud environment, is anxious about losing its expertise, and has no training program.

4086
06:04:26,766 --> 06:04:29,668
这属于哪个云采用框架视角？
Which CAF perspective does this belong to?

4087
06:04:40,206 --> 06:04:41,568
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

4088
06:04:42,048 --> 06:04:44,164
人员，这是领域一。
People and this is domain one.

4089
06:04:45,166 --> 06:04:53,028
选项 A 是故意设置的陷阱，因为题干明确提到了运维团队，而且确实有一个运维视角。
Option A is deliberate bait because the stem literally says operations team and there is an operations perspective.

4090
06:04:53,488 --> 06:04:55,844
但要看真正的差距在哪里。
But read what the gap actually is.

4091
06:04:56,334 --> 06:04:59,488
“从未运行过云环境”属于技能差距。
Never run a cloud environment is a skills gap.

4092
06:05:00,046 --> 06:05:03,812
“担心失去专业能力”是变更管理方面的差距。
Anxious about losing expertise is a change management gap.

4093
06:05:04,238 --> 06:05:06,372
“没有培训计划”是培训方面的差距。
No training program is a training gap.

4094
06:05:06,702 --> 06:05:08,208
这三项都属于人员范畴。
All three are people.

4095
06:05:09,902 --> 06:05:10,785
第 16 题。
Question 16.

4096
06:05:11,408 --> 06:05:15,088
一家拥有 90 个 AWS 账号的公司有一条规则：
A company with 90 AWS accounts has a rule.

4097
06:05:15,342 --> 06:05:23,492
任何试图在欧盟以外的区域创建资源的账户，只要它不在其研究组织单位内，都不被允许。
No account outside its research organizational unit may create resources in regions beyond the European Union, whoever attempts it.

4098
06:05:24,206 --> 06:05:31,268
一些账户拥有具有完整 IAM 权限的本地管理员，且该限制不得由他们移除。
Several accounts have local administrators with full IAM permissions, and the restriction must not be removable by them.

4099
06:05:41,902 --> 06:05:46,500
答案是 B，这是领域 2。这两个条款共同起作用。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2. Two clauses work together.

4100
06:05:47,008 --> 06:05:50,788
“无论谁尝试”以及“不能由本地管理员移除”。
Whoever attempts it and not removable by local administrators.

4101
06:05:51,246 --> 06:05:59,008
任何在 IAM 中构建的内容都可以被拥有 IAM 权限的人撤销，这排除了选项 A 和 D。
Anything built inside IAAM can be undone by someone with IAAM permissions, which eliminates options A and D.

4102
06:05:59,758 --> 06:06:01,700
服务控制策略 处于上层。
An SCP sits above.

4103
06:06:02,286 --> 06:06:07,716
它具有全面约束力，甚至能约束成员账号的根用户。
IAM entirely and binds even the root user of a member account.

4104
06:06:08,974 --> 06:06:09,988
第 17 题。
Question 17.

4105
06:06:10,542 --> 06:06:16,868
一家公司运行一个通过 UDP 通信并要求极低延迟的多人游戏服务器。
A company runs a multiplayer game server communicating over UDP and requiring extremely low latency.

4106
06:06:17,358 --> 06:06:22,768
它的客户端配置了固定 IP 地址，除非更新客户端否则无法更改。
Its clients are configured with fixed IP addresses that cannot be changed without a client update.

4107
06:06:22,958 --> 06:06:26,372
它需要将连接分发到许多后端实例。
It needs to distribute connections across many backend instances.

4108
06:06:36,814 --> 06:06:39,492
答案是 B，这是领域 3。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

4109
06:06:40,174 --> 06:06:46,244
出现了三个共同特征：UDP，而应用负载均衡器根本无法承载 UDP，
Three signatures appear together UDP, which the application load balancer cannot carry at all,

4110
06:06:47,022 --> 06:06:48,516
极低延迟，
extreme low latency,

4111
06:06:49,614 --> 06:06:54,244
还有固定 IP 地址，这是只有网络负载均衡器提供的。
and fixed IP addresses, which only the network load balancer provides.

4112
06:06:54,830 --> 06:06:57,984
这三个中的任何一个单独出现就足够了。
Any one of the three would be enough on its own.

4113
06:06:59,022 --> 06:07:00,036
第 18 题。
Question 18.

4114
06:07:00,366 --> 06:07:07,460
一名财务经理询问，为什么 AWS 能提供比公司在自家数据中心更低的价格。
A finance manager asks why AWS can offer lower prices than the company achieves in its own data center.

4115
06:07:08,064 --> 06:07:11,812
AWS 也需要购买硬件、电力和网络设备。
AWS also has to buy hardware, power, and networking.

4116
06:07:12,334 --> 06:07:18,532
架构师解释说，AWS 在采购时整合了大量客户的使用需求。
An architect explains that AWS combines the usage of very large numbers of customers when it purchases.

4117
06:07:29,038 --> 06:07:32,260
答案是 B，这是领域一。
The answer is B, and this is domain one.

4118
06:07:33,934 --> 06:07:39,396
架构师的那句话几乎逐字逐句对应“规模经济”的定义。
The architect's sentence is the definition of economies of scale almost word for word.

4119
06:07:39,982 --> 06:07:43,012
跨客户的聚合就是其中的机制。
Aggregation across customers is the mechanism.

4120
06:07:43,598 --> 06:07:50,564
要注意通常伴随出现的干扰项，比如与竞争对手的价格匹配和免费套餐。
Watch for the distractors that usually accompany it, which are price matching against competitors and the free tier.

4121
06:07:51,438 --> 06:07:53,764
这两者都不是规模经济。
Neither is economies of scale.

4122
06:07:55,246 --> 06:07:56,132
第 19 题。
Question 19.

4123
06:07:56,784 --> 06:08:02,404
一家拥有 600 名员工的工程公司已经在本地运行 Microsoft Active Directory。
An engineering firm of 600 staff already runs Microsoft Active Directory on premises.

4124
06:08:04,014 --> 06:08:08,004
它正在开设 18 个 AWS 账户，每个项目一个。
It is opening 18 AWS accounts, one per project.

4125
06:08:08,718 --> 06:08:14,404
员工应使用现有的公司凭证登录他们有权访问的任何账户。
Staff should sign in to whichever accounts they are entitled to using existing corporate credentials.

4126
06:08:15,246 --> 06:08:19,812
身份团队拒绝在每个账户中维护独立的凭证。
The identity team refuses to maintain separate credentials in each account.

4127
06:08:30,382 --> 06:08:33,156
答案是 C，这是领域二。
The answer is C, and this is domain two.

4128
06:08:33,744 --> 06:08:38,180
三个不同的信号指向同一个方向：18 个账户而不是一个。
Three separate signals point the same way, 18 accounts rather than one.

4129
06:08:39,406 --> 06:08:41,060
现有的公司目录。
An existing corporate directory.

4130
06:08:42,670 --> 06:08:45,508
以及明确拒绝重复凭证。
And an explicit refusal to duplicate credentials.

4131
06:08:45,966 --> 06:08:48,100
选项 B 是群体陷阱。
Option B is the population trap.

4132
06:08:48,974 --> 06:08:56,036
Cognito 服务于你应用程序的客户，而这 600 人是登录 AWS 系统本身的员工。
Cognito serves your application's customers, and these 600 people are staff signing in to AWS itself.

4133
06:08:57,584 --> 06:08:58,692
第 20 题。
Question 20.

4134
06:08:59,024 --> 06:09:04,196
一家公司必须运行一个需要不受支持的操作系统版本的遗留应用程序。
A company must run a legacy application requiring an unsupported operating system version.

4135
06:09:04,384 --> 06:09:09,764
它需要对调优后的内核参数具有管理权限，并且必须持续运行。
It needs administrative access to tuned kernel parameters and must run continuously.

4136
06:09:10,224 --> 06:09:12,676
哪种 AWS 计算选项是合适的？
Which AWS compute option is suitable.

4137
06:09:22,990 --> 06:09:25,732
答案是 C，这是领域三。
The answer is C and this is domain 3.

4138
06:09:26,350 --> 06:09:30,468
这门考试的大部分题目都是奖励选择更具托管性的服务。
Most of this exam rewards choosing the more managed service.

4139
06:09:30,704 --> 06:09:33,504
所以这个问题刻意反其道而行。
So this question deliberately goes the other way.

4140
06:09:34,030 --> 06:09:46,212
提到内核参数和不受支持的操作系统，从定义上就排除了托管服务，因为移除这些权限正是让一个服务成为“托管”的关键所在。
Naming kernel parameters and an unsupported operating system eliminates managed services by definition because removing that access is exactly what makes a service managed.

4141
06:09:47,918 --> 06:09:49,316
这是评分指南。
Here is the scoring guide.

4142
06:09:50,944 --> 06:09:56,004
领域 1 是第 3、8、11、15 和 18 题。
Domain 1 was questions 3, 8, 11, 15, and 18.

4143
06:09:56,544 --> 06:10:01,028
领域 2 是 1、5、9、12、16 和 19 题。
Domain 2 was 1, 5, 9, 12, 16, and 19.

4144
06:10:01,584 --> 06:10:06,180
领域 3 是 2、4、7、10、13、17 和 20 题。
Domain 3 was 2, 4, 7, 10, 13, 17, and 20.

4145
06:10:07,184 --> 06:10:09,220
领域 4 是 6 和 14 题。
Domain 4 was 6 and 14.

4146
06:10:10,190 --> 06:10:16,612
特别注意第 1、3 和 7 题，这些是考试中的成对近义词题。
And pay particular attention to questions 1, 3 and 7, which were the paired near-quins of exam.

4147
06:10:17,294 --> 06:10:17,764
1。
1.

4148
06:10:18,446 --> 06:10:22,916
漏掉这些特定题目意味着你只是在识别题型，而不是在阅读细节。
Missing those specifically means you recognize the shape rather than reading the detail.

4149
06:10:24,590 --> 06:10:25,732
下一步该做什么？
What to do next?

4150
06:10:27,534 --> 06:10:34,756
对比两份试卷的领域得分，而不是总分，因为两个试卷中都薄弱的领域才是你的真实短板。
Compare domain scores across both papers rather than the totals, because a domain weak in both is your real gap.

4151
06:10:35,406 --> 06:10:41,572
有所提高的领域可能是知识盲点，而没有改进的则更可能是阅读习惯问题。
A domain that improved was probably a knowledge gap, while one that did not is more likely a reading habit.

4152
06:10:42,350 --> 06:10:44,068
在考试前留出几天时间。
Leave several days before exam.

4153
06:10:44,366 --> 06:10:55,716
3，因为间隔后的记忆是预测能否通过的关键。用这段间隔来练习模块 21 的混淆对题。如果两份试卷得分都在 16 以上，就花时间去练模块 22。
3 because recall after a gap is what predicts a pass. Use that gap for module 21, the confusion pairs. And if both papers scored above 16, spend the time on module 22 instead.

4154
06:10:57,038 --> 06:10:58,500
最后一次模拟考试。
The last practice exam.

4155
06:10:59,022 --> 06:11:02,372
包含 20 道前两份试卷都没涉及到的主题题。
20 questions on topics neither of the first two papers touched.

4156
06:11:02,862 --> 06:11:08,420
这里的低分意味着真正的知识盲点，而不是你已经知道但没做对的内容的重复。
A poor score here is a genuine gap rather than a repeat of something you already know you missed.

4157
06:11:09,422 --> 06:11:14,372
最后的评分指南是基于三份试卷的整体趋势，而不仅仅是这一份。
The scoring guide at the end reads the trend across all three papers rather than just this one.

4158
06:11:15,534 --> 06:11:17,316
开始前有四件事要注意。
Four things before you start.

4159
06:11:17,710 --> 06:11:19,652
在考试后几天再做这个。
Take this several days after exam.

4160
06:11:19,920 --> 06:11:23,684
2。因为间隔后的记忆是预测能否通过的关键。
2. Because recall after a gap is what predicts a pass.

4161
06:11:23,920 --> 06:11:27,620
按领域再次计分，并把之前的两份分数放在手边。
Score by domain again and keep both previous scores to hand.

4162
06:11:27,920 --> 06:11:32,644
这里的每个主题都是新的，所以答错意味着真正的盲点，而不是重复错误。
Every topic here is new, so weak answers are real gaps rather than repeats.

4163
06:11:33,550 --> 06:11:36,004
而且不要在考试前一晚做这个。
And do not take this the night before your exam.

4164
06:11:36,240 --> 06:11:41,668
那时候得分不理想会影响睡眠，而且也没法及时补救任何新知识。
A poor score at that point costs you sleep and teaches you nothing you can add on in time.

4165
06:11:43,278 --> 06:11:43,972
第 1 题。
Question 1.

4166
06:11:44,494 --> 06:11:48,292
一名分析师需要回答偶尔出现的即时问题。
An analyst needs to answer occasional ad hoc questions.

4167
06:11:49,102 --> 06:11:54,884
大约两年的应用程序日志文件已经以压缩文本的形式存储在 Amazon S3 中。
About two years of application log files already sitting in Amazon S3 as compressed text.

4168
06:11:55,630 --> 06:11:59,428
这些问题可能一个月才出现两次，且每次都不一样。
The questions arise perhaps twice a month and are different each time.

4169
06:12:00,430 --> 06:12:05,156
公司不想运行基础设施，也不想把数据加载到任何地方。
The company does not want to run infrastructure or load the data into anything.

4170
06:12:15,726 --> 06:12:18,640
答案是 B，这是领域 3 的题目。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

4171
06:12:18,894 --> 06:12:20,800
有三个短语指向同一个方向。
Three phrases point the same way.

4172
06:12:21,040 --> 06:12:25,956
数据已经存在于 S3 中。问题是偶尔出现的，且每次都不一样。
The data already sits in S3. The questions are occasional and different each time.

4173
06:12:26,734 --> 06:12:28,900
而且不需要基础设施，也不需要加载。
And no infrastructure and no loading.

4174
06:12:29,806 --> 06:12:34,084
Athena 查询就在位，无需配置任何东西，并且按查询次数计费。
Athena query is in place, provisions nothing, and charges per query.

4175
06:12:34,990 --> 06:12:41,252
Redshift 是一个你需要加载并持续运行的数据仓库，这不符合每月两次的成本模式。
Redshift is a warehouse you load and keep running, which is the wrong shape of cost for twice a month.

4176
06:12:42,542 --> 06:12:43,300
题目 2。
Question 2.

4177
06:12:43,726 --> 06:12:52,740
一家公司在 Amazon EC2 实例上运行应用程序。一名审计员询问谁负责对这些实例上的客户操作系统进行安全补丁更新。
A company runs an application on Amazon EC2 instances. An auditor asks who applies security patches to the guest operating system on those instances.

4178
06:12:52,960 --> 06:12:56,516
还询问谁负责处理数据中心中损坏的磁盘驱动器。
It also asks who destroys failed disk drives in the data center.

4179
06:12:56,960 --> 06:12:58,404
哪项陈述是正确的？
Which statement is correct?

4180
06:13:09,070 --> 06:13:11,680
答案是 A，这是领域 2。
The answer is A, and this is domain 2.

4181
06:13:11,920 --> 06:13:21,120
这个问题完成了贯穿三份试卷的一组题目。考试 1 考查 Lambda，考试 2 考查 RDS，而这一题考查 EC2。
This question completes a set running across all three papers. Exam 1 asked about Lambda, exam 2 about RDS, and this one about EC2.

4182
06:13:21,390 --> 06:13:25,444
在这三个例子中，随着服务管理程度降低，补丁更新的责任划分也会随之变化。
In all three, the patching answer moves as the service becomes less managed.

4183
06:13:26,094 --> 06:13:31,204
而在所有三个例子中，物理安全和硬件处理始终由 AWS 负责。
And in all three, physical security and hardware handling stayed with AWS.

4184
06:13:31,440 --> 06:13:34,404
有些界限在变动，而有些则永远不变。
Some of the line moves, some of it never does.

4185
06:13:35,950 --> 06:13:36,708
题目 3。
Question 3.

4186
06:13:37,774 --> 06:13:44,484
一家支付公司正在设计一个服务，如果整个可用区不可用，该服务必须继续正常处理。
A payments company is designing a service that must continue processing correctly if an entire availability zone becomes unavailable.

4187
06:13:45,998 --> 06:13:49,348
它必须在没有工程师干预的情况下恢复到全部容量。
It must return to full capacity without an engineer intervening.

4188
06:13:49,870 --> 06:13:51,556
它部署在三个
It is deploying across three

4189
06:13:52,334 --> 06:13:57,920
可用区，并带有健康检查和故障实例的自动更换。
availability zones with health checks and automatic replacement of failed instances.

4190
06:14:08,302 --> 06:14:12,068
答案是 D。可靠性，这是领域 1。
The answer is D. Reliability, and this is domain one.

4191
06:14:13,838 --> 06:14:17,796
两个短语几乎逐字对应定义。
Two phrases decided almost word for word from the definition.

4192
06:14:18,382 --> 06:14:24,164
“继续正常处理”以及“在没有工程师干预的情况下恢复到全部容量”。
Continue processing correctly and return to full capacity without an engineer intervening.

4193
06:14:26,414 --> 06:14:26,960
选项
Option

4194
06:14:28,366 --> 06:14:29,924
A 是值得注意的。
A is worth noticing.

4195
06:14:30,990 --> 06:14:35,940
“支付”这个词会让安全性看起来相关，而且在现实生活中确实如此。
The word payments make security feel relevant and it would be in real life.

4196
06:14:36,430 --> 06:14:40,452
但考试考核的是明确要求的条款，而不是所属行业。
But the exam grades the stated requirement, not the industry.

4197
06:14:42,094 --> 06:14:43,012
题目 4。
Question 4.

4198
06:14:43,280 --> 06:14:49,508
一个安全团队发现一个单一的 IP 地址在反复扫描公司的公共 Web 服务器。
A security team has identified a single IP address repeatedly scanning a company's public web servers.

4199
06:14:49,840 --> 06:14:55,044
它希望在流量到达 Web 子网中的任何实例之前，就拦截来自该地址的所有流量。
It wants to block all traffic from that address before it reaches any instance in the web subnet.

4200
06:14:55,758 --> 06:15:03,012
这些实例已经有安全组允许来自任何地方的 HTTP 和 HTTPS 访问。
The instances already have security groups permitting HTTP and HTTPS from anywhere.

4201
06:15:13,582 --> 06:15:16,240
答案是B，这是domain 4。
The answer is B, and this is domainly.

4202
06:15:17,038 --> 06:15:18,692
有一个事实决定了整个题目。
One fact decides this entirely.

4203
06:15:19,438 --> 06:15:25,092
安全组只包含允许规则，所以用它们来拦截特定地址是不可能的。
Security groups have allowed rules only, so blocking a specific address is impossible with them.

4204
06:15:26,510 --> 06:15:27,040
选项分析。
Options.

4205
06:15:28,686 --> 06:15:34,756
A和D描述的功能并不存在，这是值得识别的一种干扰项风格。
A and D both describe capabilities that do not exist, which is a distractor style worth recognizing.

4206
06:15:35,150 --> 06:15:40,400
而C是过度纠正，为了阻止一个地址而封锁所有人。
And option C is the overcorrection, blocking everyone to stop one address.

4207
06:15:41,870 --> 06:15:42,788
第5题。
Question 5.

4208
06:15:43,150 --> 06:15:53,828
一家医疗机构在多个Amazon S3存储桶中持有数百万个对象，但不知道哪些包含带有个人身份信息的患者记录。
A healthcare provider holds several million objects across many Amazon S3 buckets and does not know which contain patient records with personally identifiable information.

4209
06:15:54,320 --> 06:15:58,468
监管机构要求其识别并分类这些数据。
A regulator has asked it to identify and classify that data.

4210
06:15:59,440 --> 06:16:03,652
它想要一个托管服务，而不是自己构建扫描系统。
It wants a managed service rather than building its own scanning.

4211
06:16:14,094 --> 06:16:16,900
答案是C，这是领域2。
The answer is C, and this is domain 2.

4212
06:16:17,520 --> 06:16:25,764
“个人身份信息”加上“S3”就是MECI的特征，而且MECI是唯一能打开你数据的检测服务。
Personally identifiable information plus S3 is the MECI signature, and MECI is the only one of the detection services that opens your data.

4213
06:16:26,606 --> 06:16:28,640
选项D是一个具有启发性的错误项。
Option D is the instructive miss.

4214
06:16:29,710 --> 06:16:38,788
Security Hub是一个真正有用的服务，但聚合层取决于其下层的技术。因此它们很少是这类发现类问题的答案。
Security Hub is a genuinely useful service, but aggregation layers depend on the layers beneath them. So they are rarely the answer to a discovery question.

4215
06:16:40,302 --> 06:16:41,440
第6题。
Question 6.

4216
06:16:41,840 --> 06:16:48,644
一家公司为了提供其代码产品，已经连续运行同一组12个VC2实例长达5年。
A company has run the same fleet of 12 VC2 instances continuously for 5 years to serve its code product.

4217
06:16:49,040 --> 06:16:53,604
实例类型没有改变，且至少在未来3年内不会改变。
The instance type has not changed and will not change for at least 3 more years.

4218
06:16:53,920 --> 06:16:58,180
它想要尽可能大的折扣，并且不需要灵活性。
It wants the largest possible discount and has no need for flexibility.

4219
06:17:08,910 --> 06:17:12,772
答案是C，这是领域4。
The answer is C, and this is domain 4.

4220
06:17:13,646 --> 06:17:16,612
每一个条款都在支持最大程度的承诺。
Every clause argues for maximum commitment.

4221
06:17:17,806 --> 06:17:22,852
有5年的历史记录，预计再用3年，且不需要灵活性。
5 years of history, 3 more expected, and no need for flexibility.

4222
06:17:24,014 --> 06:17:28,452
选项B是一个具有启发性的错误项，因为“可转换”听起来更安全。
Option B is the instructive miss because convertible sounds safer.

4223
06:17:28,974 --> 06:17:31,200
灵活性不是免费的。
Flexibility is not free.

4224
06:17:31,726 --> 06:17:37,796
你为了获得更改的权利而放弃折扣，而这家公司已经告诉你它不会做出更改。
You give up discount to buy the right to change, and this company has told you it will not change.

4225
06:17:39,200 --> 06:17:40,240
第7题。
Question 7.

4226
06:17:40,480 --> 06:17:45,120
一家物流公司收到数千份扫描后的PDF格式送货单。
A logistics company receives thousands of scanned delivery notes as PDF files.

4227
06:17:45,280 --> 06:17:53,700
它需要从名称字段中提取数值到结构化记录中，然后判断自由文本驱动的评论是否包含投诉。
It needs to extract values from name fields into a structured record, then determine whether the free text driver comments indicate a complaint.

4228
06:17:54,318 --> 06:17:58,564
它没有机器学习专家，且只想要托管服务。
It has no machine learning specialists and wants managed services only.

4229
06:17:59,886 --> 06:18:00,612
选择两个。
Choose two.

4230
06:18:11,150 --> 06:18:13,892
答案是B和C，这是领域3。
The answers are B and C and this is domain 3.

4231
06:18:14,318 --> 06:18:20,804
从文档中提取文本和理解文本是两项不同的任务，没有任何单一服务能同时完成这两项。
Getting text out of a document and understanding the text are two different jobs, and no single service does both.

4232
06:18:22,926 --> 06:18:26,308
Textract负责提取，然后Comprehend负责解读。
Text tract, extracts, then comprehend interprets.

4233
06:18:27,310 --> 06:18:31,408
选项A是给那些认为扫描就是图像的人设下的陷阱。
Option A is the trap for anyone reasoning that a scan is an image.

4234
06:18:31,502 --> 06:18:33,252
所以识别服务处理不了它。
So recognition handles it.

4235
06:18:33,888 --> 06:18:38,116
识别功能寻找的是物体和面孔，而不是表单字段。
Recognition finds objects and faces, not form fields.

4236
06:18:39,918 --> 06:18:40,928
第8题。
Question 8.

4237
06:18:41,168 --> 06:18:43,248
一个云项目正在进行中。
A cloud program is underway.

4238
06:18:43,568 --> 06:18:51,556
财务部门发现团队可以在没有批准的情况下配置资源，且无法将支出归属到具体的业务单元。
Finance has discovered teams can provision resources without approval and there is no way to attribute spend to business units.

4239
06:18:51,808 --> 06:18:56,580
首席风险官无法证明监管义务正在被跟踪。
The chief risk officer cannot show regulatory obligations are tracked.

4240
06:18:57,168 --> 06:19:01,316
哪种云采用框架视角涵盖了这些问题？
Which CAF perspective covers these concerns?

4241
06:19:12,048 --> 06:19:16,132
答案是C，治理，这是领域一。
The answer is C, governance, and this is domain one.

4242
06:19:16,928 --> 06:19:21,700
来自两个不同高管的两个问题，都落在了同一个视角中。
Two concerns from two different executives and both land in the same perspective.

4243
06:19:22,608 --> 06:19:26,276
没有归属权的失控支出属于成本管理。
Uncontrolled spend with no attribution is cost management.

4244
06:19:26,848 --> 06:19:30,692
跟踪监管义务属于风险和合规性管理。
Tracking regulatory obligations is risk and compliance management.

4245
06:19:31,502 --> 06:19:36,900
选项B是模式匹配陷阱，因为首席风险官听起来像是安全相关。
Option B is the pattern matching trap because a chief risk officer sounds like security.

4246
06:19:37,248 --> 06:19:40,068
要看题目要求什么，而不是谁在提问。
Read what is being asked for, not who is asking.

4247
06:19:41,646 --> 06:19:42,468
第9题。
Question 9.

4248
06:19:42,862 --> 06:19:50,948
一名外部审计师要求提供证据，证明托管公司工作负载的数据中心符合ISO 27001标准。
An external auditor wants evidence that the data centers hosting a company's workloads meet ISO 27001.

4249
06:19:51,328 --> 06:19:55,364
他还要求提供AWS最新的SOC2报告。
It also wants AWS's most recent SOC2 report.

4250
06:19:55,918 --> 06:19:58,852
该公司无法检查任何AWS设施。
The company cannot inspect any AWS facility.

4251
06:20:09,568 --> 06:20:12,484
答案是A，这是领域2。
The answer is A, and this is domain 2.

4252
06:20:12,928 --> 06:20:19,728
每当审计师询问关于共享责任模型中AWS负责的那部分时，你都无法亲自去检查。
Whenever an auditor asks about AWS's half of the shared responsibility model, you cannot inspect it yourself.

4253
06:20:19,968 --> 06:20:23,588
所以你需要用AWS自己的审计报告来提供证据。
So you evidence it with AWS's own audit reports.

4254
06:20:24,142 --> 06:20:25,808
这些内容就在Artifact中。
Those live in artifact.

4255
06:20:26,368 --> 06:20:32,548
选项B和D都涉及你负责的那部分，这就是为什么它们都没用。
Options B and D both look at your half of the model, which is why neither can help.

4256
06:20:34,094 --> 06:20:34,820
第10题。
Question 10.

4257
06:20:35,246 --> 06:20:40,772
一个位于可用区中的EC2实例有一个存放应用程序数据的EBS卷。
An EC2 instance in one availability zone has an EBS volume holding application data.

4258
06:20:42,446 --> 06:20:49,604
公司正在进行高可用性重新设计，需要在另一个可用区的新实例上挂载一个相同的卷。
The company is redesigning for high availability and needs an identical volume attached to a new instance in a different availability zone.

4259
06:20:50,126 --> 06:20:52,324
数据必须被复制过去。
The data must be copied across.

4260
06:21:02,688 --> 06:21:06,288
答案是B，这是领域3。
The answer is B and this is domain 3.

4261
06:21:06,528 --> 06:21:11,620
选项 C 值得提一下，因为它是一个用真实词汇拼凑出来的虚构功能。
Option C is worth naming because it is a fabricated feature built from real vocabulary.

4262
06:21:13,102 --> 06:21:19,620
多可用区是 RDS 的真实 AWS 术语，而不是 EBS 卷的。
Multi-availability zone is a genuine AWS term that belongs to RDS, not to EBS volumes.

4263
06:21:20,238 --> 06:21:27,172
如果某个选项描述的是你从未遇到过的功能，就要怀疑它是编造出来的，除非你漏掉了什么。
If an option describes a feature you have never encountered, suspect invention before, assuming you missed something.

4264
06:21:28,846 --> 06:21:29,732
第 11 题。
Question 11.

4265
06:21:31,054 --> 06:21:36,420
在迁移前的调研过程中，一家公司发现了一个内部报告工具。
During a discovery exercise before a migration, a company finds an internal reporting tool.

4266
06:21:37,070 --> 06:21:42,468
它已经 16 个月没有人登录，没有所有者，也没有出现在服务目录中。
It has no logins for 16 months, no owner, and no entry in the service catalog.

4267
06:21:43,182 --> 06:21:45,348
构建它的团队在两年前就离开了。
The team that built it left two years ago.

4268
06:21:45,774 --> 06:21:47,408
该工具应该如何处理？
What should be done with it?

4269
06:21:57,742 --> 06:21:58,848
答案是 C。
The answer is C.

4270
06:21:59,168 --> 06:22:01,284
退役。这是领域一。
Retire. And this is domain one.

4271
06:22:01,728 --> 06:22:03,648
「退役」是人们采取的策略。
Retire is the strategy people.

4272
06:22:04,654 --> 06:22:12,484
完全忘记它。调研活动经常发现，大约有十分之一的资产处于无人使用的状态。
Forget is the strategy at all. Discovery exercises routinely find that around a tenth of an estate runs with nobody using it.

4273
06:22:13,006 --> 06:22:16,068
关掉这些服务是成本最低的迁移结果。
Switching those off is the cheapest possible migration outcome.

4274
06:22:16,974 --> 06:22:23,652
「保留」是干扰项，区分点在于保留需要明确的理由来继续保留某项内容。
Retain is the distractor, and the separator is that retaining requires a stated reason to keep something.

4275
06:22:25,294 --> 06:22:26,208
第 12 题。
Question 12.

4276
06:22:26,542 --> 06:22:31,012
一家公司在应用负载均衡器后面运行一个公共 Web 应用程序。
A company runs a public web application behind an application load balancer.

4277
06:22:31,408 --> 06:22:39,428
它的日志显示，有人多次尝试通过搜索表单注入 SQL 语句，还有较少数量的跨站脚本攻击。
Its logs show repeated attempts to inject SQL statements through the search form and a smaller number of cross site scripting attempts.

4278
06:22:39,968 --> 06:22:43,332
它希望在这些请求到达应用程序之前就将其拦截。
It wants these requests blocked before they reach the application.

4279
06:22:53,934 --> 06:22:57,028
答案是 B，这是领域 2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

4280
06:22:57,518 --> 06:22:58,720
动词决定了答案。
The verb decides it.

4281
06:22:58,880 --> 06:23:02,660
「拦截」是一个保护性动词，能立刻排除掉其他选项。
Blocked is a protection verb which removes guard duty immediately.

4282
06:23:03,040 --> 06:23:06,320
然后根据层级在不同的防护服务之间做选择。
Then the layer decides between the protection services.

4283
06:23:06,640 --> 06:23:13,892
SQL 注入和跨站脚本攻击存在于请求内容中，只有 WAF 能读取这些内容。
SQL injection and cross-site scripting live inside the request content, which only WAF can read.

4284
06:23:14,638 --> 06:23:18,372
Shield 处理的是流量和网络。
Shield handles volume and a network.

4285
06:23:19,680 --> 06:23:22,820
ACL 只看 IP 地址和端口。
ACL only sees addresses and ports.

4286
06:23:24,558 --> 06:23:25,476
第 13 题。
Question 13.

4287
06:23:25,760 --> 06:23:30,320
一家公司已经扩张到跨多个团队的 55 个 VPC。
A company has grown to 55 VPCs across many teams.

4288
06:23:30,574 --> 06:23:35,140
他们越来越需要彼此之间以及与企业数据中心进行通信。
They increasingly need to communicate with each other and with the corporate data center.

4289
06:23:35,440 --> 06:23:42,020
网络团队维护着数量不断增加的独立对等连接，并希望有一个统一的地方来管理这些。
The network team maintains a steadily growing number of individual peering connections and wants one place to manage this.

4290
06:23:52,622 --> 06:23:55,236
答案是 B，这是领域 3。
The answer is B and this is domain 3.

4291
06:23:55,600 --> 06:24:01,636
关键点在于数量不断增长的独立对等连接，因为这描述的是一种网状网络。
The deciding phase is a steadily growing number of individual peering connections because that describes a mesh.

4292
06:24:03,150 --> 06:24:08,080
55 个完全对等连接的 VPC 将需要超过一千个连接。
55 VPCs fully peered would need well over a thousand connections.

4293
06:24:08,814 --> 06:24:13,668
Transit Gateway 用枢纽取代了网状网络，所以每个 VPC 只需连接一次。
Transit gateway replaces the mesh with a hub, So each VPC connects once.

4294
06:24:14,510 --> 06:24:16,836
选项 C 又是名称冲突的问题。
Option C is the name collision again.

4295
06:24:18,160 --> 06:24:19,300
第 14 题。
Question 14.

4296
06:24:19,694 --> 06:24:25,920
一家公司在查看庞大的 AWS 账单时，发现传输到互联网用户的数据产生了高额费用。
A company reviewing a large AWS bill finds significant charges for data transferred to users on the internet.

4297
06:24:26,320 --> 06:24:29,860
在两个区域之间复制数据还会产生额外费用。
There are further charges for data replicated between two regions.

4298
06:24:30,160 --> 06:24:35,492
一位经理建议减少上传到 AWS 的数据量会有所帮助。
A manager suggests reducing the volume of data uploaded into AWS would help.

4299
06:24:35,920 --> 06:24:37,348
这位经理说得对吗？
Is the manager correct?

4300
06:24:47,950 --> 06:24:50,564
答案是 B，这是领域 4。
The answer is B, and this is domain 4.

4301
06:24:50,960 --> 06:24:56,164
有三个选项把传输规则写反了，这是计费类问题的常见套路。
Three options state a transfer rule backwards, which is the standard shape for pricing questions.

4302
06:24:56,654 --> 06:24:58,500
但仔细看看选项 D。
But look carefully at option D.

4303
06:24:58,894 --> 06:25:03,140
它正确地指出经理是错的，但随后用一个错误的论据来支撑这个结论。
It correctly says the manager is wrong, then justifies it with a false claim.

4304
06:25:04,110 --> 06:25:09,124
跨区域传输是收费的，而公司正是为这项费用买单。
Transfer between regions is charged and the company is paying for exactly that.

4305
06:25:09,742 --> 06:25:14,468
判断正确但理由错误，依然算错题。
A right verdict, supported by a wrong reason, is still a wrong answer.

4306
06:25:15,758 --> 06:25:16,800
第 15 题。
Question 15.

4307
06:25:17,040 --> 06:25:27,748
一家准备迁出数据中心的公司每三年采购一次大型硬件，并支付固定的年度租赁费。它还必须提前 18 个月决定容量。
A company preparing to leave its data center makes a large hardware purchase every three years and pays a fixed annual lease. It must also decide capacity 18 months in advance.

4308
06:25:28,000 --> 06:25:33,796
迁移后，它期望按实际消耗量每月付费，无需预先购买。
After migrating, it expects to pay monthly for what it actually consumes with no advance purchase.

4309
06:25:44,526 --> 06:25:47,428
答案是 B，这是领域 1。
The answer is B, and this is domain 1.

4310
06:25:48,078 --> 06:25:50,884
整个场景只描述了支付方式，没别的。
The whole scenario describes payments and nothing else.

4311
06:25:51,598 --> 06:25:55,588
从大额预付转变为按实际消耗量计费。
A large advance purchase becomes monthly charges that follow consumption.

4312
06:25:56,078 --> 06:26:01,764
选项 C 很诱人，因为提前 18 个月决定容量听起来速度变快了。
Option C is the tempting one because deciding capacity 18 months ahead sounds slow.

4313
06:26:02,318 --> 06:26:08,388
但场景里从未提到任何东西变快了，只是钱的支付形式变了。
But the scenario never says anything got faster, only that the money changed shape.

4314
06:26:09,600 --> 06:26:10,852
第 16 题。
Question 16.

4315
06:26:11,280 --> 06:26:17,444
一个组织运行 60 个 AWS 账户，每个账户都启用了 GuardDuty、Inspector 和 Macie。
An organization runs 60 AWS accounts, each with guard duty, inspector, and messi enabled.

4316
06:26:17,760 --> 06:26:22,916
安全团队通过依次登录每个账户来查看结果，这耗费了整整一周时间。
The security team reviews findings by signing in to each account in turn, which takes most of a week.

4317
06:26:23,120 --> 06:26:28,132
它想要一个包含所有结果的统一视图，并根据 CIS 基准来衡量资产情况。
It wants one view of all findings and to measure the estate against the CIS benchmark.

4318
06:26:38,510 --> 06:26:41,892
答案是 B，这是领域 2。
The answer is B, and this is domain 2.

4319
06:26:42,318 --> 06:26:47,748
对比一下这套题中的第 5 题，那时候 Security Hub 是错误选项。
Compare this with question 5 in this same paper where Security Hub was the wrong answer.

4320
06:26:48,224 --> 06:26:52,804
在那道题里，没有任何东西在产生结果，所以聚合也就没什么可聚合的了。
There, nothing was producing findings, so aggregation had nothing to aggregate.

4321
06:26:53,582 --> 06:27:00,772
这里，三个检测服务已经运行在 60 个账户中，唯一的问题是把它们整合在一起。
Here, three detection services already run across 60 accounts, and the only problem is seeing them together.

4322
06:27:01,294 --> 06:27:03,780
这正是“聚合”功能发挥作用的地方。
That is exactly when aggregation is right.

4323
06:27:05,454 --> 06:27:06,436
第 17 题。
Question 17.

4324
06:27:08,014 --> 06:27:16,068
一个平台团队正在使用大量的现有 Kubernetes 清单来运行容器化服务，并打算继续保留这些清单。
A platform team runs containerized services using a large library of existing Kubernetes manifests it intends to keep.

4325
06:27:17,038 --> 06:27:21,412
他们不再对任何 EC2 实例进行补丁更新、调整大小或管理。
It will no longer patch, size, or manage any EC2 instances.

4326
06:27:21,998 --> 06:27:25,828
他们希望 AWS 来运行控制平面和计算资源。
It wants AWS to run both the control plane and the compute.

4327
06:27:29,326 --> 06:27:30,064
选择两个。
Choose two.

4328
06:27:40,878 --> 06:27:43,972
答案是 B 和 C，这是第三个领域。
The answer is B and C and this is domain three.

4329
06:27:44,624 --> 06:27:47,812
两个分离点，分别由一个条款决定。
Two separations, each decided by one clause.

4330
06:27:48,224 --> 06:27:56,388
Kubernetes 清单决定选择 EKS 而非 ECS。不再进行补丁或调整实例大小则决定选择 Fargate 而非 EC2。
Kubernetes manifest decide EKS over ECS. No longer patching or sizing instances decides Fargate over EC2.

4331
06:27:57,454 --> 06:28:00,100
选项 E 在现实生活中是为镜像需要的。
Option E is needed in real life for the images.

4332
06:28:00,304 --> 06:28:04,484
但在这里它是错误的，因为题目问的是编排和计算。
And it is wrong here because the question asks about orchestration and compute.

4333
06:28:06,094 --> 06:28:07,024
第 18 题。
Question 18.

4334
06:28:07,278 --> 06:28:13,156
一家公司希望对其主要工作负载进行符合 AWS 最佳实践的结构化审查。
A company wants a structured review of its main workload against AWS best practices.

4335
06:28:13,504 --> 06:28:21,060
它将回答一系列关于工作负载的问题，获得一份优先改进计划，并每季度重复一次该过程。
It will answer a set of questions about the workload, receive a prioritized improvement plan, and repeat the exercise each quarter.

4336
06:28:21,870 --> 06:28:26,180
它不想要一个只是持续监控账户的服务。
It does not want a service that simply watches the account continuously.

4337
06:28:36,846 --> 06:28:39,620
答案是 B，这是第一个领域。
The answer is B, and this is domain one.

4338
06:28:41,422 --> 06:28:46,948
最后一句的存在纯粹是为了排除 顾问，它是这里最强的干扰项。
The final sentence exists purely to eliminate trusted advisor, which is the strongest distractor here.

4339
06:28:47,598 --> 06:28:51,108
两个服务都会告诉你需要改进什么，区别在于“如何”去执行。
Both services tell you what to improve, and the separator is how.

4340
06:28:52,526 --> 06:28:56,164
Well-architected 工具是一个你坐下来完成的审查过程。
The well-architected tool is a review you sit down and complete.

4341
06:28:57,102 --> 06:29:01,348
顾问 在不被要求的情况下持续监控账户。
Trusted advisor watches the account continuously without being asked.

4342
06:29:02,862 --> 06:29:03,908
第 19 题。
Question 19.

4343
06:29:04,224 --> 06:29:07,264
一个安全团队被审计员提出了两个问题。
A security team is asked two questions by an auditor.

4344
06:29:07,504 --> 06:29:12,612
“是否有任何 S3 存储桶或 IAM 角色与组织外部的账户共享？”
Are any S3 buckets or IAM roles shared with an account outside the organization?

4345
06:29:12,944 --> 06:29:17,828
“以及哪些 IAM 角色和访问密钥在过去 90 天内未被使用？”
And which IAAM roles and access keys have not been used in the last 90 days?

4346
06:29:18,144 --> 06:29:20,836
该团队想要一个能同时回答这两个问题的单一服务。
The team wants a single service that answers both.

4347
06:29:31,534 --> 06:29:32,644
答案是 B。
The answer is B.

4348
06:29:33,006 --> 06:29:34,276
这是第二个领域。
And this is domain 2.

4349
06:29:35,022 --> 06:29:38,244
审计师的两个问题精准对应这两项功能。
The auditor's two questions map precisely onto the two things.

4350
06:29:39,022 --> 06:29:40,388
Access Analyzer 可以做到这一点。
Access analyzer does.

4351
06:29:41,198 --> 06:29:44,292
外部访问发现和未使用的访问发现。
External access findings and unused access findings.

4352
06:29:44,750 --> 06:29:46,340
选项 C 需要注意一下。
Option C deserves a note.

4353
06:29:47,246 --> 06:29:53,604
CloudTrail 虽然保留了证据，但你必须分析 90 天的日志才能提取出来。
Cloud Trail does hold the evidence, but you would have to analyze 90 days of logs to extract it.

4354
06:29:54,254 --> 06:29:56,644
优先选择最符合题目要求的服务。
Prefer the service designed for the question.

4355
06:29:58,286 --> 06:29:59,428
第 20 题。
Question 20.

4356
06:29:59,950 --> 06:30:03,172
一家公司正在发布其网站的新版本。
A company is releasing a new version of its website.

4357
06:30:03,438 --> 06:30:10,212
它希望有 5% 的访问者跳转到新版本，95% 的访客保留在当前版本，以便对比错误率。
It wants 5% of visitors sent to it and 95% kept on the current version to compare error rates.

4358
06:30:10,464 --> 06:30:14,628
两个版本都在同一个区域的各自负载均衡器后面运行。
Both versions run behind their own load balancers in the same region.

4359
06:30:25,216 --> 06:30:27,844
答案是 B，这是领域 3。
The answer is B, and this is domain 3.

4360
06:30:28,016 --> 06:30:34,916
明确的百分比划分始终是加权路由，但注意最后一句：两个版本都在同一个区域运行。
A stated percentage split is always weighted routing, but notice the final sentence that both versions run in the same region.

4361
06:30:35,616 --> 06:30:43,684
这一条款存在的唯一目的就是排除基于延迟的路由，因为两个端点都在同一个区域，不存在可以操作的延迟差异。
That clause exists only to eliminate latency based routing because with both endpoints in one region there is no latency difference to act on.

4362
06:30:44,096 --> 06:30:48,612
题目中的场景经常会加入一个专门用来排除掉一个错误选项的条款。
Scenarios often add a clause whose sole job is closing off one wrong answer.

4363
06:30:50,126 --> 06:30:52,096
这是最后的评分指南。
Here is the final scoring guide.

4364
06:30:52,526 --> 06:30:57,348
领域 1 是第 3、8、11、15 和 18 题。
Domain 1 was questions 3, 8, 11, 15, and 18.

4365
06:30:57,776 --> 06:31:01,284
领域 2 是 2、5、9、12、16 和 19。
Domain 2 was 2, 5, 9, 12, 16, and 19.

4366
06:31:01,742 --> 06:31:05,776
领域 3 是 1、4、7、10、13、17 和 20。
Domain 3 was 1, 4, 7, 10, 13, 17, and 20.

4367
06:31:06,286 --> 06:31:08,100
领域 4 是 6 和 14。
Domain 4 was 6 and 14.

4368
06:31:09,136 --> 06:31:17,348
在所有三份试卷中，领域的分布是 15、18、21 和 6，这与即将到来的真实考试非常接近。
Across all three papers, the domain split is 15, 18, 21, and 6, which lands within a point of the real exams waiting.

4369
06:31:19,022 --> 06:31:21,220
如何综合阅读这三份试卷。
How to read all three papers together.

4370
06:31:21,902 --> 06:31:25,700
在这些题目中取得进步意味着你的知识盲区已经通过学习和复习补齐了。
Improving across them means your gaps where knowledge and revision worked.

4371
06:31:26,254 --> 06:31:30,308
如果分数平稳，通常意味着是阅读习惯问题，而不是知识储备不足。
Flat across them usually means a reading habit rather than a knowledge gap.

4372
06:31:30,606 --> 06:31:32,356
所以去重温模块 23。
So rewatch module 23.

4373
06:31:33,296 --> 06:31:42,948
只有在三个试卷中都有一个领域较弱时，才需要改变你的计划，并且你应该只攻克那个领域，其他都不管了。每份试卷拿到 16 分或更多就是很稳妥的情况。
One domain weak in all three is the only result that should change your plan and you should work that domain and nothing else. 16 or more on each paper is a comfortable position.

4374
06:31:43,216 --> 06:31:47,812
而且如果错题分布均匀，通常意味着是节奏问题而非知识问题。
And misses spread evenly usually mean pace rather than knowledge.

4375
06:31:49,518 --> 06:31:50,820
这就是整个课程的内容。
That is the whole course.

4376
06:31:51,726 --> 06:31:55,684
共 26 个模块，如果能记住一个核心观点，就应该是这个。
26 modules, and if one idea survives, it should be this one.

4377
06:31:56,496 --> 06:32:01,604
你不需要了解关于 AWS 的所有内容，参加这个考试的人也没人知道全部。
You are not trying to know everything about AWS, and nobody sitting this exam does.

4378
06:32:02,336 --> 06:32:07,332
你的目标是利用题目中的一个词来区分两个看起来都正确的选项。
You are trying to separate two options that both look right using one word in the question.

4379
06:32:08,270 --> 06:32:11,616
在考试前的几天重温模块 21，
Rewatch module 21 in the days before you sit,

4380
06:32:12,302 --> 06:32:17,156
重新阅读在范围内的清单，按照你练习过的流程去操作，祝你好运。
reread the in scope list, pass the procedure you have practiced, and good luck.

